RADAR_LOAD("2026-11",[{"id":"10.1039/d6cy01626j","t":"Ceria and manganese modification of plate V2O5-MoO3/TiO2 catalyst to enhance toluene oxidation performance by electromagnetic induction heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6cy01626j","s":"Catalysis Science & Technology","d":"2026-11-25","f":"2026-11-25T20:29:02Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Commercial plate-type V2O5-Mo2O3/TiO2catalysts modified with Ce and Mn were successfully applied in the electromagnetic induced-assisted catalytic oxidation of toluene. The modified catalysts achieved excellent catalytic activity and stability in the...","au":["Yang Yu","Shaoyu Zhu","Yongheng Xiong","Huangang Shi","Jifa Qu","Wenyi Tan"],"o":"日常","why":["induction heating"],"zt":"通过电磁感应加热增强板状 V2O5-MoO3/TiO2 催化剂对甲苯氧化的性能：氧化铈和锰的改性","zb":"利用电磁感应辅助催化氧化甲苯，对商业板状 V2O5-MoO3/TiO2 催化剂进行 Ce 和 Mn 改性。改性后的催化剂在...中实现了优异的催化活性和稳定性。","ob":"其他催化反应"},{"id":"10.1021/acsnano.6c15253","t":"A Pd Single-Atom/Nanocluster Nanozyme Achieves High Dual Peroxidase- and Catalase-like Activities via Interlayer-Confined Oxygen-Species Spillover","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsnano.6c15253","s":"ACS Nano","d":"2026-11-25","f":"2026-11-25T20:29:02Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Abstract Nanozymes that reproduce the multienzyme antioxidant machinery of living tissue remain difficult to engineer because the atomic sites that most strongly activate H2O2 also bind the reaction intermediates too tightly to release them─a trade-off, rooted in the Sabatier principle, that often caps the activity of single-atom catalysts. Here, we report an atomically dispersed palladium nanozyme, Pd1+NPs/G, in which isolated Pd single atoms and ultrasmall Pd nanoclusters coexist on graphene oxide (GO) and propose, based on density functional theory (DFT) calculations and isotope labeling, that this architecture relieves this trade-off through an interlayer-confined hydroxyl (*OH) spillover mechanism. Prepared by atomic layer deposition, Pd1+NPs/G exhibits the highest mass-normalized peroxidase (POD)-like and catalase (CAT)-like activities among its single-atom (Pd1/G) and nanoparticle","au":["Jie Yang","Xixi Zhang","Qiang Zhang","Shichao Zhao","Yong Qin","Ruiping Zhang"],"o":"日常","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过层间受限的氧物种溢流实现高双过氧化物酶和过氧化氢酶活性的 Pd 单原子/纳米团簇纳米酶","zb":"利用原子层沉积制备了 Pd1+NPs/G 纳米酶，其中孤立的 Pd 单原子和超小 Pd 纳米团簇共存于氧化石墨烯上。DFT 计算表明，该结构通过层间受限的 *OH 溢流机制缓解了单原子催化剂的活性与中间体脱附之间的权衡。Pd1+NPs/G 表现出最高的质量归一化过氧化物酶和过氧化氢酶活性，比 Pd1/G 分别高出 18 倍和 8 倍。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.iecr.6c04245","t":"Interfacial Cu–O x Active Sites in Cu-CNT Aerogels Enable Enhanced Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.iecr.6c04245","s":"Industrial & Engineering Chemistry Research","d":"2026-11-25","f":"2026-11-25T05:25:39Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (eNO3RR) offers a promising strategy for simultaneous nitrate remediation and ammonia production, yet efficiently converting nitrate-derived intermediates into ammonia remains challenging for Cu-based catalysts. Herein, oxygen-functionalized carbon nanotubes (CNTs) were integrated into three-dimensional Cu aerogels via a reduction–gelation strategy to construct Cu-CNTs metal aerogels (Cu-CNTs MAs) featuring interfacial Cu–Ox environments. Compared with Cu MAs and physically mixed Cu MAs + CNTs, the integrated Cu-CNTs MAs exhibit improved Cu dispersion, enhanced surface accessibility, and more efficient charge transfer. The optimized catalyst achieves an NH3 production rate of 7.9 mg h–1 mgcat–1 at −1.0 V vs RHE and a maximum Faradaic efficiency of 82.0% at −0.9 V. After 8 h of electrolysis at −0.9 V, the catalyst reaches up to 95.7% ","au":["Senhao Wang","Jiao Shen","Zhun You","Zilu Liu","Yaoqi Huang","Shaojun Yuan"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"Cu-CNT气凝胶中界面Cu-Ox活性位点促进电化学硝酸盐还原制氨","zb":"通过还原-凝胶策略构建了具有界面Cu-Ox环境的Cu-CNTs金属气凝胶，优化催化剂在-1.0 V vs RHE下氨产率为7.9 mg h–1 mgcat–1，最大法拉第效率为82.0%。DFT计算表明界面电子转移促进了硝酸盐吸附，8小时电解后硝酸盐去除率达95.7%，氨选择性为77.3%。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142377","t":"Beyond M−Nx coordination: localized charge redistribution via Mo–Au d–d interaction for efficient electrochemical nitrogen reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142377","s":"Fuel","d":"2026-11-25","f":"2026-11-25T20:29:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Ling Ren","Zhiwei Wang","Xuening Zhang","Zhaoxi Ren","Rongjian Sa","Dong-Sheng Li"],"o":"日常","why":["electrochemical nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"超越 M−Nx 配位：通过 Mo–Au d–d 相互作用实现局部电荷重分布以促进高效电化学氮还原","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142344","t":"Role of ammonia decomposition rate modeling in predicting coupled chemical, electrochemical, and thermal behavior in ammonia-utilizing solid oxide fuel cells","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142344","s":"Fuel","d":"2026-11-25","f":"2026-11-26T04:59:04Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Özgür Aydın","Krystian Machaj"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"氨分解速率建模在预测氨利用固体氧化物燃料电池中耦合化学、电化学和热行为中的作用","ob":"氨分解制氢｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.3390/nano16231535","t":"A P25 Titanium Dioxide Immobilized Non-Noble Cu-Co Dual Active Sites Catalyst for Enhanced Hydrogen Evolution via Ammonia Borane Hydrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/nano16231535","s":"Nanomaterials","d":"2026-11-25","f":"2026-11-25T20:29:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Ammonia borane (AB) is a highly promising chemical hydrogen storage material. However, the development of efficient, low-cost, and stable catalysts remains a critical challenge for its practical application in hydrogen production via hydrolysis. In this study, a series of P25 titanium dioxide (P25) supported Cu-Co bimetallic catalysts (CuxCoy@P25) were prepared using a facile co-reduction method. The catalyst achieved the highest catalytic activity when the Cu/Co atomic ratio was about 1:1. The turnover frequency (TOF) value of Cu1Co1@P25 reached 90.9 min−1, which is 24.97 and 30.34 times higher than those of the single-metal catalysts, Cu1@P25 and Co1@P25. The results demonstrate a pronounced synergistic effect between Cu and Co. Further studies revealed that when 1.0 mol/L NaOH solution is used as the reaction medium, the catalytic efficiency of Cu1Co1@P25 is significantly enhanced, wi","au":["Xiang-Wei Guo","Jia-Yi Ren","Liu-Di Dang","Yi-Le Duan","Jing-Yi Zhang","Xin Rong"],"o":"日常","zt":"负载于 P25 二氧化钛的非贵金属 Cu-Co 双活性位点催化剂用于增强氨硼烷水解产氢","zb":"采用共还原法制备了负载于 P25 的 Cu-Co 双金属催化剂，Cu/Co 原子比约为 1:1 时活性最高，TOF 值达 90.9 min-1，比单金属催化剂高 24.97 和 30.34 倍；在 1.0 mol/L NaOH 溶液中，TOF 值提升至 130.5 min-1，超过 58% 的贵金属催化剂。","ob":"氨硼烷水解"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142280","t":"Unveiling the reaction conditions and structural design of Co3Mo3N for efficient chemical looping ammonia production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142280","s":"Fuel","d":"2026-11-24","f":"2026-11-24T21:13:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Yihan Zheng","Jiawei Lu","Abdul Hameed","Shengkai Dai","Guangliang Wang","Guoliang Chen"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"揭示 Co3Mo3N 用于高效化学链氨合成的反应条件与结构设计","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c07791","t":"Role of Interfacial Silica in the Local Structure, Strain, and Propane Dehydrogenation Activity of Dispersed Ga3+ Sites","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c07791","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-11-24","f":"2026-11-25T20:29:02Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":19,"ab":"Understanding the structure of the active sites in supported Ga-based propane dehydrogenation (PDH) catalysts is essential, as the Ga–O coordination environment and the nature of neighboring atoms (e.g., Al or Si from SiO2 or Al2O3 supports) strongly influence the catalytic properties. Here, we prepared Ga3+ sites dispersed on Al2O3 and SiOx-Al2O3 supports using atomic layer deposition, tailoring the thickness of the grown SiOx layer and the acidity at the Ga-SiOx-Al2O3 interface. Comparing the propene selectivity and Ga-normalized propene formation rates of the prepared materials reveals that, for the Al2O3 and SiOx-Al2O3 supports, catalytic activity first decreases as Si content increases, which correlates with a decrease in the relative abundance of weakly Lewis acidic tetracoordinate Ga3+ sites in the local coordination environment with Al3+ atoms ([4]Ga(Al) and [4]Ga(Al/Si) sites), ","au":["Melis Yarar","Zixuan Chen","Yu. G. Kolyagin","Olivier Lafon","Alexander V. Yakimov","Christophe Copéret"],"o":"日常","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"分散的 Ga3+ 位点在局部结构、应变和丙烷脱氢活性中的作用","zb":"利用原子层沉积在 Al2O3 和 SiOx-Al2O3 载体上制备分散的 Ga3+ 位点，通过调节 SiOx 层厚度和界面酸性，发现 Al2O3 和 SiOx-Al2O3 支撑的催化剂活性随 Si 含量增加而降低，主要归因于弱路易斯酸性四配位 Ga3+ 位点相对丰度的减少。相比之下，分散在 SiO2 上的 Ga3+ 位点表现出更高的活性，其特征是具有高丰度的与 Si4+ 原子配位的强路易斯酸性四配位 Ga3+ 位点。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsomega.6c10112","t":"Atomic Layer Deposition on Large-Scale Industrial Low-Density Cellulosic Foam for Water Repellency and Fire Protection","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsomega.6c10112","s":"ACS Omega","d":"2026-11-24","f":"2026-11-24T21:13:24Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract The building sector represents approximately 37% of global CO2 emissions. Therefore, there is a critical need to find alternative insulation materials for the building sector. Indeed, given the materials typically used for insulation, their manufacturing relies on industrial processes that are highly energy-intensive and consume nonrenewable resources. Biobased materials, such as cellulose low-density foams, have significant potential due to their high porosity, hygrometric transpiration, and thermal insulation. However, they remain highly sensitive to water and lack good fire behavior. This study therefore focuses on improving the properties of cellulose foams through an Al2O3 treatment obtained via atomic layer deposition (ALD) in a pilot-scale reactor. It has been demonstrated that this treatment functionalizes the surface of the fiber in the entire foam, imparts good hydroph","au":["Chloé Parisi","Loïc Dumazert","Rodolphe Sonnier","Erwan Gicquel","Elisabeth Blanquet","Julien Bras"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zb":"针对建筑保温材料对生物基纤维素低密度泡沫进行原子层沉积（ALD）处理，以改善其疏水性和防火性能。研究表明，Al2O3 层在纤维表面形成疏水层，使水接触角达到 130°，且两年后仍保持良好疏水性，同时不改变其吸湿性能。PCFC 和锥形量热仪测试显示，ALD 涂层显著降低了引燃温度，并有效限制了热传递和阴燃，证明了纳米级 Al2O3 层对纤维素泡沫耐水和耐火性能的显著提升。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.9766022","t":"Cascade Electrosynthesis of Aryl Imides and Sulfonimides From N2 via Integrated Nitrogen Fixation and C─N/S─N Bond Formation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.9766022","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-24","f":"2026-11-25T20:29:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"A one-pot cascade electrochemical strategy directly links N 2 fixation with C─N/S─N bond formation. By suppressing ammonia formation, electrochemically generated Li 3 N is preserved as the cascade intermediate and intercepted by acyl/sulfonyl chlorides, enabling value-added imide and sulfonimide synthesis from N 2 . ABSTRACT Direct synthesis of organonitrogen compounds from dinitrogen (N 2 ) remains a formidable challenge because N 2 -to-C─N bond formation requires nitrogen fixation to be coupled with selective functionalization of N 2 -derived intermediates before their termination as ammonia. Herein, we report a cascade electrochemical strategy that converts N 2 into aryl imides and aryl sulfonimides in a gas-diffusion electrochemical flow cell. Under proton-donor-free conditions, electrochemically generated Li 3 N is intercepted by acyl or sulfonyl chlorides, enabling one-pot synthesi","au":["Weijian Yang","Jing‐Ao Fan","Limei Tian","Zijian Zhao","Tinghao Wu","Dan‐Dan Zhai"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过集成氮固定和 C─N/S─N 键形成从 N2 级联电合成芳基酰亚胺和磺酰亚胺","zb":"开发了一种一锅法级联电化学策略，直接将 N2 固定与 C─N/S─N 键形成联系起来。在无质子供体条件下，电化学生成的 Li3N 被酰基/磺酰氯捕获，实现了从 N2 一锅合成芳基酰亚胺和磺酰亚胺，产率高达 57%。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.3390/app162311618","t":"Multi-Timescale Coordinated Optimization of an Integrated Electricity–Hydrogen–Ammonia Production System with Hybrid Hydrogen-Electricity Energy Storage","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/app162311618","s":"Applied Sciences","d":"2026-11-24","f":"2026-11-26T04:59:04Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Driven by global net-zero goals, the integrated electricity–hydrogen–ammonia system provides a pathway for coordinating renewable energy utilization with green chemical production. To address dynamic mismatch and control heterogeneity between electrical and chemical units, this paper presents a coupled multi-energy model and a multi-timescale scheduling strategy. First, nonlinear electrolyzer conversion, part-load ammonia auxiliary consumption and equipment degradation costs are incorporated into the hydrogen–electricity hybrid storage model. Then, a two-stage optimization architecture is designed: day-ahead mixed-integer programming for unit commitment, and intra-day CNN-LSTM dynamic rolling optimization. Finally, grid-connected and off-grid tests using normalized public load and photovoltaic profiles examine the coordinated operation of the system. Results show that all four grid-conne","au":["Zhengjian Chen","Shihao Zhu","Fulin Fan","Jingran Zhang","Jiang Qin","Kai Song"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"混合氢电储能的电力-氢-氨一体化生产系统多时间尺度协同优化","zb":"为解决电化学与化学单元间的动态不匹配和控制异质性，本文提出耦合多能模型和多时间尺度调度策略。研究将非线性电解槽转化、部分负荷氨辅助消耗和设备降解成本纳入氢电混合储能模型，设计了日前混合整数规划和日内CNN-LSTM动态滚动优化架构。结果表明，四种并网案例均满足每日200 kg的氨输送要求，运行余幅在-491.84至859.68 CNY/天之间，三种四小时离网案例在测试条件下均能维持氨生产且无拉闸限电。"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c04940","t":"Interfacial Electronic Coupling of Iron Nanoclusters on Cobalt-Modified Black Phosphorus for Electrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c04940","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2026-11-24","f":"2026-11-24T21:13:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Sluggish N2 activation and competing hydrogen evolution continue to limit electrochemical nitrogen reduction (ENRR). The chemically active P framework of black phosphorus (BP) provides a platform for constructing metal–P interfaces with tunable electronic structures. Here, few-layer BP supports with differentiated surface states were prepared by incorporating Co during electrochemical exfoliation, followed by Fe electrodeposition under identical conditions. The optimized catalyst exhibited smaller and more uniformly distributed Fe nanoclusters and the strongest Fe–P electronic coupling within the series. It delivered an NH3 yield rate of 10.30 ± 0.20 μg h–1 cm–2 and a Faradaic efficiency of 9.66 ± 0.41% at −0.40 V (vs RHE). The spectroscopic results were consistent with electron transfer from Fe to P and the formation of relatively electron-deficient Fe and electron-enriched P e","au":["Qiuju Tao","Jin Wan","Chuanzhen Feng","Kaiwen Bo","Qi Lan","Huijuan Zhang"],"o":"日常","why":["Electrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction"],"zt":"铁纳米团簇在钴改性黑磷上的界面电子耦合用于电催化氮还原","zb":"通过电化学剥离制备了具有不同表面状态的少层黑磷，随后在相同条件下电沉积铁纳米团簇。优化后的催化剂表现出最强的 Fe–P 界面电子耦合，在 −0.40 V 下实现了 10.30 ± 0.20 μg h–1 cm–2 的 NH3 产率速率和 9.66 ± 0.41% 的法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158665","t":"TPMS-based reformer for ammonia decomposition: Effect of Ni/Al2O3 catalyst thickness on heat and mass transfer for Schwarz-P topology","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158665","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-11-24","f":"2026-11-24T21:13:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Viacheslav Papkov","Leonid Tartakovsky","Dmitry Pashchenko"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"基于 TPMS 的重整器用于氨分解：Schwarz-P 拓扑下 Ni/Al2O3 催化剂厚度对传热传质的影响","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.est.2026.125896","t":"Interfacial reconstruction of spent graphite anodes through polydopamine coating and flash Joule heating for fast and stable lithium storage","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.est.2026.125896","s":"Journal of Energy Storage","d":"2026-11-24","f":"2026-11-24T06:57:23Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Mengge Xing","Hao Zhang","Qi Zhang","Liangyuan Cheng","Yuan Feng","Longhao Rao"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"通过聚多巴胺涂层和闪蒸焦耳热对废旧石墨阳极进行界面重构用于快速且稳定的锂存储","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.79871","t":"Defect‐Engineered 2D Conductive Metal–Organic Frameworks with Interlayer Dislocations for Rapid and Selective Room‐Temperature Ammonia Sensing","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.79871","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-24","f":"2026-11-24T21:13:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT The inherent poor conductivity and limited active sites of conventional metal‐organic frameworks (MOFs) severely constrain their application in chemiresistive gas sensing. Herein, we overcome these limitations by developing a two‐dimensional conductive MOF (2D c‐MOF), Mg 3 (HITP) 2 (HITP = 2,3,6,7,10,11‐hexaaminotriphenylene), featuring a unique interlayer misalignment and a high density of defect sites. This unique architecture is achieved through a synthetic strategy that leverages the competitive coordination between acetate (CH 3 COO − ) and HITP ligands toward Mg 2+ ions. The resulting material exhibits exceptional room‐temperature NH 3 sensing performance, delivering a high sensitivity to ppm‐level NH 3 , outstanding selectivity ( S NH3 /S gas >50), rapid response/recovery kinetics (12/20 s), and remarkable long‐term stability. The enhanced performance is attributed to the","au":["Rui Zhang","Yuan Ren","Zejun Han","Jiawei Wu","Jingjing Wang","Qiongfeng Shi"],"o":"日常","zt":"具有层间位错的缺陷工程 2D 导电金属有机框架用于快速且选择性的室温氨气传感","zb":"通过利用乙酸根和 HITP 配体对 Mg2+ 离子的竞争配位策略，开发了一种具有独特层间错位和高密度缺陷位点的二维导电 MOF (Mg3(HITP)2)。该材料在室温下表现出卓越的 NH3 传感性能，对 ppm 级 NH3 具有高灵敏度、优异的选择性 (S_NH3/S_gas >50)、快速的响应/恢复动力学 (12/20 s) 和卓越的长期稳定性。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1002/admt.71490","t":"Three‐Dimensional Carbon‐Based Microdevices With Surface‐Normal Electrodes for Tunable Low‐Voltage Joule Heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/admt.71490","s":"Advanced Materials Technologies","d":"2026-11-23","f":"2026-11-23T22:40:32Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"ABSTRACT Realizing well‐defined 3D micro‐architectures with integrated nanomaterials while maintaining structural integrity and reliable electrical interfacing remains a critical challenge in microdevice engineering. Here, we report a 3D carbon‐based microdevice consisting of a carbon nanotube/graphene nanoplatelet (CNT/GNP) network integrated with surface‐normal electrodes, fabricated via a paraffin‐assisted intaglio strategy, to enhance electrical performance and tunability for Joule heating applications. Selective removal of the sacrificial paraffin matrix enhances electrical conductivity, and incorporation of GNPs at an optimized content suppresses network shrinkage, yielding a stable and continuous carbon network. The surface‐normal electrodes provide contact along the trench sidewalls, and devices with this configuration exhibit lower total resistance than corresponding devices wit","au":["Seokwon Joo","Yang‐Hu Park","Yoon‐Kyu Song","Ju‐Hyung Kim"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"具有表面法向电极的三维碳基微器件用于可调低电压焦耳加热","zb":"利用石蜡辅助雕刻策略构建了由碳纳米管/石墨烯纳米片网络与表面法向电极集成的三维碳基微器件。通过选择性去除牺牲石蜡基质并优化石墨烯含量，获得了稳定的连续碳网络。该器件利用表面法向电极接触沟槽侧壁，在1.8 V低电压下达到147°C，并在1.5 V下实现约40°C的可穿戴兼容性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.3767017","t":"Anion‐Site Coupling Programs Interfacial Hydration for Electrocatalytic Hydrogenation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.3767017","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-23","f":"2026-11-24T21:13:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Coupled copper and bicarbonate sites establish a locally anchored hydration network that sustains interfacial water and hydrogen bond connectivity against the cathodic double layer, thereby lowering proton transfer barriers and enabling diverse electrocatalytic hydrogenation pathways. ABSTRACT Electrolyte anions are generally considered passive spectators at cathodically polarized interfaces, where electrostatic exclusion and strong solvation limit their access to catalytic sites. Here we establish anion-site coupling as a strategy to program interfacial hydration and accelerate near-neutral electrocatalytic hydrogenation. Molecularly defined Cu 2+ sites coordinated by hexahydroxytriphenylene on oxidized carbon black provide accessible coordination motifs that selectively couple with oxygen-containing anions. Among HCO 3 − , CO 3 2− , and SO 4 2− , bicarbonate forms Cu 2+ ─HCO 3 − couple","au":["Chengdong Yang","Yun Gao","Yueqing Wang","Xinxin Shu","Jizhen Ma","Yi Wang"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zb":"通过阴离子-位点耦合策略，利用六羟基三苯基配体修饰的 Cu2+ 位点与碳酸氢根（HCO3−）形成耦合位点，在界面处锚定水分子并重建氢键网络。这种策略降低了质子转移能垒，促进了呋喃甲醛、喹啉和硝酸盐的电催化氢化反应。原位光谱和理论分析表明，阴离子配位同时重构了局部 Cu 配位环境和界面水网络，实现了对质子耦合电子转移动力学的加速。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.3194380","t":"Spin and Charge Engineering of a BiCuMn Nanoalloy Catalyst for Industrial‐Scale Electrosynthesis of Glycine","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.3194380","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-23","f":"2026-11-24T21:13:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Spin and charge engineering of a BiCuMn nanoalloy catalyst enables industrial-scale glycine electrosynthesis from nitrate and glyoxylic acid. Bi–Cu accelerates nitrate-to-*NO conversion via d-p hybridization, while Mn-mediated spin regulation promotes neighboring Bi-*NO hydrogenation and subsequent C–N coupling, delivering high selectivity, productivity, and long-term stability. ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic C–N coupling provides a sustainable route for α-amino acids, yet its practicality is limited by poor selectivity and durability at industrially relevant current densities. Here, we report a Bi-based nanoalloy catalyst with atomically dispersed Cu and Mn (BiCuMn@C) for industrial-level glycine electrosynthesis. Experimental and theoretical results reveal that Cu modulates the electronic structure of Bi sites via d - p hybridization, enhancing the adsorption/activation of nitrogen-containi","au":["Yufeng Li","Can Wang","Baipeng Yin","Bojun Shi","Hengan Wang","Botao Zhang"],"o":"日常","zb":"通过 BiCuMn 纳米合金催化剂的旋量和电荷工程，实现了从硝酸盐和草酸合成甘氨酸的工业级电合成。Cu 通过 d-p 杂化加速硝酸盐到 *NO 的转化，Mn 介导的自旋调节促进邻近 *NO 的氢化及后续 C-N 偶联。该催化剂在 533.1 mA cm−2 电流密度下实现了 78.9% 的法拉第效率，产率为 1569 µmol h−1 cm−2，并在膜电极组件电解槽中稳定运行超过 1000 小时，累计产甘氨酸超过 1 mol。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.6c16420","t":"Porphyrin-Phenothiazine-Based Covalent Organic Frameworks for Enhanced Photocatalytic Nitrogen Fixation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c16420","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-11-23","f":"2026-11-21T17:58:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Solar-driven photocatalytic nitrogen reduction represents a promising and environmentally benign approach for ammonia synthesis. However, developing efficient photocatalysts capable of converting nitrogen to ammonia under ambient conditions remains a significant challenge. Porphyrin compounds exhibit excellent photosensitive properties with strong absorption across both the ultraviolet and visible regions of the solar spectrum, while phenothiazine offers unique optoelectronic activity. In this study, we integrated these two motifs and synthesized a series of novel metal-free covalent organic frameworks (COFs) by structural modification of the phenothiazine linker with a methyl group and with oxygen-containing functional groups. All three frameworks are active for N2 photoreduction under visible light, and the activity depends systematically on the linker: the sulfone-functionalized COF-3","au":["Xin Wang","Xinhao Li","Zichao Gao","Abing Guo","Zhengkun Ji","Weijun Yang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于卟啉-吩噻嗪的共价有机框架用于增强光催化氮固定","zb":"研究对象为金属-free共价有机框架（COFs），关键方法为通过甲基化和含氧官能团对吩噻嗪连接体进行结构修饰合成COFs，并使用可见光进行N2光还原。主要结果为含磺酰基的COF-3在可见光下的活性最高，达到109.6 ± 3.6 μmol g–1 h–1（1866.2 ± 60.7 μg h–1 gcat–1），优于未修饰和甲基化的COFs。机理分析和理论计算表明引入的氧原子促进了框架内光生电子的分离和传输。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jpclett.6c03406","t":"Curvature-Induced Orbital-Selective Hybridization Governs Nitrate Reduction on Cu Single-Atom Catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpclett.6c03406","s":"The Journal of Physical Chemistry Letters","d":"2026-11-23","f":"2026-11-23T22:40:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Understanding how nanoscale curvature regulates orbital interactions at single-atom sites is essential for rational electrocatalyst design. Here, we combined density functional theory, orbital-resolved bonding analysis, and pH-dependent microkinetic modeling to investigate nitrate reduction on Cu single atoms embedded in carbon nanotubes with systematically varied curvature. Increasing curvature induces local structural distortion, shifts the Cu d-band center, and strengthens *NH2 adsorption. Orbital-resolved crystal orbital Hamilton population analysis reveals that Cu 4s-N 2s interactions provide the dominant bonding contribution, while curvature selectively redistributes Cu 4s/3d-N 2p hybridization channels. High curvature promotes stronger multiorbital coupling, whereas reduced curvature favors more localized orbital contributions and weaker Cu-*NH2 bonding. Microkinetic volc","au":["Ruirui Ren","Mingyue Li","Yuhang Wang","Qiang Wang","Huitao Fan","Bo Li"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"曲率诱导轨道选择性杂化调控Cu单原子催化剂上的硝酸盐还原","zb":"结合密度泛函理论、轨道分辨键合分析和pH依赖微观动力学模型，研究了嵌入碳纳米管中曲率可调的Cu单原子上的硝酸盐还原。高曲率诱导局部结构畸变并增强*NH2吸附，轨道分析显示Cu 4s-N 2s相互作用占主导。高曲率催化剂在碱性条件下表现出增强的硝酸盐还原活性和抑制的析氢反应。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s11426-026-3714-1","t":"Hydrogen-bond-mediated nitrogen activation at chalcogenide cluster interfaces for efficient photocatalytic nitrogen fixation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11426-026-3714-1","s":"Science China Chemistry","d":"2026-11-23","f":"2026-11-25T20:29:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Chao-Li Chen","Yu-Shan He","Zhong-Yu Liang","Jia-Xing Liu","Bing-Zhe Wang","Shang-Fu Yuan"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"通过硫族化物团簇界面的氢键介导的氮活化实现高效光催化氮固定","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.3995081","t":"Confinement Enables Direct Electrosynthesis of Acetaldoxime From CO and Nitrate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.3995081","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-22","f":"2026-11-23T22:40:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"We report a confinement-enhanced electrocatalytic route for acetaldoxime synthesis from CO and NO 3 − via C–N coupling. By encapsulating ultrasmall Cu nanoparticles into SBA-15, the sluggish C–C dimerization is kinetically matched with rapid NO 3 − reduction, favoring the oximation pathway and achieving a production rate of 255.1 mmol g cat. − 1 h − 1 with an 8.2% Faradaic efficiency, enabling sustainable co-upcycling of carbon and nitrogen wastes. ABSTRACT Aldoximes are vital feedstocks in the fields of medicine, agriculture, and industry, yet their conventional synthesis suffers from high environmental costs and carbon footprints. Here, we report a direct electrocatalytic route to acetaldoxime via CO and NO 3 − co-reduction. The C–N coupling efficiency in this process hinges on the kinetic match between CO reduction and NO 3 − reduction. Acetaldoxime synthesis exemplifies this challeng","au":["Rongxing Qiu","Jiaran Li","Ke Chen","Dan Wu","Peng Qiu","Siyu Yang"],"o":"日常","why":["reduction of nitrogen"],"zt":"限制效应促进CO和硝酸盐直接电合成乙醛肟","zb":"通过将超小铜纳米颗粒封装在SBA-15中，实现了CO和NO3-通过C-N偶联直接电合成乙醛肟。限制策略促进了C-C二聚化并富集乙醛中间体，优化后的Cu@SBA-15催化剂在部分电流密度24.6 mA cm-2下实现了255.1 mmol g cat-1 h-1的产率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jwpe.2026.111278","t":"Hydroxylamine remodels microbial networks to enhance dissimilatory nitrate reduction to ammonium (DNRA) for nitrogen conservation in composting","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jwpe.2026.111278","s":"Journal of Water Process Engineering","d":"2026-11-21","f":"2026-11-21T17:58:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yaling Peng","Yinfeng Yang","Xiaolin Lu","Yanan Luo","Shangyu Lin","Qunliang Li"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"羟胺重塑微生物网络以增强好氧堆肥中反硝化还原为铵的DNRA过程","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158725","t":"Plasma-Catalytic Ammonia Synthesis over Nanoflower Structure Ni-Doped CoOx Catalyst Under Near-Ambient Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158725","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-11-21","f":"2026-11-22T03:06:14Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Chenglong Yu","Ruizhuo Chen","Susu Jiang","Jin Liu","Xinbo Zhu"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"在近环境条件下纳米花结构Ni掺杂CoOx催化剂上的等离子体催化氨合成","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.applthermaleng.2026.134057","t":"Green ammonia cracking integrated with coal gasification for syngas production with flexible H2/CO adjustment and employment for methanol synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.applthermaleng.2026.134057","s":"Applied Thermal Engineering","d":"2026-11-21","f":"2026-11-21T17:58:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jiaming Ning","Dongtai Yang","Zhenxiao Xia","Yu Gu","Wei Han","Lin Gao"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia cracking"],"zt":"集成煤造气与绿氨裂解生产合成气及用于甲醇合成的灵活H2/CO调节","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.35378/gujs.2017093","t":"Phase Evolution and Reaction Mechanisms of Aluminum Diboride (AlB2) Synthesis in Al–B–C System via Induction Heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.35378/gujs.2017093","s":"GAZI UNIVERSITY JOURNAL OF SCIENCE","d":"2026-11-20","f":"2026-11-20T19:07:01Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"This study systematically investigates the phase evolution and reaction mechanisms during the synthesis of aluminum diboride (AlB2) from the Al–B–C system utilizing an induction furnace. The primary objective is to elucidate the influence of diverse precursor materials (Al2O3, Al(OH)3 and elemental Al powder) and synthesis temperatures (900–1400 °C) on the crystal structure and phase stability of the synthesized products. Experimental findings reveal that elemental Al powder precursors minimize oxygen contamination within the system, thereby promoting intimate aluminum–boron interaction and yielding superior reactivity for boride phase formation. Comprehensive XRD and SEM-EDS analyses confirm that 1100 °C represents a critical optimum thermal window for obtaining single-phase, high-purity AlB2. Thermodynamic calculations based on Gibbs free energy analysis demonstrate that AlB2 loses its","au":["Murat Bilen","Melih Karakaya"],"o":"日常","why":["Induction Heating"],"zt":"感应加热下Al–B–C体系中铝二硼体（AlB2）合成的相演变与反应机理","zb":"研究利用感应炉系统调查Al–B–C体系合成铝二硼体（AlB2）的相演变与反应机理。实验发现元素铝粉末前驱体可减少氧污染，1100 °C是获得单相高纯AlB2的最佳窗口。热力学计算表明AlB2在1350 °C以上失去热力学稳定性并分解，而快速感应加热循环有助于动力学稳定亚稳态硼化物相。","ob":"其他催化反应"},{"id":"10.1016/j.csite.2026.108747","t":"Roles of fiber components and alkali metals in the synergistic interactions between lignocellulosic biomass and coal under rapid heating conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.csite.2026.108747","s":"Case Studies in Thermal Engineering","d":"2026-11-20","f":"2026-11-21T17:58:24Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The synergistic interactions between coal and lignocellulosic biomass are significantly affected by the presence of fiber components and alkali metal species derived from the biomass portion. However, previous studies have primarily focused on investigating these effects under low heating rate conditions such as those in thermogravimetric analysis (0.1-200 K/min), while studies under high heating rate conditions are limited. In this study, the ignition delay times of both the volatiles (IDT) and the residual chars (IDT-CHAR) were adopted as two pivotal ignition characteristics. The aim was to clarify how the fiber components and alkali metals inherent to biomass modulate the synergistic interactions between coal and lignocellulosic biomass during co-combustion under rapid heating rates of 10 4 –10 5 K/s. High-speed imaging within a Hencken flat-flame burner (FFB) was employed to characte","au":["Shusen Wang","Qiang Zhang","Yuegang Liu","Mengting Xu"],"o":"日常","why":["rapid heating"],"zt":"快速加热条件下木质纤维素生物质与煤中纤维组分及碱金属的协同作用","zb":"研究快速加热速率下木质纤维素生物质与煤的协同燃烧特性，采用高速成像表征多组分燃料混合物的点火动力学。结果表明，在50%和75%纤维素掺混比例下，碱金属能正向调节协同作用；而在25%比例下，协同效应主要归因于纤维素与煤的相互作用，碱金属贡献可忽略。"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.1697885","t":"Adaptive Active Site Programming via Electrolyte Engineering Toward Enhanced Catalytic Activity","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.1697885","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-20","f":"2026-11-21T17:58:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Active-site reconstruction during electrocatalysis is often unpredictable and difficult to be controlled. By combining pH- and potential-dependent thermodynamic analysis with experimental validation, electrolyte anions are identified as programmable axial ligands that can redefine Fe─N─C active sites. It is identified that nitrate coordination delivers enhanced ORR activity across a broad pH range, establishing a strategy for electrolyte-guided active-site programming. ABSTRACT Precise control over active site coordination is essential for advancing electrocatalysis, yet remains challenging due to insufficient understanding of how operating environments, particularly electrolyte anions, reshape local structure, and coordination. Here, we combine grand canonical ensemble calculations with experimental validations to investigate five representative anions (F − , Cl − , Br − , NO 3 − , and ","au":["Shaojie Jing","Junfeng Mou","Zhouhao Zhu","Wencai Liu","Chaogang Ban","Yucui Xiang"],"o":"日常","zt":"通过电解质工程实现自适应活性位点编程以增强催化活性","zb":"结合热力学分析与实验验证，提出电解质阴离子作为可编程轴向配体来重定义Fe─N─C活性位点。研究发现NO3-作为轴向配体能增强全pH范围的ORR活性，Fe─N─C单原子催化剂在引入NO3-后表现出增强的ORR性能，并直接证实了轴向NO3-配位的形成。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.53941/echem.2026.100014","t":"Ag Nanoparticle-Decorated Co(OH)2 Nanowires for Efficient Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.53941/echem.2026.100014","s":"eChem","d":"2026-11-20","f":"2026-11-23T22:40:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (NO3RR) provides a promising route for sustainable ammonia production under ambient conditions. However, the multi-step proton-coupled electron transfer process is often limited by the sluggish activation of NO3− and the subsequent hydrogenation of nitrogen-containing intermediates. Herein, Ag nanoparticles supported on Co(OH)2 nanowires are constructed by an electrodepositing strategy, and the metal-support interaction is modulated to simultaneously optimize NO3− adsorption and water dissociation for achieving high energy efficiency at a range of potentials. In Situ characterization reveals that Co(OH)2 promotes the initial reduction of NO3− to NO2−, whereas the uniformly distributed Ag nanoparticles enhance the formation of reactive hydrogen (*H), thereby accelerating the subsequent hydrogenation of nitrogen-containing intermediates. The re","au":["Lili Zhang","Yifan Li","Qian Bai","Runmin Li","Huishan Shang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"Ag纳米颗粒修饰Co(OH)2纳米线用于高效电催化硝酸盐还原制氨","zb":"采用电沉积策略构建了Ag纳米颗粒负载的Co(OH)2纳米线，通过调节金属-载体相互作用优化了NO3-吸附和水解离。原位表征显示Co(OH)2促进NO3-还原为NO2-，而Ag纳米颗粒增强活性氢*H形成，加速氮中间体氢化。该催化剂在-0.4 V vs RHE下氨法拉第效率达96.35%。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d6cc02725c","t":"Pd-rich Pd/PdO deposited TiO 2 nanosheets for enhanced visible-light-driven photocatalytic nitrogen fixation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6cc02725c","s":"Chemical Communications","d":"2026-11-20","f":"2026-11-25T20:29:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Photocatalytic green ammonia synthesis is a rapidly progressing sustainable alternative to the energy-intensive Haber-Bosch process. Herein, strategic synthesis of Pd-rich Pd/PdO TiO2 nanosheets (Pd-TiO2 NS) for photocatalytic reduction of N2 to NH3 was demonstrated, affording an NH3 generation rate of 81.2 µmol g-1 h-1, which was 6 and 8 times higher than those of TiO2 nanosheets (TiO2 NS) and P25, respectively. Overwhelmingly, Pd-TiO2 NS exhibited an apparent quantum yield (AQY) of 0.20% under 420 nm light, which was higher than those reported previously.","au":["Anish Kumar Mazumdar","Rajakumar Ananthakrishnan","Girija  Shankar Jena","Suraj P"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"富 Pd Pd/PdO 负载 TiO2 纳米片用于增强可见光驱动光催化固氮","zb":"研究制备了富 Pd Pd/PdO 负载 TiO2 纳米片用于光催化还原 N2 合成 NH3，NH3 生成率为 81.2 µmol g-1 h-1，比 TiO2 纳米片和 P25 分别高 6 倍和 8 倍；在 420 nm 光照下，表观量子产率为 0.20%。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acsanm.6c04599","t":"Tartaric Acid-Directed Three-Dimensional Cu-Nanorods-Constructed Cage with Reconstructed Cu0/Cu+ Interfaces for Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electrocatalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsanm.6c04599","s":"ACS Applied Nano Materials","d":"2026-11-20","f":"2026-11-20T19:07:01Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract To address the limited adsorption of reactants during the electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (ENRA), a dual strategy combining tartaric acid-induced morphology regulation and in situ electrochemical reconstruction was developed to construct a 3D Cage-Cu/NF electrode on nickel foam. The results show that the 3D Cage comprises interconnected worm-like Cu nanorods forming a three-dimensional porous framework, significantly increases the electrochemically active surface area and provides efficient pathways for rapid electron transport. In addition, in situ electrochemical reconstruction promotes the synergistic interaction between Cu0 and Cu+ species, thereby enhancing nitrate reduction to ammonia. As a result, the 3D Cage-Cu/NF electrode shows excellent ENRA performance at −0.45 V vs RHE, with a nitrate conversion of 95.33%, an NH4+-N selectivity of 99%, and a Faradaic e","au":["Xu Liu","Yunqing Zhu","Shaoxiong Liu","Huijie Yang","Chuanyi Wang","Junfeng Niu"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"酒石酸定向构建的三维 Cu-纳米棒结构笼与重构的 Cu0/Cu+ 界面用于硝酸盐至氨电催化","zb":"为解决电催化硝酸盐还原为氨（ENRA）过程中反应物吸附有限的难题，开发了一种结合酒石酸诱导的形态调控和原位电化学重构的双策略，在镍泡沫上构建了 3D Cage-Cu/NF 电极。结果表明，3D Cage 由相互连接的蠕虫状 Cu 纳米棒形成三维多孔框架，显著增加了电化学活性表面积，并为快速电子传输提供了有效途径。此外，原位电化学重构促进了 Cu0 和 Cu+ 物种的协同作用，从而增强了硝酸盐还原为氨。因此，3D Cage-Cu/NF 电极在 -0.45 V vs RHE 下表现出优异的 ENRA 性能，硝酸盐转化率为 95.33%，NH4+-N 选择性为 99%，法拉第效率为 79.6%。该电极在 20 次连续循环后仍保持良好的催化稳定性。这项工作为设计高效的硝酸盐至氨转化催化剂提供了一种有前景的策略。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsaem.6c02993","t":"Anodic Surface Engineering of Cu–Fe Dual-Atom Sites on Mo2C MXene for Efficient Electrochemical Nitrate-to-Ammonia Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsaem.6c02993","s":"ACS Applied Energy Materials","d":"2026-11-20","f":"2026-11-20T19:07:01Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The rational design of electrocatalysts requires precise control over active-site structure and surface chemistry. Here, we report a Cu–Fe dual-atom catalyst supported on Mo2C MXene and show that controlled electrochemical anodic treatment effectively tunes the surface chemical environment to enhance nitrate reduction to ammonia. Structural and spectroscopic analyses reveal that mild anodic treatment induces lattice expansion and redistributes oxygen-containing surface functionalities while preserving the MXene framework. High annular dark-field scanning transmission electron microscopy and X-ray absorption spectroscopy (XAS) confirm neighboring Cu–Fe sites embedded within the Mo2C structure, whereas XPS indicates the formation of a more oxygen-rich surface environment around the metal centers after treatment. These modifications highlight the synergistic interplay between dual-","au":["Sabine Eliane Midré","Hermenegildo García","Sara Goberna-Ferrón","Ana Primo"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"在 Mo2C MXene 上 Cu-Fe 双原子位的阳极表面工程用于高效的电化学硝酸盐至氨转化","zb":"研究了一种负载在 Mo2C MXene 上的 Cu-Fe 双原子催化剂，通过控制电化学阳极处理有效调节了表面化学环境以增强硝酸盐还原为氨。结构及光谱分析表明，温和的阳极处理导致晶格膨胀并重新分布表面含氧官能团，同时保留了 MXene 框架。高角环形暗场扫描透射电子显微镜和 X 射线吸收光谱（XAS）证实了 Cu-Fe 位点嵌入在 Mo2C 结构中，而 XPS 显示处理后在金属中心周围形成了更富氧的表面环境。这些改性突出了双位点协同作用和 MXene 表面化学之间的协同作用。因此，优化的 CuFe/Mo2C-ox 催化剂在 -0.5 V vs 可逆氢电极（RHE）下氨生产的法拉第效率为 98%，在 -0.7 V vs RHE 下氨产率为 0.6 mg h–1cm–2，优于先前报道的基于 MXene 的单原子催化剂。原位 ATR-FTIR 测量揭示了 NOx 和 NHx 中间体的存在，与先前提","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.76501","t":"Activating N = O Bond Cleavage Via Geometrically Matched Co‐C Atomic Pairs for Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.76501","s":"Small","d":"2026-11-20","f":"2026-11-20T19:07:01Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT The electrochemical reduction of nitrate (NO 3 − ) to ammonia (NH 3 ) is an attractive synthesis route, yet its efficiency is fundamentally limited by sluggish N = O bond cleavage due to insufficient N = O bond stretching and slow electron transfer. Here, we report that cobalt oxide supported on oxygen‐functionalized carbon felt (CoO/O‐CF) overcomes these limitations. In this catalyst, the Co–C atomic pairs exhibit an interatomic distance that geometrically matches the O–O spacing in NO 3 − , stabilizing an O‐bridged bidentate adsorption configuration. Characterizations and theoretical calculations indicate that this geometry concomitantly elongates the N = O bonds and enhances electron donation from active sites to their antibonding orbitals, accelerating N = O bond cleavage. Consequently, CoO/O‐CF delivers a high NH 3 yield rate of 16.8 mmol g cat −1 h −1 and a Faradaic effici","au":["Xinhui Wang","Han Xue","Dengke Wang","Lanqing Deng","Chu Chu","Yuefei Li"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"通过几何匹配的 Co-C 原子对激活 N=O 键断裂用于硝酸盐至氨电合成","zb":"硝酸盐（NO3−）的电化学还原至氨（NH3）是一种有吸引力的合成路线，但其效率受限于 N=O 键断裂缓慢，这是由于 N=O 键拉伸不足和电子转移缓慢。这里报道了负载在氧功能化碳毡（CoO/O-CF）上的氧化钴克服了这些限制。在该催化剂中，Co-C 原子对表现出与 NO3− 中 O-O 间距几何匹配的原子间距离，稳定了 O-桥双齿吸附构型。表征和理论计算表明，这种几何构型同时延长了 N=O 键并增强了活性位点向其反键轨道的电子捐赠，加速了 N=O 键断裂。因此，CoO/O-CF 在 -0.7 V vs RHE 下在中性废水中提供了 16.8 mmol g cat−1 h −1 的高 NH3 产率和 93.2% 的法拉第效率。CoO/O-CF 的出色性能超过了先前报道的顶尖催化剂。此外，CoO/O-CF 作为高性能阴极在 Zn-NO3− 电池中运行，实现了氨电合成和能量输出的同时，功率密度为 ","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.79753","t":"Proton Dynamic Confluence Effect Enables Self‐Synchronized *H Source‐Storage‐Sink for Electrocatalytic Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia from Fertilizer Wastewater","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.79753","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-20","f":"2026-11-21T17:58:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The Proton Dynamic Confluence Effect″ (PDCE) in Co 2 P/Cu/LaPO 4 heterojunction synchronizes *H flux via source-storage-sink architecture. This delivers 135.04 mg h − 1 cm − 2 NH 3 (94.9% FE), 99.85% removal from real wastewater with profit, advancing design to flux management. ABSTRACT Fertilizer-plant rinse wastewater is high-concentration, low-flow, sparsely distributed point-source nitrate pollution, with nitrate-nitrogen reaching thousands of ppm. Renewable-energy-driven electrochemical nitrate reduction (NO 3 RR) can convert nitrate into ammonia, but limited by flux imbalance between generation and consumption of active hydrogen (*H). Conventional catalysts cannot match *H supply and demand, causing hydrogen evolution or intermediate accumulation. We propose a Proton Dynamic Confluence Effect (PDCE) and design Co 2 P/Cu/LaPO 4 ternary heterojunction. Co 2 P supplies *H via water di","au":["Zhenlin Mo","Jiangzhou Qin","Wei Guo","Shuqin Zhang","Fali Hou","Shaoqi Zhou"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"质子动态汇聚效应使*H源-存储-汇自同步用于从化肥废水电催化硝酸盐到氨的转化","zb":"研究对象为Co 2 P/Cu/LaPO 4三元异质结，关键方法为利用质子动态汇聚效应（PDCE）设计源-存储-汇架构同步*H通量，通过水裂解产生*H，LaPO 4表面PO 4 3 −作为动态质子缓冲，Cu作为消耗汇。主要结果为在碱性介质中，最大氨产率可达135.04 mg h − 1 cm − 2，法拉第效率为94.9%，在真实化肥厂废水中运行120小时，硝酸盐去除率达99.85%，氨产量为35.15 g，法拉第效率>90%。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.79752","t":"Siloxane‐Mediated Proton Shielding in Cu/Cu 2 In Aerogels for Acidic Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.79752","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-20","f":"2026-11-20T19:07:01Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Acidic nitrate electroreduction is hindered by intense proton competition, parasitic hydrogen evolution, and rapid degradation of Cu‐based catalysts, limiting direct treatment of industrial nitrate effluents. Here, a siloxane‐armored Cu/Cu 2 In bimetallic aerogel (Cu/Cu 2 In@Si) is developed to integrate nitrate activation, regulated hydrogen transfer, and interfacial stabilization within an integrated catalytic system. The interconnected aerogel exposes Cu/Cu 2 In heterointerfaces for nitrate adsorption and conversion, while a 2–8 nm siloxane layer mitigates proton attack without sacrificing electrolyte accessibility. In pH 1 electrolyte containing 100 ppm NO 3 − ‐N, Cu/Cu 2 In@Si achieves 90.83% nitrate removal and 96.41% N 2 selectivity at −1.4 V versus SCE, retaining over 80% removal after 40 cycles with an average N 2 selectivity above 97%. Operando measurements and DFT ide","au":["Honglin Zhu","Ziyang Wu","Fengting Xie","Yujie Du","Fafu Yang","Jianping Yang"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"硅氧烷介导的质子屏蔽在 Cu/Cu2In 气凝胶中用于酸性电催化硝酸盐还原","zb":"酸性硝酸盐电还原受质子竞争强烈、副反应氢气析出和 Cu 基催化剂快速降解的阻碍，限制了工业硝酸盐废水的直接处理。这里开发了一种硅氧烷包覆的 Cu/Cu2In 双金属气凝胶（Cu/Cu2In@Si），将硝酸盐活化、调节氢转移和界面稳定集成在一个催化体系中。相互连接的气凝胶暴露 Cu/Cu2In 异质界面用于硝酸盐吸附和转化，而 2–8 nm 的硅氧烷层减轻质子攻击，同时不牺牲电解质的可及性。在 pH 1 电解质中含 100 ppm NO3−-N 时，Cu/Cu2In@Si 在 -1.4 V vs SCE 下实现 90.83% 的硝酸盐去除和 96.41% 的 N2 选择性，在 40 次循环后仍保留超过 80% 的去除率，平均 N2 选择性高于 97%。原位测量和 DFT 确定了互补作用：Cu 衍生的位点支持硝酸盐吸附和早期 N–O 断裂，而 Cu2In 包含的域提供可及的 * H，异质界面最","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.48565/bonndoc-1031","t":"Translation of molecular catalysts into highly functional interfaces for small molecule activation","u":"https://doi.org/10.48565/bonndoc-1031","s":"bonndoc (University of Bonn)","d":"2026-11-20","f":"2026-11-21T17:58:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The development of sustainable electrocatalytic systems for small-molecule activation represents a promising strategy for addressing challenges associated with greenhouse gas emissions, nitrogen pollution, and fossil-fuel-dependent chemical synthesis. Molecular electrocatalysts are particularly attractive in this context due to their well-defined and tuneable active sites, enabling detailed investigation of structure-activity relationships and catalytic mechanisms. This thesis explores the design, mechanistic understanding, and application of molecular transition metal catalysts for electrochemical CO2 reduction, nitrate reduction, dinitrogen activation, and electrochemical C-N bond formation. The first part of this work demonstrates that cobalt terpyridine complexes modified with perfluorinated alkyl side chains can self-assemble at gas-liquid-solid interfaces on gas diffusion electrode","au":["Morgan McKee"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"将分子催化剂转化为用于小分子活化的高功能界面","zb":"研究对象为分子过渡金属催化剂，关键方法为设计、机理理解和应用钴和镍的terpyridine配合物进行电化学CO2还原、硝酸盐还原、氮气活化和电化学C-N键形成。主要结果为钴terpyridine配合物在气-液-固界面自组装，实现高选择性CO2还原为甲烷；镍terpyridine配合物在均相和异质化配置中实现选择性甲酰胺生产；机理研究揭示了疏水催化微环境和质子转移吡啶单元的重要性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.79722","t":"Concentration‐Dependent Li‐Ion Solvation and Dual‐Interphase Regulation by Cyanuric Chloride in Lithium‐Sulfur Batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.79722","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-20","f":"2026-11-21T17:58:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"For lithium-sulfur batteries, cyanuric chloride (CC) combines weak Li-ion coordination with electrophilic carbon-chlorine chemistry in one compact molecule. By following concentrations from 0 to 0.10 M across the electrolyte, both electrode interphases, and a pouch cell, the study identifies 0.05 M (Optm-CC) as the most favorable of the four tested formulations. The selected electrolyte supports 300 pouch-cell cycles at approximately 8 mg Sulfur cm −2 and 5 µL mg Sulfur −1 . ABSTRACT Practical lithium-sulfur (Li-S) batteries require control of dissolved polysulfides, sulfur-conversion kinetics, and lithium-metal anodes under high sulfur loading and limited electrolyte. Dissolved molecular additives can influence all three processes, but their effects depend on concentration. Here, cyanuric chloride (CC) is examined from 0 to 0.10 M as an aprotic chlorotriazine additive with three ring-ni","au":["Ryanda Enggar Anugrah Ardhi","Satyanarayana K. Konavarapu","Farris Hilmyafif Elli","Jawon Ha","Vidhurathan Soundararajan","Hyunjoon Yoo"],"o":"日常","zt":"氰尿酸氯在锂硫电池中浓度依赖的Li-离子溶剂化和双界面调节","zb":"研究对象为氰尿酸氯（CC）作为添加剂，关键方法为研究不同浓度（0–0.10 M）对电解质、电极界面和软包电池的影响。主要结果为0.05 M（Optm-CC）增强硝酸根（NO 3 − ）和双（三氟甲磺酰）亚胺（TFSI − ）阴离子的Li-离子溶剂化，降低多硫化物穿梭，丰富硫正极界面，促进锂金属负极界面富无机和三嗪相关产物。这些变化降低了循环伏安法峰分离（0.191 V），提高了表观Li|Li交换电流密度（0.203 mA cm −2 ），支持Li|Li对称电池循环超过1100次，在10C下提供560 mAh g Sulfur −1，并支持3000次Li-S循环。增加CC浓度到0.10 M（Conc-CC）产生更大的光谱偏移，但表观Li-离子迁移数和锂电极极化恶化。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adma.75785","t":"Trace‐Metal‐Assisted Flash Synthesis for Fast‐Charging Graphite Anodes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.75785","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2026-11-19","f":"2026-11-20T19:07:01Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":27,"ab":"Nickel-assisted flash graphitization transforms petroleum coke into highly ordered graphite in a fraction of a second. During this rapid process, nickel promotes carbon adsorption, rearrangement, and graphite nucleation. The resulting graphite enables fast-charging lithium–ion battery anodes with excellent cycling stability, retaining 80% of their capacity after 1000 cycles at 15 C. ABSTRACT Graphite has remained the dominant anode material in lithium–ion batteries (LIBs), powering portable electronics and electric vehicles (EVs). However, sluggish Li + diffusion kinetics in natural and synthetic graphite can severely limit charging rates. Overcoming this bottleneck requires the rational design of graphite architectures that enable rapid Li + transport in LIBs. Here, we disclose a trace-metal-assisted flash (TMF) process for the millisecond synthesis of catalytic flashed graphite (CFGr) ","au":["Haojie Zhu","Yi Cheng","Shichen Xu","Shihui Chen","Vladimir Mancevski","Leo Haoxin Ye"],"o":"日常","w":["James M. Tour"],"why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"痕量金属辅助闪蒸合成用于快速充电石墨负极","zb":"研究利用痕量金属辅助闪蒸（TMF）工艺在毫秒级内合成催化闪蒸石墨（CFGr）。该方法诱导镍纳米团簇原位形成，催化无定形碳在1秒内转化为高度有序石墨。优化后的CFGr在0.25 C下具有347.4 mAh g−1的可逆容量，在15 C下保持158.8 mAh g−1，且1000次循环后容量保持率为80%。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","top":1},{"id":"10.1116/6.0005815","t":"Understanding the influence of plasma conditions on morphological evolution during plasma-enhanced atomic layer deposition of InN using in situ synchrotron x-ray scattering","u":"https://doi.org/10.1116/6.0005815","s":"Journal of Vacuum Science & Technology A","d":"2026-11-19","f":"2026-11-19T19:29:32Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Plasma-enhanced atomic layer deposition (PEALD) enables the growth of crystalline films of atomically precise thickness at reduced temperatures through the utilization of reactive and energetic plasma species. However, the mechanisms by which plasma-generated species influence nanoscale surface evolution during growth remain poorly understood. Here, we correlate the real-time evolution of nanoscale island morphology, including nucleation, coarsening, and coalescence, with the fluxes of reactive and energetic plasma species during PEALD growth. Grazing-incidence small-angle X-ray scattering was used as a nondestructive, surface-sensitive technique to monitor morphological evolution in real time, combined with plasma diagnostics to quantify reactive species and ion fluxes. We find that increasing reactive nitrogen flux accelerates the onset of island formation, while increasing ion flux pr","au":["Henry H. Chuang","Neeraj Nepal","David R. Boris","Scooter D. Johnson","Virginia R. Anderson","Alexander C. Kozen"],"o":"日常","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"利用原位同步辐射X射线散射理解等离子体增强原子层沉积InN过程中等离子体条件对形貌演化的影响","zb":"本文利用原位掠入射小角X射线散射结合等离子体诊断，研究了等离子体增强原子层沉积InN过程中等离子体条件对纳米级岛状形貌演化的影响。研究发现增加反应性氮气通量加速了成核，而增加离子通量促进了岛状结构的合并与粗化。通过控制反应性和高能等离子体物种，可以调节表面过程并优化低温薄膜生长的材料性能。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142089","t":"Mechanistic insights into the regulation of targeted pyrolysis products from cellulose, xylan and lignin under joule heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142089","s":"Fuel","d":"2026-11-19","f":"2026-11-20T03:57:35Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Mengyu Jin","Yuanbo Song","Mohamed E.A. EI-sayed","Islam A. Abdelhafeez","Meng Xia","Yalei Zhang"],"o":"日常","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"对焦耳热下纤维素、木聚糖和木质素的靶向热解产物调控的机理研究","bt":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta07821d","t":"Decoupling Reaction Pathway Modulation and Electronic Regulation through Nitrogen Configuration Engineering for Enhanced Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta07821d","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-11-19","f":"2026-11-19T19:29:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Thermocatalytic ammonia decomposition reaction (ADR) is fundamentally constrained by scaling relationships between N–H activation and N2 formation arising from metal–nitrogen interactions. Although nitrogen-doped catalysts show enhanced performance, whether specific nitrogen...","au":["Rongtian Jiang","Liu Hongming","Junhui Liang","Dashuai Wang","Huayu Chen","Dilshod Nematov"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"通过氮配置工程解耦反应路径调节与电子调控以增强氨分解","zb":"本文研究了通过氮配置工程解耦反应路径调节与电子调控以增强氨分解反应（ADR）。针对热催化氨分解反应中由金属-氮相互作用引起的N-H活化与N2形成之间的标度关系限制，探讨了特定氮掺杂催化剂的性能。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1038/s41596-026-01468-1","t":"Ammonia electrosynthesis from nitrogen and hydrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41596-026-01468-1","s":"Nature Protocols","d":"2026-11-19","f":"2026-11-19T19:29:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia is essential for the fertilizer and chemical industries and is increasingly valued as a carbon-free fuel. Electrochemical ammonia synthesis under ambient conditions offers a decentralized and sustainable alternative to the energy-intensive Haber-Bosch process, which requires high temperature, high pressure and large centralized plants. Among emerging strategies, the lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction has shown exceptional promise for ambient-condition ammonia electrosynthesis. This Protocol describes a continuous ammonia electrosynthesis method that combines a lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction with the hydrogen oxidation reaction in a flow cell operating at ambient temperature and pressure. In this system, metallic lithium is deposited on the cathode, where it forms a solid electrolyte interphase. The metallic lithium activates N 2 to form lithium nitrides or","au":["Liqi Shi","Zhongshuo Zhang","Shengliang Zhai","Fanglong Li","Weiyi Wang","Yanru Wang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"氮气和氢气电合成氨","zb":"该研究建立了一种在常温常压下连续合成氨的电化学方法，结合锂介导的氮还原反应与氢氧化反应。该方法利用金属锂在阴极形成固体电解质界面，激活N2并生成氨，同时在阳极利用PtAu合金催化剂氧化氢提供质子。该策略具有操作简单、长期稳定性和高法拉第效率等优势。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127818","t":"Crystallographic phase engineering of ordered Co-Sb intermetallics for durable and selective nitrate-to-ammonia electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127818","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environmental","d":"2026-11-19","f":"2026-11-23T03:41:51Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Wenqian Cao","Yifan Ren","Peidong Su","Yanbiao Liu"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"有序 Co-Sb 金属间化合物的晶体相工程用于耐用的硝酸盐选择性电合成氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.26180/35068909","t":"Sustainable Electrochemical Synthesis of Nitrite and Nitrate from Ammonia: Fundamentals and Practice","u":"https://doi.org/10.26180/35068909","s":"Monash University","d":"2026-11-19","f":"2026-11-20T19:07:01Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Today, around half the world's population depends on nitrogenous fertilisers to grow enough food. These fertilisers come from the conversion of ammonia to nitrite and nitrate, a process that is currently energy intensive, centralised, and a significant source of emissions. In this work, electrochemical systems that drive this conversion under mild conditions are investigated. Beginning with the fundamentals, the mechanisms governing the reactions were uncovered, including the role of silver-based catalysts and an ozone-mediated pathway. These insights were then translated into practice through the design of electrolysers that operated stably for over two weeks, providing a foundation for cleaner and more localised fertiliser production.","au":["Thi Mung Vu"],"o":"日常","zt":"从氨可持续电化学合成亚硝酸盐和硝酸盐：基础和实践","zb":"今天，世界上一半左右的人口依赖氮肥来种植足够的食物。这些肥料来自将氨转化为亚硝酸盐和硝酸盐的过程，该过程目前能耗高、集中化，并且是排放的重要来源。在这项工作中，研究了在温和条件下驱动这种转化的电化学系统。从基础开始，揭示了控制反应的机制，包括银基催化剂和臭氧介导的途径。这些见解随后被转化为实践，通过设计了稳定运行超过两周的电解器，为更清洁和更本地化的肥料生产奠定了基础。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c17476","t":"Mechanisms of Ammonia Synthesis over Ru Low- and High-Index Surfaces Based on Density Functional Theory Calculations","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c17476","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-11-18","f":"2026-11-18T04:15:36Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia is a vital compound for the future, with significant potential in energy applications, such as hydrogen-powered vehicles, and in agriculture as a key ingredient in fertilizers essential for food production. Traditionally, ammonia has been synthesized via the Haber-Bosch process using an iron catalyst, which requires high temperatures (400 to 500 °C) and pressures (about 200 atm), leading to a substantial carbon footprint and energy costs. Ruthenium is a promising alternative catalyst due to its higher intrinsic catalytic activity, allowing for ammonia synthesis under milder conditions. This paper presents a detailed Density Functional Theory (DFT) study of the elementary steps involved in ammonia production across five distinct facets: Ru(0001), Ru(10–10), Ru(11–20), Ru(11–21), and Ru(10–11). Using vibrational frequency analysis, we applied zero-point energy (ZPE), entha","au":["Shrish Goel","Tridip Das","Prabhat Prakash","William A. Goddard III"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"基于密度泛函理论计算的 Ru 低和高指数表面合成氨的机理","zb":"研究对象为 Ru(0001)、Ru(10–10)、Ru(11–20)、Ru(11–21) 和 Ru(10–11) 五种不同晶面的氨合成过程。采用密度泛函理论（DFT）计算了氨合成的基元步骤，并结合振动频率分析、零点能（ZPE）、焓变和熵变校正，在 80 °C 下研究了反应路径。研究发现 Ru(11–21) 表面的边角配位对氨合成具有最有利的热力学路径和最高催化活性，氢化反应通过共吸附水的介导具有低能垒，而氨的脱附是最高能垒步骤。","ob":"析氢反应","top":1},{"id":"arxiv:2611.24909","t":"Prediction and Screening of $η$-carbide-type Nitrides for Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.24909","s":"arXiv","d":"2026-11-18","f":"2026-11-19T04:09:15Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Synthesis of ammonia is of critical importance to applications in energy, industrial chemistry, and especially agriculture, and is accomplished industrially using the carbon- and energy-intensive Haber-Bosch process. η-carbide-type nitrides such as Co3Mo3N have gained attention in recent years as alternative ammonia synthesis catalysts with the potential to lower these energy demands. Co3Mo3N is experimentally observed to undergo a reversible phase transition from Co3Mo3N to Co6Mo6N, offering a chemical looping-based NH3 synthesis route that has not been fully explored. In this work, we present a first-principles exploration of phase change in the Co3Mo3N/Co6Mo6N system as a prototype η-carbide-type nitride and fit a cluster expansion to predict the energy of Co3Mo3Nx systems. We use our results to identify the phase energy difference as a useful screening criterion for the phase change ","au":["Luka H. Mikek","Nicholas D. Humphrey","Andrea Ambrosini","Matthew D. Witman","Dallas R. Trinkle"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"用于氨合成的 η-碳化物型氮化物的预测与筛选","zb":"基于第一性原理研究 Co3Mo3N/Co6Mo6N 系统的相变，拟合团簇展开模型预测 Co3Mo3Nx 能量。以此筛选了包含第4-6族过渡金属与 Cr、Fe、Co、Ni 或 Zn 的 η-碳化物型氮化物，发现 Co3W3N、Fe3W3N 和多种四元氮化物是相变机制合成氨的潜在候选者。","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨；涉及Fe/铁体系","pre":1},{"id":"10.1016/b978-0-443-27509-8.00139-x","t":"Transition Metal Nitrides in Ammonia Synthesis: Structure, Characterization, and Catalytic Behavior","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/b978-0-443-27509-8.00139-x","s":"Elsevier eBooks","d":"2026-11-18","f":"2026-11-20T19:07:01Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Yiteng Zheng","Christopher Kondratowicz","Zhiyuan Zhang","Huixin He","Bruce E. Koel","Yiguang Ju"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"氨合成中的过渡金属氮化物：结构、表征与催化行为","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.mcat.2026.116492","t":"Theoretical screening of transition metal single-atom catalysts supported on triazine-based graphitic carbon nitride for nitrogen reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mcat.2026.116492","s":"Molecular Catalysis","d":"2026-11-18","f":"2026-11-18T19:24:37Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Shanshan Jiang","Xiaoqian Shi","Wei Lin"],"o":"日常","zt":"三嗪基石墨相氮化碳负载过渡金属单原子催化剂的理论筛选","ob":"涉及碳材料","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.71668","t":"Configurational Entropy and Compositional Effects in Fe‐Based Oxide 2D Sheets for Nitrate Electroreduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71668","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2026-11-18","f":"2026-11-18T19:24:37Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"FeCuCoMnZnO x integrates diverse heteroatomic bridge-site environments and composition-dependent electronic structures to promote nitrate activation and sequential hydrogenation toward ammonia, demonstrating that nitrate reduction reaction performance is governed by the combined effects of composition and local coordination rather than configurational entropy alone. ABSTRACT Entropy engineering offers a promising strategy for constructing multicomponent electrocatalysts, yet its role in nitrate-to-ammonia electroreduction remains insufficiently understood. Herein, we design a series of Fe-based oxide two-dimensional sheets with low-, medium-, and high-entropy compositions by incorporating Cu, Co, Mn, and Zn into Fe 3 O 4 frameworks. This compositional series enables a comparative evaluation of how elemental combination, oxidation-state distribution, local electronic environment, and elec","au":["Muhammad Usman","Zhehao Sun","Yi‐Lun Chen","Kaili Liu","Xuechen Jing","Soshan Cheong"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"Fe基氧化物二维片层中构型熵与组分效应用于硝酸盐电还原","zb":"通过将Cu、Co、Mn和Zn引入Fe3O4框架构建了具有低、中、高熵组成的Fe基氧化物二维片层。实验和理论分析表明，催化行为受组分依赖的电子结构、混合价态金属中心和异原子桥位构型的共同影响。该催化剂在-0.55 V vs RHE下实现了10.9 mg h−1 mg cat−1的氨产率和94%的法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/adma.75778","t":"Precursor–Cavity Compatibility Directs C−N Bond Evolution Toward Edge Reconstruction for H2O2 Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.75778","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2026-11-18","f":"2026-11-18T19:24:37Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Precursor–cavity compatibility offers a geometric handle for C−N bond cleavage during confined pyrolysis. Tuning the steric environment of cobalt precursors within ZIF-8 biases bond evolution toward Co−N 4 -adjacent edge reconstruction, particularly 5r-C1 and 6r-C1 motifs. This bond-cleavage engineering connects precursor dimensions with the resulting carbon topology and enables more directed construction of local coordination environments. ABSTRACT ZIF-derived metal–nitrogen–carbon (M−N−C) catalysts provide a versatile platform for constructing atomically dispersed metal sites, yet their pyrolysis-driven local coordination evolution remains largely governed by stochastic reconstruction processes. The lack of predictive structural descriptors linking molecular precursors with atomic-scale active-site evolution limits the rational design of high-performance M−N−C catalysts. Here, we ident","au":["Xingjian Sun","Mengying Ou","Weihu Zhang","Yunyun Guo","Yijing Chen","Runzhang Tao"],"o":"日常","zt":"前驱体-空腔相容性指导 C-N 键演化以实现 H2O2 电合成","zb":"通过调控 ZIF-8 中钴前驱体的空间环境，利用前驱体-空腔相容性这一几何描述符，实现了对受限热解过程中 C-N 键断裂的定向控制。优化后的 Co(bpy)3-NC 催化剂在 200 mA cm-2 下实现了 95.9% 的 H2O2 选择性和近 90% 的法拉第效率，并稳定运行 120 小时。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.25394/pgs.35031661","t":"FIRST-PRINCIPLES ANALYSIS OF AMMONIA DECOMPOSITION ON DISORDERED COMO ALLOYS","u":"https://doi.org/10.25394/pgs.35031661","s":"Purdue","d":"2026-11-18","f":"2026-11-19T19:29:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"High-entropy alloys (HEAs) have emerged as promising heterogeneous catalysts because their surfaces present an enormous variety of local atomic environments, which may allow individual sites to escape the scaling relationships that limit conventional metals and ordered alloys. This same diversity of adsorption environments, however, makes HEA surfaces difficult to model. A single well-defined surface can be described with a modest number of density functional theory (DFT) calculations, but a disordered multi-element surface requires characterizing a statistical ensemble of site types. Existing computational treatments of such surfaces rest on assumptions that have not been systematically tested. These are that the surface composition mirrors the bulk, that descriptors such as scaling relationships remain valid, and that activity can be inferred from a single average binding-energy descri","au":["Zühal Çakır"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"无序 CoMo 合金上氨分解的第一性原理分析","zb":"针对无序合金表面难以建模的问题，该研究建立了连接表面结构、热力学稳定性和位点分辨动力学的第一性原理框架。以无序 CoMo 合金为研究对象，利用密度泛函理论计算分析了氨分解反应，评估了表面组成、标度关系和平均结合能描述符等假设的有效性。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.3390/nitrogen7040140","t":"Multi-Trait Screening and Temporal Growth Responses of Native Plant Growth-Promoting Bacteria for Nitrogen Management in Rice Production in Panama","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/nitrogen7040140","s":"Nitrogen","d":"2026-11-18","f":"2026-11-18T19:24:37Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Despite the documented benefits of plant growth-promoting bacteria (PGPB), their application to optimize nitrogen (N) use efficiency in rice systems remains inconsistent under tropical field conditions. This study characterized the PGP potential of native isolates (in vitro biochemical characterization: growth in nitrogen-free culture medium, as well as production of indoleacetic acid and phytosiderophores). It evaluated the field performance (pot evaluation under open-field conditions and field validation trials of two strains: Bacillus cereus (Strain 59) and Lysinibacillus fusiformis (Strain 24)). Field trials conducted in Panama suggest that both strains could improve productivity; specifically, the combined application of B. cereus and urea achieved maximum yields in systems rich in organic matter (Cabuya), while a urea optimization trial conducted solely with L. fusiformis across a ","au":["Celestino Aguilar","José L. Causadías","Betzaida Bernal","Mariana Rockenbach de Ávila","Oris Chavarría","Claudia González"],"o":"日常","zt":"巴拿马水稻生产中用于氮管理的本土促生长细菌多性状筛选与时间生长响应","zb":"在巴拿马对本土分离菌株进行了体外生化表征和田间验证。结果表明，枯草芽孢杆菌和短芽孢杆菌在有机质丰富的Cabuya系统中与尿素联用可达到最高产量；而短芽孢杆菌在尿素梯度（45.36-136.08 kg/ha）下对剂量有响应，中间剂量相比最低剂量和绝对对照能改善植物生长。这些结果将本土分离菌株鉴定为暂定的生物肥料候选者。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.18686/cest965","t":"Delivered-cost competitiveness of green ammonia imports to Germany: An end-to-end techno-economic assessment of supply chains from Morocco, Chile, and Saudi Arabia","u":"https://doi.org/10.18686/cest965","s":"Clean Energy Science and Technology","d":"2026-11-18","f":"2026-11-19T19:29:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Green ammonia is increasingly considered a low-carbon energy carrier for industrial demand centers. This study compares end-to-end supply chains from Casablanca (Morocco), Mejillones (Chile), and NEOM Oxagon (Saudi Arabia) to Brunsbüttel, Germany. The system boundary distinguishes renewable electricity, ammonia conversion (electrolysis, nitrogen separation, and Haber–Bosch synthesis), refrigerated storage, terminal handling, distance-based maritime freight, and route-specific charges. The assessment combines harmonized cost accounting, deterministic operating-condition stress tests, and screening-level probabilistic uncertainty analysis. Under the baseline assumptions, delivered costs are 1,178.93 USD/t NH₃ for Morocco, 1,242.13 USD/t NH₃ for Saudi Arabia/NEOM, and 1,341.63 USD/t NH₃ for Chile. The embedded desalination contributions are 1.60, 2.88, and 3.04 USD/t NH₃, respectively, and ","au":["Asmaa Khourdifi","Yassine Eddouh","Rabie El Otmani","Khalid Kandoussi"],"o":"日常","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"绿色氨进口到德国的交付成本竞争力：来自摩洛哥、智利和沙特阿拉伯的端到端技术经济评估","zb":"该研究评估了从摩洛哥卡萨布兰卡、智利梅希利诺斯和沙特阿拉伯 NEOM Oxagon 到德国 Brunsbüttel 的绿色氨供应链的端到端成本。通过确定性操作条件压力测试和蒙特卡洛不确定性分析，得出基准假设下的交付成本分别为 1,178.93 USD/t NH₃、1,242.13 USD/t NH₃ 和 1,341.63 USD/t NH₃。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jpcc.6c04191","t":"Visible-Light-Promoted Air-to-Ammonia Conversion under Near-Ambient Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpcc.6c04191","s":"The Journal of Physical Chemistry C","d":"2026-11-18","f":"2026-11-18T19:24:37Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Herein, we demonstrate a simple methodology for visible-light-driven ammonia (NH3) synthesis from air (atmospheric N2) under near-ambient conditions, using iron metal filings (f-Fe) in an aqueous solution of hydrogen peroxide (H2O2). Under optimized conditions (visible light from a 200 W bulb, air flow of ∼1.5 L min–1, 3 vol % H2O2, 20 mg mL–1 of iron metal filings, over 4 h), an NH3 yield of ∼34.5 mM was obtained, as quantified by the indophenol blue assay and verified by proton nuclear magnetic resonance (1H NMR) spectroscopy. Radical scavenging studies confirms the active role of electrons and hydroxyl radicals for N2 reduction via f-Fe-mediated H2O2 decomposition. This method could offers a potential route for on-site NH3 production directly from air.","au":["Rohit","Jyoti Sharma","Rahul Choudhary","Mukesh Jain","Anjali Kumari Garg","Vishrant Kumar"],"o":"日常","why":["NH3 production"],"zt":"近常温条件下可见光促进空气到氨的转化","zb":"利用铁屑在过氧化氢水溶液中实现了近常温下空气（大气N2）的可见光驱动氨合成。在优化条件下（200 W可见光、空气流量~1.5 L min−1、3 vol % H2O2、20 mg mL−1铁屑、4 h），获得了~34.5 mM的氨产率。自由基清除研究证实了电子和羟基自由基在铁介导的H2O2分解及N2还原中的活性作用。","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Fe/铁体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/btpr.88574","t":"Aquaporin biomonomer functionalized GUVs crosslinked cryogenic membrane for selective ammonia separation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/btpr.88574","s":"Biotechnology Progress","d":"2026-11-18","f":"2026-11-18T19:24:37Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Giant unilamellar vesicles (GUVs) are a cornerstone of biomimetic membrane research, providing a versatile platform for studying membrane proteins, such as aquaporin, under conditions that closely resemble natural cellular environments. Integrating aquaporins into GUV membranes represents an emerging frontier in biomimetic tools that combine biological precision with synthetic flexibility and enhanced mechanical stability. These hybrid structures offer unprecedented opportunities to develop advanced technologies for artificial kidneys, water purification, and the removal of hazardous molecules such as ammonia. This study involved constructing micron‐sized GUVs with biomimetic permeability and incorporating highly selective aquaporin proteins. A specially designed functional monomer ensured stable localization of aquaporins (Aqp) on the GUV membrane, enhancing their positional st","au":["Gizem Demirdiş","Deniz Hür","Rıdvan Say","Arzu Ersöz"],"o":"日常","zt":"水通道蛋白生物单体功能化GUVs交联冷冻膜用于选择性氨分离","zb":"构建了具有生物模拟渗透性的微米级GUVs并掺入高选择性水通道蛋白。该混合结构在体外表现出精确、选择性强、柔韧且机械稳定的生物模拟过滤特性，为人工肾脏、水净化及有害分子（如氨）去除提供了潜在应用。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24315502","t":"On the Development of Membrane Reactor Technology for Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24315502","s":"TU/e Research Portal","d":"2026-11-17","f":"2026-11-18T19:24:37Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"The rapid expansion of renewable electricity has renewed interest in hydrogen as a versatile energy carrier. However, large scale deployment remains constrained by challenges associated with hydrogen storage and transport. Consequently, alternative energy carriers capable of storing hydrogen in chemically bound form are attracting increasing attention. Ammonia (NH3) is one of the most promising candidates owing to its high hydrogen content, established infrastructure for storage and transport, relatively simple liquefaction, and potential for reconversion to hydrogen or direct use as a fuel. These features make ammonia attractive for both international energy trade and decentralised energy systems, where locally produced ammonia can link renewable electricity generation with distributed energy demand. Today, ammonia is produced almost exclusively through the Haber Bosch process, which re","au":["1 CUBE","Iolanda Gargiulo"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"膜反应器技术在氨合成中的发展研究","zb":"针对氨合成中热力学限制和能耗高的问题，本研究探讨了膜反应器技术。通过在反应器中连续移除氨气以改变反应平衡，该技术在温和条件下实现了更高的转化率，降低了能耗和CO2排放，为结合可再生能源的分布式氨生产提供了新方案。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.20517/energymater.2026.252","t":"Electronically active Sn nanosheets enable Sn-to-Pt interfacial charge redistribution for acidic and alkaline hydrogen evolution","u":"https://doi.org/10.20517/energymater.2026.252","s":"Energy Materials","d":"2026-11-17","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Regulating Pt-support electronic coupling is crucial for improving the activity, durability, and Pt utilization of hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) electrocatalysts. However, the weak electronic interaction between Pt nanoparticles and conventional carbon supports in commercial platinum-on-carbon (Pt/C) limits further performance enhancement. Herein, we report a two-dimensional Sn nanosheet-supported Pt nanoparticle catalyst (Pt/Sn NSs) constructed by liquid-phase exfoliation and atomic layer deposition. Structural and surface chemical analyses reveal pronounced interfacial electronic coupling between Pt nanoparticles and the Sn-based support. Combined with density functional theory calculations, the results demonstrate Sn-to-Pt interfacial charge redistribution and enhanced Pt stabilization on Sn nanosheets. Benefiting from this strengthened Pt-support electronic interaction, Pt/Sn NSs","au":["Yifan Huang","Hailin Jiao","Bowen Bai","Lin Zhao","Li Liu","Tao Yu"],"o":"日常","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"具有电子活性的 Sn 纳米片实现 Sn 到 Pt 的界面电荷重分布以用于酸性和碱性析氢","zb":"通过液相剥离和原子层沉积构建了二维 Sn 纳米片负载的 Pt 纳米颗粒催化剂，利用密度泛函理论计算证实了 Sn 到 Pt 的界面电荷重分布和 Pt 的稳定增强。该催化剂在 0.5 M H2SO4 和 1.0 M KOH 中仅需 28 mV 和 37 mV 的过电位即可达到 10 mA cm-2，表现出优于商用 Pt/C 的析氢性能。","ob":"析氢反应；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adma.75249","t":"Sunlight‐Driven Gram‐Scale Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia by an In Situ Formed Fe3+1‐xFe2+xOOH/CdSeS Photocatalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.75249","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2026-11-17","f":"2026-11-18T19:24:37Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"An outdoor sunlight-driven photocatalytic system efficiently reduces nitrate to ammonia. Using a 625 cm 2 plate - type reactor, the system achieves a high production rate of 72 mmol g −1 h −1 and demonstrates robust stability over 115 h of cumulative operation across 5 cycles, yielding 177.18 mmol of NH 3 and 7.83 g of NH 4 Cl solid under sunlight. ABSTRACT Sunlight-driven conversion of NO 3 − -to-NH 3 holds immense significance for fostering a green and sustainable society. However, most of the existing photocatalysts have weak light absorption and a wide band gap, making the synthesis of NH 3 challenging on a large scale under sunlight. Herein, a photocatalyst Fe 3+ 1-x Fe 2+ x OOH/CdSeS that was in situ formed from MPA-CdSe QDs and transition metal ions (i.e., Fe 3 + used here) under visible light irradiation at room temperature, accomplished a gram-scale synthesis of NH 3 in a 625 cm","au":["Xin‐Ling Zhang","Chen Zhang","Wei‐Chao Li","Jia‐Hao Wu","Shu‐Lin Meng","Jia‐Hao Li"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"原位形成 Fe3+1-xFe2+xOOH/CdSeS 光催化剂在阳光驱动下克级硝酸盐还原制氨","zb":"利用原位形成的 Fe3+1-xFe2+xOOH/CdSeS 光催化剂，在 625 cm2 平板型反应器中实现了阳光驱动下克级氨的合成。该催化剂在 115 小时累计运行中表现出优异的稳定性，太阳能制氨效率为 0.664%，量子产率为 15.89%，氨产率比先前记录提高了 5.82 倍。","ob":"光催化硝酸盐转化；涉及Fe/铁体系｜光驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/adma.74881","t":"Pulsed Electrocatalysis: A Novel Paradigm of Nitrate Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.74881","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2026-11-17","f":"2026-11-18T19:24:37Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Pulsed electrolysis makes nitrate reduction from a conventional steady-state process into a dynamically tunable interfacial reaction. Periodic modulation of the applied potential and/or current restores catalyst activity, enriches interfacial nitrate, regulates key intermediate generation and conversion, and alleviates mass-transfer limitations. Beyond ammonia synthesis, this strategy opens opportunities for producing value-added nitrogen-containing chemicals. ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic nitrate (NO 3 − ) reduction reaction (eNO 3 RR) offers a promising route for NO 3 − pollution control and nitrogen resource recovery. However, under conventional potentiostatic electrolysis, limited product selectivity and catalyst deactivation still hinder its practical application. Pulsed electrolysis provides a new strategy to dynamically regulate the complex interfacial reaction processes in eNO 3 RR. ","au":["Hao Liang","Wei Meng","Shuhan Qin","Wentao Song","Minghua Zhou","Yinqiao Zhang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"脉冲电催化：硝酸盐还原的新范式","zb":"针对传统恒电位电解在硝酸盐还原中存在的产物选择性低和催化剂失活问题，该综述提出了脉冲电解这一新策略。通过周期性调节电位和电流，该策略动态调控了界面反应过程，优化了催化剂重构、界面微环境和反应路径，从而提高了稳定性、法拉第效率和产物选择性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/adma.75247","t":"Phase‐Engineered MoS2 Quantum Monolayer Catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.75247","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2026-11-17","f":"2026-11-18T19:24:37Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"A new type of catalyst model—phase-engineered MoS 2 quantum-monolayer catalyst (∼0.8 nm thick, < 6 nm in the lateral size; switchable freely among metallic 1T, semiconducting 2H, and a hybrid phase of metallic-semiconducting 1T-2H)—is reported. It can efficiently and stably drive photochemical H 2 , syngas and ammonia synthesis as a catalyst or co-catalyst. ABSTRACT Single-atom catalysts with 100% atomic efficiency represent a frontier in heterogeneous catalysis, yet they face low loading density of active species (normally < 5.0 wt.%), poor stability, and difficulties in low-cost synthesis. Here, we present a new type of catalyst model—phase-engineered quantum-monolayer catalyst, as a complementary catalyst architecture that offers high-density accessible atoms and enables versatile phase/interphase engineering for catalysis. As a prototype (in our 13-type quantum monolayer library), ou","au":["Ruijie Yang","Yingying Fan","Lillian Pernitsky","Mojtaba Ebrahimian Mashhadi","Ningxin Chen","Md. Mehadi Hassan"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"相工程 MoS2 量子单层催化剂","zb":"报道了一种新型相工程 MoS2 量子单层催化剂，其厚度约 0.8 nm，横向尺寸小于 6 nm，可在金属 1T、半导体 2H 和混合相 1T-2H 之间自由切换。该催化剂可大规模合成（20 g），具有高量子单层产率和长期稳定性，作为催化剂或共催化剂在光化学制氢、合成气和氨合成中表现出高效性能。","top":1},{"id":"10.54254/2755-2721/2027.39136","t":"Towards Energy-Efficient Non-thermal Plasma Chemistry: Lessons from CO 2 Splitting and Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.54254/2755-2721/2027.39136","s":"Applied and Computational Engineering","d":"2026-11-17","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Non-thermal plasma (NTP) offers a promising route for electrifying chemical processes by enabling the activation of stable molecules under relatively mild conditions. However, evaluating the plasma process only by conversion or product yield may mask the substantial energy losses associated with power supply, electron excitation, molecular activation, and gas heating. This review examines energy efficiency in NTP-assisted CO 2 splitting and ammonia synthesis as two representative model systems to investigate the energy efficiency in NTP-assisted chemical conversion. For CO 2 splitting, different plasma discharges are compared in terms of CO 2 conversion, specific energy input and energy efficiency. For ammonia synthesis, the effects of discharge mode, reactor configuration, catalyst properties and suppression of NH 3 decomposition on energy yield are evaluated. Across both systems, highe","au":["Yueyao Zhao"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"迈向节能非热等离子体化学：来自CO2裂解和氨合成的启示","zb":"本文综述了非热等离子体辅助CO2裂解和氨合成两个代表性体系中的能量效率问题。研究发现，仅通过转化率或产率评估等离子体过程会掩盖电源、电子激发、分子激活和气体加热带来的巨大能量损失。能量性能取决于电沉积、分子激活、等离子体-表面相互作用及非生产性路径抑制之间的耦合。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.3390/catal16111024","t":"Support- and Size-Dependent Performance of Ni Catalysts for Ammonia Decomposition to Hydrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/catal16111024","s":"Catalysts","d":"2026-11-17","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia decomposition enables point-of-use hydrogen supply and therefore offers a practical route to avoid many of the storage and transport constraints of molecular hydrogen. Herein, Ni catalysts loaded on HZSM-5, γ-Al2O3, Al2O3-ZrO2, and SiO2 were synthesized by incipient wetness impregnation and examined by complementary characterization methods to relate catalyst structure to ammonia decomposition behavior. Among the investigated materials, Ni/SiO2 delivered the best performance, reaching 78.1% NH3 conversion and an H2 generation rate of 41.9 mmol·min−1·gNi−1 at 550 °C. Varying the Ni content from 5 to 20 wt.% further showed that higher loading increases overall NH3 conversion, while the activity normalized to Ni mass decreases because larger Ni particles are formed at elevated loadings. These results indicate that catalytic output is jointly controlled by the population of accessibl","au":["Yiran Wu","Jingying Guan","Zengrui Zhao","Lixia Bao","Daxin Shi","Hansheng Li"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"氨分解制氢中Ni催化剂的载体和尺寸依赖性能","zb":"通过浸渍法制备了负载于HZSM-5、γ-Al2O3、Al2O3-ZrO2和SiO2上的Ni催化剂。Ni/SiO2表现出最佳性能，在550 °C下达到78.1%的NH3转化率和41.9 mmol·min−1·gNi−1的H2生成率。提高Ni负载量会增加总转化率，但归一化活性降低，因为形成了更大的Ni颗粒。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1039/d6qi02224c","t":"Dynamic active sites and multidimensional regulation in electrocatalytic nitrate reduction for ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6qi02224c","s":"Inorganic Chemistry Frontiers","d":"2026-11-17","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"NO 3 RR requires coordinated nitrate activation, nitrite reduction, and hydrogenation. This review highlights the roles of working-state evolution, catalytic-function regulation, and system-level optimization in selective and stable NH 3 synthesis.","au":["Junxin Lan","Shuyun Yan","Haojun Sun","Fuda Chen","Xingkun Fu","Yanjun Xue"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"电催化硝酸盐还原合成氨中的动态活性位点和多维调控","zb":"综述了电催化硝酸盐还原合成氨过程中工作态演变、催化功能调控和系统级优化在选择性及稳定氨合成中的作用。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d6nr03611b","t":"Engineering p-d Orbital Hybridization at CuSn-Co 3 O 4 Heterointerfaces for Synergistic Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electrocatalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6nr03611b","s":"Nanoscale","d":"2026-11-17","f":"2026-11-17T05:03:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (NO3RR) to ammonia offers a sustainable route for wastewater remediation and green NH3 synthesis, yet its practical application is hindered by sluggish reaction kinetics, competitive hydrogen evolution,...","au":["Shanshan Zheng","Li Deng","Mengyun Yang","Chen Chen","Yu Bai","Zhifeng Xin"],"o":"日常","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"zb":"该研究通过工程化 CuSn-Co3O4 异质结界面的 p-d 轨道杂化，用于协同电催化硝酸盐还原制氨。结果表明，该策略显著提升了反应动力学，实现了高效的硝酸盐到氨的转化。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.79686","t":"Carbon‐Confined Iron Phthalocyanine–Copper Interfaces Promote Selective Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.79686","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-17","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Selective electrochemical reduction of nitrate to ammonia under ambient conditions is promising yet hindered by a kinetic mismatch between nitrate activation and the supply of active hydrogen required for successive hydrogenation of oxygenated intermediates. Here, we show that tuning the Cu support environment at a carbon‐confined interface effectively boosts the catalytic performance of iron phthalocyanine (FePc). Partial extraction of Cu nanocubes (e‐Cu) within N‐doped carbon (NC) reduces Cu─Cu coordination and increases porosity, driving a stronger electronic interaction with subsequent FePc incorporation. The optimized FePc/e‐Cu@NC catalyst achieves an exceptional NH 3 yield rate of 8.75 mg h −1 mg cat −1 with a Faradaic efficiency of 94.6% at −0.6 V vs. the reversible hydrogen electrode in 0.5 M K 2 SO 4 containing 0.1 M KNO 3 , with sustained performance over 30 consecutiv","au":["Zilin Li","Yueying Chu","Xiting Yue","Yung‐Kang Peng","Muchun Xu","Tian Tian"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"碳限制铁酞菁-铜界面促进选择性硝酸盐-氨转化","zb":"研究利用碳限制界面调控铜载体环境，通过部分提取氮掺杂碳中的立方体铜纳米颗粒，增强与铁酞菁的电子相互作用。优化后的催化剂在0.5 M K2SO4含0.1 M KNO3溶液中，于-0.6 V电位下实现了8.75 mg h−1 mg cat−1的氨产率和94.6%的法拉第效率，并持续稳定30次循环。机理研究结合动力学、自旋捕获、原位光谱和DFT计算，证实性能提升源于界面处活性氢可用性和脱氧能垒的改善。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ccr.2026.218766","t":"Rare-earth engineered single-atom photocatalysts for solar energy applications and environmental remediation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ccr.2026.218766","s":"Coordination Chemistry Reviews","d":"2026-11-17","f":"2026-11-22T03:06:14Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Photocatalysis offers an ecological route for renewable fuel generation and environmental remediation. Conventional photocatalysts limited their efficiency by inefficient light utilization, rapid charge recombination, and low atomic sites utilization during the reaction. Rare-earth single-atom photocatalysts (RESAP) have emerged as promising materials, due to their unique 4f electronic configurations and desirable coordination environment. The tunable coordination environments enable effective regulation of charge transfer and surface reactions. The fundamental characteristics, design strategies and photocatalytic properties and uses of RESAP are outlined in this paper. Vacancy/defect engineering, coordination-environment management, heterojunction building, light absorption, charge separation, and interfacial electron transport are all given special attention. The role of RE single atom","au":["Gaurav Sharma","Pankaj Sharma","Jinhu Zhi","Tongtong Wang","Sahil Rana","Jayati Sharma"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"稀土工程单原子光催化剂用于太阳能应用和环境修复","zb":"稀土单原子光催化剂（RESAP）因其独特的4f电子配置和理想的配位环境，在光催化领域展现出巨大潜力。本文概述了RESAP的基本特性、设计策略、光催化性能和应用，重点关注空位/缺陷工程、配位环境管理、异质结构建、光吸收、电荷分离和界面电子传输。文章还回顾了稀土单原子在析氢、CO2光还原、氮固定和污染物降解中的作用，以及稀土种类、配位结构、缺陷和金属-载体相互作用对光催化性能的影响。最后总结了当前面临的单原子稳定性、结构表征、机理理解和实际可扩展性等挑战，并展望了开发高效RESAP用于太阳能转换和环境修复的未来机遇。","ob":"析氢反应"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15012292/v1","t":"Uranium Hydride Complexes for Dinitrogen Activation","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15012292/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Sébastien Paloc","Linda De Marchi","Eachann Assendjee","Luca Demonti","Nicolas Casaretto","Iker del Rosal"],"o":"日常","why":["Dinitrogen Activation"],"zt":"用于活化二氮的铀氢化物配合物","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.mtchem.2026.104161","t":"Joule Heating Induced Structural Evolution of Ordered Mesoporous Mg-Al Spinel-Related Oxides","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mtchem.2026.104161","s":"Materials Today Chemistry","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Coupling block copolymer self-assembly with ultrafast Joule heating enables second-scale crystallization of ordered mesoporous oxides while preserving long-range mesoscopic order. Using this strategy, we synthesize long-range ordered mesoporous magnesium-aluminum oxide frameworks at low magnesium contents exhibiting defect spinel-related nanocrystalline structures. Ex situ isothermal holds at 1000 to 1155 °C reveal rapid crystallite enlargement followed by a plateau in apparent crystallite size. In pure γ-alumina, this early saturation, together with retention of the ordered mesostructure, is consistent with geometrically constrained crystallite growth. Magnesium incorporation enables further crystallite enlargement before saturation, yielding larger defect-spinel-related domains while retaining long-range mesoscopic order. We further demonstrate the incorporation of in situ crystallized","au":["Leyan Wang","Qihang Chen","Hossein Akhoundzadeh","Yong Quan Yeo","Geok Leng Seah","Yee Yan Tay"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule Heat"],"zb":"利用超快闪蒸焦耳热耦合自组装策略，在保留长程介观有序的同时实现了有序介孔氧化物的秒级结晶。研究在低镁含量下合成了具有缺陷尖晶石相关纳米晶结构的有序介孔镁铝氧化物框架，并发现镁的掺入能显著促进晶粒生长。此外，该研究展示了铂纳米颗粒在框架内的原位结晶及其在350 °C下对甲基环己烷脱氢的活性。","ob":"其他催化反应","pp":"ChemRxiv"},{"id":"10.1007/s11581-026-07612-x","t":"Confined intercalation and non-equilibrium joule heating conversion synergistically constructing SiOx@C composite for lithium storage","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11581-026-07612-x","s":"Ionics","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-16T21:03:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Jianlin Liang","Quanqiang Yuan","Yuanjie Qin","Zhe Luo","Haorong Quan","Na Liu"],"o":"日常","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"受限插层与非平衡焦耳加热转化协同构建用于锂存储的 SiOx@C 复合材料","ob":"焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/aic.70780","t":"Selective polyolefin conversion to ethylene in a hierarchical Joule‐heated reactor","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aic.70780","s":"AIChE Journal","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-17T05:03:41Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Direct conversion of polyolefin waste into ethylene is hindered by poor control over heat transfer, intermediate transport, and secondary cracking. Here we introduce a catalytic spatiotemporal Joule‐heating strategy integrating polymer melting, transport, and catalytic conversion within a three‐layer architecture. Transient pulses create a localized high‐temperature catalytic zone while underlying layers remain thermally buffered. Experiments and simulations support a thermal‐catalytic control involving progressive cracking, localized catalytic conversion, and rapid light‐product removal. Under optimized conditions, low‐density polyethylene affords a C 1 – C 5 hydrocarbon yield of 96.0 wt%, an ethylene molar selectivity of 49.4% based on the quantified C 1 – C 5 gaseous hydrocarbons, and a specific ethylene yield of 14.3 mmol g −1 . The strategy also accommodates other polyolefi","au":["Zhichun Huang","Huiyang Bi","Haiyang He","Mingyue Yan","Bingcheng Lin","Liang Wang"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule-heat"],"zt":"分级焦耳加热反应器中选择性聚烯烃转化为乙烯","zb":"通过引入集成聚合物熔融、传输和催化转化的三层结构催化时空焦耳加热策略，实现了聚烯烃废料向乙烯的直接转化。实验和模拟支持渐进式裂解、局部催化转化和快速轻产物移除的热催化控制。在优化条件下，低密度聚乙烯的 C1–C5 烃类产率为 96.0 wt%，乙烯摩尔选择性为 49.4%，比乙烯产率为 14.3 mmol g−1。该策略还适用于其他聚烯烃和消费后塑料，与传统 PE-至-石脑油和蒸汽裂解路线相比，全生命周期内的累计能耗和温室气体排放分别降低了约 47.7% 和 36.5%。","ob":"反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.79671","t":"From Lab to Industrial Scale‐Up: Rapid Joule Heating Synthesis of Electrocatalysts Towards Water Electrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.79671","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-16T21:03:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"ABSTRACT Large‐scale green hydrogen production via renewable energy‐driven exchange membrane water electrolysis is highly dependent on the development of high‐performance and low‐cost electrocatalysts. Traditional catalyst synthesis strategies suffer from lengthy fabrication procedures, limited structural modulation capability, and poor scalability for industrial deployment. As an emerging and transformative synthesis technology, rapid Joule heating (RJH) features transient ultra‐high temperatures, ultrafast heating/cooling rates, and direct energy input modes, enabling the construction of non‐equilibrium catalyst architectures with outstanding time and energy efficiency. Herein, this review comprehensively elaborates on the versatile and high‐efficiency applications of RJH in fabricating advanced electrocatalysts for proton and anion exchange membrane water electrolysis. We first system","au":["Wei Yan","Huamei Sun","Zhiwen Xu","Hanyang Cheng","Yi Kong","Yawen Tang"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"从实验室到工业规模放大：用于水电解的快速焦耳加热合成电催化剂","zb":"综述了快速焦耳加热技术在构建质子交换膜和阴离子交换膜水电解电催化剂中的应用。文章系统阐述了RJH技术的基本原理、反应器配置及其在合成原子级催化剂、合金催化剂、过渡金属X-ides以及缺陷和界面工程催化材料方面的优势，特别强调了高通量筛选和卷对卷可扩展制造方面的进展。","ob":"析氢反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15012258/v1","t":"Plasma-Enhanced Surface Doping SnNiOx Nanofilms for Water Oxidation","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15012258/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"The oxygen evolution reaction (OER) limits the efficiency of alkaline water electrolysis, and the rational design of non-precious-metal anodes requires an understanding of how a dopant modifies an oxide surface. Although atomically dispersed catalysts (ADCs) offer high intrinsic activity, precise synthesis and characterization of their local active sites remain challenging. Surface doping provides a tractable alternative for probing intrinsic activity and correlating it with the dopant coordination environment. Here we use plasma-enhanced atomic layer deposition (PE-ALD) to deposit sub-monolayer doses of Fe and Co on ultrathin SnNiOx films grown on fluorine-doped tin oxide (FTO). We vary the Fe and Co dopant coordination environment using oxidizing (O2) or reducing (H2) plasma as an independent variable on the dopant deposition step. In the PE-ALD surface doping step, the host chemistry ","au":["Ina Østrøm","Marco Favaro","Jhair P. Prada","Nicholas M. Bedford","B. Koch","Luís Henrique da Silveira Lacerda"],"o":"日常","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"用于析氧反应的等离子增强表面掺杂 SnNiOx 纳米薄膜","zb":"利用等离子增强原子层沉积在氟掺杂氧化锡基底上沉积亚单层剂量的 Fe 和 Co，通过氧化或还原等离子体调控掺杂剂的配位环境。研究揭示了掺杂对氧化物表面性质的影响，为理解非贵金属阳极的构效关系提供了有效途径。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及Fe/铁体系、原子层沉积","pre":1},{"id":"10.20944/preprints202611.1550.v1","t":"Cobalt Metal-Based Solid Catalytic Materials: Properties and Industrial Applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.20944/preprints202611.1550.v1","s":"Preprints.org","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3","joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"The bulk and surface properties of cobalt metal-containing solids used as heterogeneous catalysts are summarized. Data on bulk cobalt (nano)particles, Raney cobalt catalysts, and cobalt supported on alumina, silica, titania, ceria, zirconia, magnesia, zinc oxide, zeolites, and other oxidic carriers, as well as on carbon-based materials, are described and discussed. The practical industrial applications as well as the potential applications proposed in the literature for such materials are critically discussed. In particular, the application of cobalt metal-based catalysts for hydrogenation of carbon oxides (including the Fischer-Tropsch process), the steam reforming of hydrocarbons and oxygenated compounds, the hydrogenations and dehydrogenations of hydrocarbons, oxygenated compounds and nitrogenated compounds (including ammonia synthesis and decomposition) are reviewed and discussed. Th","au":["Guido Busca","Elena Spennati","Paola Riani","Gabriella Garbarino"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis","magnetic induction heat"],"zt":"基于钴金属的固体催化材料：性质与工业应用","zb":"综述了钴金属基固体催化剂的体相与表面性质，涵盖纳米颗粒、雷尼钴及钴负载于氧化铝、二氧化硅、二氧化钛、氧化铈、氧化锆、氧化镁、氧化锌、沸石等载体及碳基材料上的数据。文章讨论了其在碳氧化物加氢（包括费托合成）、烃类及含氧化合物蒸汽重整、烃类及含氧化合物与含氮化合物的加氢与脱氢（包括氨合成与分解）中的应用，并强调了这些铁磁材料作为昂贵贵金属催化剂替代品的潜力，以及用于磁感应加热吸热反应（如天然气蒸汽重整和烷烃脱氢）的应用前景。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.78855","t":"PtRu Alloying‐Mediated Reconstruction of Adsorption‐Conversion Landscape and Interfacial Water for Durable Alkaline Hydrogen Evolution","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.78855","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Ultrafast FJH anchors ultralow-loading PtRu alloy nanoclusters on defect-rich MoO x , where alloying and MoO x -mediated EMSI create an electron-deficient interface that balances water activation and intermediate conversion. The catalyst reorganizes alkaline interfacial water into a surface-coupled, hydrogen-bond-connected hydration layer, enabling fast HER kinetics, high noble-metal utilization, and durable AEMWE operation under practical electrolyzer conditions. ABSTRACT Renewable-powered water electrolysis is pivotal to sustainable hydrogen production, yet the alkaline hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) remains kinetically sluggish at high current densities. This limitation stems not only from the extra water-dissociation step, but also from an unfavorable interfacial water microenvironment that hampers charge transport—challenges that become even more pronounced at ultralow noble-meta","au":["Zhaoran Yuan","Jintao Gu","Lijuan Zhu","Jilong Xu","Haihua Luo","Jinheng Hu"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"PtRu 合金介导的吸附-转化景观与界面水重构以实现耐用的碱性析氢","zb":"利用超快闪蒸焦耳热在缺陷丰富的 MoOx 上锚定超低负载量的 PtRu 合金纳米团簇，建立了电子缺乏的界面以平衡水分解与中间体转化。该催化剂将碱性界面水重排为表面耦合的氢键连接水合层，在 1 M KOH 中仅需 56.15 mV 过电位即可达到 100 mA cm-2，并在阴极交换膜水电解器中实现了 1.836 V 的性能。","ob":"析氢反应｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.2640104","t":"Cofactor‐Inspired Second‐Sphere Engineering of Artificial Metalloenzymes for Neutral Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.2640104","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-16T21:03:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"ABSTRACT Constructing artificial metalloenzymes with precisely positioned metal centers and tailored second‐sphere microenvironments remains challenging in replicating the hierarchical catalytic functions of natural enzymes. Here, we report a cofactor‐inspired second‐sphere engineering strategy to construct an artificial nanozyme, CuS 1 /CN, featuring atomically defined [3Cu−1S] motifs selectively anchored to ultrasmall Cu clusters (∼0.73 nm) within a mesoporous nitrogen‐doped carbon framework. This architecture establishes enzyme‐like catalytic compartmentalization without compromising active‐site accessibility: exposed Cu sites mimic nitrate reductase for nitrate activation and water dissociation, while adjacent [3Cu−1S] motifs function as cofactor‐like centers that orchestrate interfacial hydration, facilitating proton‐coupled electron transfer and hydrogen relay during downstream hyd","au":["Yi Zhong","Doufeng Wang","Haiyi Yang","Xiaojie Chen","Fuzhan Song","Jian‐Ke Sun"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"辅因子启发的第二球工程构建用于中性氨合成的仿生金属酶","zb":"报道了一种辅因子启发的第二球工程策略，构建了具有原子级定义[3Cu-1S]基序的CuS1/CN仿生纳米酶。该材料在介孔氮掺杂碳框架内锚定超小Cu簇，通过暴露的Cu位点模拟硝酸盐还原酶进行硝酸盐活化，邻近的[3Cu-1S]基序作为辅因子中心促进界面水合和质子耦合电子转移。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.2390339","t":"Enhanced Electrochemical C–N Coupling for Glycine Synthesis via an Active Hydrogen Pump","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.2390339","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"An In–Bi catalyst is developed for efficient electrochemical synthesis of glycine via C–N coupling of oxalic acid and nitrate. Oxophilic In sites act as an “active hydrogen pump” to accelerate H 2 O dissociation and supply *H, while the Bi matrix promotes glyoxylic acid oxime (GAO) adsorption. The synergistic effect enables a glycine Faradaic efficiency of 83.3% and an industrial-level current density of 361.3 mA cm −2 . ABSTRACT Direct electrochemical C–N coupling of abundant carbon and nitrogen feedstocks offers a sustainable route to glycine synthesis, yet achieving high efficiency remains challenging. Here, we develop an In–Bi catalyst by incorporating oxophilic indium (In) into a bismuth (Bi) matrix. During the co-reduction of oxalic acid and NO 3 − , the In–Bi catalyst delivers an exceptional Faradaic efficiency toward glycine (FE Glycine ) of 83.3% with an industrial-level current","au":["Jiankang Liu","Hengan Wang","Zhonghua Wu","Zongren Song","Zhongnan Ling","Shuming Zhou"],"o":"日常","zt":"通过活性氢泵增强甘氨酸合成的电化学C–N偶联","zb":"开发了一种In–Bi催化剂用于通过草酸和硝酸盐的电化学C–N偶联高效合成甘氨酸。氧化亚铟位点作为“活性氢泵”加速H2O解离并供应*H，铋基体促进草酰酸肟吸附。协同效应实现了83.3%的甘氨酸法拉第效率和361.3 mA cm−2的工业级电流密度。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.1519163","t":"Electrostatic Focusing Enables Directed Active Hydrogen Delivery for pH‐Universal Nitrate Electroreduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.1519163","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Electrostatic focusing within a copper-halide cluster directs reactive hydrogen toward nitrate-bound sites, enabling selective nitrate reduction to ammonia across pH 1–13. A localized electrostatic potential minimum favors nitrate hydrogenation while limiting competing hydrogen evolution. ABSTRACT Achieving pH-universal electroreduction of nitrate to ammonia remains a fundamental obstacle for practical nitrate remediation in aqueous environments. The central challenge is to achieve efficient utilization of the scarce reactive hydrogen (*H) under alkaline conditions while preventing *H recombination that promotes hydrogen evolution in acidic media. Herein, electrostatic focusing is introduced to regulate the directional delivery of *H toward nitrate-bound sites through the electrostatic potential (ESP) landscape established upon nitrate coordination. A copper-halide cluster catalyst achie","au":["Xiao‐Hui Liu","Xia Liang","Wen‐Jie Zhang","Jiang‐Kun Guo","Hai‐Yang Yu","Bao‐Ying Feng"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"静电聚焦实现pH通用硝酸盐电还原的定向活性氢传递","zb":"铜卤化物簇催化剂通过静电聚焦将活性氢定向传递至硝酸盐结合位点，实现了pH 1–13范围内硝酸盐选择性还原为氨。硝酸盐结合产生的局部静电势最小值促进了硝酸盐氢化，抑制了析氢竞争反应，法拉第效率高达92.9%–100%。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15012256/v1","t":"Reticular Programming of Gold Nanocluster Electronic States Enables Near-Unity Faradaic Efficiency in Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15012256/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-16T21:03:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Achieving selective nitrate-to-ammonia electrosynthesis requires more than accelerating nitrate activation: the catalyst must sustain eight-electron reduction while preventing premature intermediate release and competing hydrogen evolution. Yet controlling these competing processes through the molecular architecture surrounding well-defined metal centers remains challenging. Here, we report the first application of gold nanocluster covalent organic frameworks (COFs) to electrocatalytic nitrate-to-ammonia conversion, establishing reticular connectivity as a strategy for programming catalytic electronic environments. Four crystalline frameworks (KIN-1–KIN-4) were constructed from a common pyrazolate-bridged Au3 cluster and structurally differentiated organic linkers. Despite preserving predominantly Au(I) centers, the frameworks exhibit distinct frontier electronic-state distributions, por","au":["Tsukasa Irie","Hayato Orui","Bindhya Krishna R","Sourav Ghosh","Tasuku Hamaguchi","Koji Yonekura"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"金纳米团簇电子态的网状编程实现硝酸盐到氨电合成近100%的法拉第效率","zb":"利用金纳米团簇共价有机框架构建四种晶体框架，通过网状连接编程催化电子环境。KIN-2在-0.70 V下实现99.5%的法拉第效率和0.75 mg h-1 cm-2的氨产率，仅0.8%的法拉第效率生成亚硝酸盐。理论计算表明优先通过*NHO氢化实现硝酸盐还原。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jpowsour.2026.241904","t":"Multi-site structural engineering for enhanced nitrate-to-ammonia electroreduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2026.241904","s":"Journal of Power Sources","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-16T21:03:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yibing Liu","Yuxuan Wu","Ying Wang","Peng Yu","Lei Wang"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"多位点结构工程增强硝酸盐到氨的电还原","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158579","t":"Ammonia Decomposition as a Hydrogen Carrier Technology: Advances in Catalyst Development","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158579","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-16T21:03:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia decomposition represents a critical pathway for clean hydrogen production in the transition toward sustainable energy systems. As a hydrogen carrier, ammonia possesses exceptional advantages including high energy density and hydrogen content, ease of liquefaction, low cost, and widespread availability. This review systematically evaluates both noble and non-noble metal-based catalysts for ammonia decomposition reactions, examining kinetic characteristics, reaction mechanisms, and major factors influencing catalytic behavior. The review systematically evaluates how synthesis techniques, metal loading, support morphology, promoter type, and operating conditions interact across various catalyst systems. Key findings show that non-precious metal catalysts offer comparable activity to ruthenium-based systems while enabling cost-effective scale-up, making them critical for advancing pr","au":["Wasim Ullah Khan","Adriana Marinoiu"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"氨分解作为氢载体技术：催化剂开发的进展","zb":"氨分解是清洁制氢的关键路径，本文系统评估了贵金属与非贵金属催化剂的动力学特征、反应机理及影响因素，指出非贵金属催化剂在活性上可与钌基体系媲美且更具成本优势，强调了人工智能驱动设计与技术经济评估在推动该技术工业化中的重要作用。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1016/j.biombioe.2026.110302","t":"Effects of interactions between amino acids and glucose on biomass ammonia production: Integration of ReaxFF-MD and machine learning","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biombioe.2026.110302","s":"Biomass and Bioenergy","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-17T05:03:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Shuai Guo","Yike Li","Zhuozhi Wang","Li Xu","Hongwei Qu","Fei Gao"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"氨基酸与葡萄糖相互作用对生物质氨生产的影响：ReaxFF-MD 与机器学习的集成","bt":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta07318b","t":"Nitrate Electrosynthesison Cation-Vacancy-Rich FeSb2O4 Microrods via Controlled Ammonia Dehydrogenation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta07318b","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-16T21:03:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Electrochemical ammonia oxidation reaction (AOR) on noble and non-noble metal-based anodes often leads to non-selective N-containing products like N2, N2O, and NOx. Herein, Schafarzikite-type FeSb2O4, prepared under mild hydrothermal conditions,...","au":["Deepak Kumar Sahu","Hirak Kumar Basak","Pralok K. Samanta","Asit Dutta","Biswarup Chakraborty"],"o":"日常","zt":"通过受控氨脱氢在富阳离子空位FeSb2O4微棒上电合成硝酸盐","zb":"在温和水热条件下制备Schafarzikite型FeSb2O4微棒，利用其丰富的阳离子空位促进氨脱氢反应，从而高效电合成硝酸盐。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158571","t":"Levelized Cost of Renewable Ammonia in Kenya and Tunisia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158571","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This study presents a techno-economic optimization of green ammonia (NH 3 ) production in Kenya and Tunisia. In each country, two renewable energy (RE) locations are assessed for an ammonia plant linked to an export opportunity: one site with the most favorable renewable resources and one located near the demand site. The better renewable potential offsets the higher transmission cost associated with longer distances, leading to Levelized Cost of Ammonia (LCOA) of 1258 €/t NH3 and 1542 €/t NH3 at the resource-optimal sites compared with 1350 €/t NH3 and 1601 €/t NH3 for RE generation near the demand site in Kenya and Tunisia, respectively. The results strongly depend on the weighted average cost of capital (WACC), transmission distance, and power line cost. Locating ammonia synthesis at the RE site and transporting ammonia to the demand site may further reduce LCOA.","au":["Johann Fetköter","Benedikt Häckner","Lukas Jansen"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"肯尼亚和突尼斯可再生氨的平准化成本","zb":"本研究对肯尼亚和突尼斯的绿色氨生产进行了技术经济优化，评估了两个可再生能源位置。在资源最优站点，氨的平准化成本分别为1258 €/t NH3和1542 €/t NH3，而靠近需求端的站点成本分别为1350 €/t NH3和1601 €/t NH3。结果表明，LCOA强烈依赖于加权平均资本成本、传输距离和输电线路成本，将合成厂建在可再生能源站点并运输氨可进一步降低成本。"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.78950","t":"Breaking Scaling Relations to Achieve an Electrochemical Potential Window Strategy for Highly Selective Urea Electrosynthesis From N2 and CO2","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.78950","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-16","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The electrochemical potential window strategy allows to selectively boost C−N coupling to urea and inhibits the over-hydrogenation of intermediates, which is realized on a multi-site NbCo 3 intermetallic compound through imposing a dynamic strain effect on intermediates. ABSTRACT Electrochemical co-reduction of nitrogen (N 2 ) and carbon dioxide (CO 2 ) under ambient conditions offers a sustainable route for urea synthesis, while this desirable pathway suffers from selectivity challenge because of an inferior competition with numerous parallel reactions. Available strategy to selectively boost urea electrosynthesis and suppress the competitive reactions is absent, because they share the same intermediates which are limited by the well-established scaling relations. Herein, we design a multi-site NbCo 3 intermetallic compound, which imposes a dynamic strain effect on intermediates to brea","au":["Tian‐Yi Dai","Tong‐Hui Wang","Qing Jiang"],"o":"日常","why":["reduction of nitrogen"],"zt":"打破标度关系以实现从 N2 和 CO2 高选择性电合成尿素的电化学电位窗口策略","zb":"研究者在室温下利用多位点 NbCo3 金属间化合物，通过施加动态应变效应打破标度关系，实现了 N2 和 CO2 共还原的高选择性尿素合成。基于恒电位密度泛函理论计算，当电极电位低于 -0.25 V vs RHE 时，NbCo3 (001) 表现出对尿素合成的优先选择性。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15012231/v1","t":"SACred: mining the Protein Data Bank for single-atom catalyst sites","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15012231/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-11-15","f":"2026-11-16T21:03:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"Single-atom catalysts (SACs) are built from a small set of sites, most often a metal held by four nitrogens, while enzymes run hydrogen evolution, O2 and CO2 reduction and N2 fixation on single metals in many different first coordination shells. Here we mine that diversity. SACred, an automated pipeline built and run with AI agents, reduces every transition-metal site of the Protein Data Bank (PDB) to its first coordination shell, turns the recurring shells into candidate SAC sites and screens them in a funnel: each shell is mapped onto a single or double vacancy in graphene, screened with GFN2-xTB calibrated per metal against DFT, refined with PBE-D3 DFT for hydrogen adsorption (∆GH), formation energy (Ef) and dissolution potential (Udiss), simulated at 1,500 K with a fine-tuned MACE force field and checked against the literature by agents. From 291,977 metal sites in 53,868 PDB entries","au":["Frederic Schubert","Anna Silvestrova"],"o":"日常","why":["N2 fixation"],"zt":"SACred：从蛋白质数据库挖掘单原子催化剂位点","zb":"开发了一种名为SACred的自动化AI管道，用于从蛋白质数据库中筛选潜在的金属单原子位点。该工具将过渡金属位点映射到石墨烯的单或双空位上，利用GFN2-xTB和PBE-D3 DFT方法筛选氢吸附能、形成能和溶解电位，最终从291,977个位点中筛选出1,155个候选位点。","ob":"析氢反应","pre":1},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-026-79620-4","t":"Phosphorus-mediated reverse hydrogen spillover enables rate-matched nitrate-sulfate paired electrolysis for ammonium persulfate synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-79620-4","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2026-11-15","f":"2026-11-15T17:44:04Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Electrochemical conversion of nitrate-rich wastewater to valuable ammonium salts is promising. We report a phosphorus-mediated reverse hydrogen spillover mechanism that synchronizes nitrate-reduction and sulfate-oxidation kinetics, enabling direct electrosynthesis of ammonium persulfate.","au":["Yaobin Wang"],"o":"日常","zt":"磷介导的反向氢溢流实现硝酸盐-硫酸盐配对电解速率匹配以合成过硫酸铵","zb":"针对含硝酸盐废水，研究提出一种磷介导的反向氢溢流机制，通过同步硝酸盐还原与硫酸氧化的动力学，实现过硫酸铵的直接电合成。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.mcat.2026.116480","t":"Ultra-low Ru doping triggers Ni/CeO2 synergy for superior low-temperature ammonia decomposition to hydrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mcat.2026.116480","s":"Molecular Catalysis","d":"2026-11-15","f":"2026-11-15T17:44:04Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jianyu Li","Yong Chen","Kaihao Fan","Yingying Jin","Yugang Ma","Mengying Liang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"超低Ru掺杂触发Ni/CeO2协同作用实现低温氨分解制氢","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142079","t":"Matching spontaneous oxidation to electrochemical regeneration of cobalt via a carbon shell for nitrate-to-ammonia electroreduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142079","s":"Fuel","d":"2026-11-15","f":"2026-11-16T02:42:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Kun Yang","Zihan Zhang","Wei Song","Yifan Dou","Lixin Zhang","Ruina Shi"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"通过碳壳匹配钴的自发氧化与电化学再生用于硝酸盐至氨的电还原","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c20417","t":"Directional Nitrite Spillover Couples to Interfacial Hydrogen-Bond Networks for Ampere-Level Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c20417","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-11-14","f":"2026-11-16T02:42:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia is often constrained by the proton-coupled hydrogenation of adsorbed nitrite (*NO2), a step commonly accelerated through hydrogen spillover and local reactive-hydrogen (*H) supply. This hydrogen-centered view, however, treats *NO2 largely as a passive intermediate and overlooks whether its migration can reconstruct the interfacial hydrogen-bond-network environment required for downstream hydrogenation. Here, we show that directional *NO2 spillover couples site-specific intermediate transport with interfacial hydrogen-bond-network reorganization. In a Cu–Ag dual-site model interface, nitrate activation and *NO2 formation occur preferentially on the Cu sites, whereas migrated *NO2 species are stabilized and hydrogenated on the Ag-associated sites. In situ spectroscopy, kinetic isotope measurements, distribution-of-relaxation-time analy","au":["Qingshuang Xu","Kangyu Lou","Zihan Liu","Xuesong Zhao","Jesse S. Dondapati","Zhiguang Zhang"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"方向性亚硝酸根溢流与界面氢键网络耦合用于安培级硝酸盐至氨的电合成","zb":"研究对象为 Cu–Ag 双位点模型界面，关键方法为原位光谱、动力学同位素测量、弛豫时间分布分析和理论模拟，主要结果为 Cu 至 Ag 的传递富集 K+ 相关的界面水，增强氢键连通性，促进 *H 传递用于亚硝酸根氢化，优化后的 CuAg N 掺杂碳催化剂对 NH3 的法拉第效率接近 1，产率率为 411.8 mmol g–1 h–1，在 1 A cm–2 下保持 83% 的法拉第效率，并在模拟和真实工业水基质中保持显著的硝酸盐至氨的回收率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ccr.2026.218760","t":"Electrocatalytic reduction of nitrogen oxides for hydroxylamine and oxime derivatives: selective mechanisms and catalytic design","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ccr.2026.218760","s":"Coordination Chemistry Reviews","d":"2026-11-14","f":"2026-11-15T02:37:18Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Hao Liang","Jian Li","Zhihao Liu","Wei Yi","Jian Ke","Jianqiu Chen"],"o":"日常","why":["reduction of nitrogen"],"zt":"用于羟基胺和肟衍生物的氮氧化物电催化还原：选择性机理与催化设计","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6se00020g","t":"Emerging Pathways for Clean Ammonia Production and Direct Utilization","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6se00020g","s":"Sustainable Energy & Fuels","d":"2026-11-13","f":"2026-11-13T18:31:35Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"As more commercial players are seriously starting to decarbonize their operations, ammonia is emerging as a promising clean energy carrier. Its current large-scale production infrastructure, high energy density, and mild...","au":["Zakaria Hsain","Abhi Karkamkar"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zb":"随着更多商业参与者开始脱碳，氨作为一种有前景的清洁能源载体正在兴起。其现有的大规模生产基础设施、高能量密度和温和的反应条件使其成为能源领域的重要选择。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.eja.2026.128424","t":"Balancing food–environment–economy: A multi-criteria assessment of nitrogen reduction combined with biochar under ridge–furrow plastic film mulching systems","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.eja.2026.128424","s":"European Journal of Agronomy","d":"2026-11-13","f":"2026-11-14T03:10:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yufeng Lv","Yanan Jiao","Yiwei Lu","Zhongmin Cai","Yan Zhang","Yuncheng Liao"],"o":"日常","zt":"平衡食物-环境-经济：结合生物炭的氮还原的多标准评估在垄作-沟作地膜覆盖系统下","bt":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c04945","t":"Bioinspired Multi-metallic Relay Catalyst for Efficient Nitrate Reduction and Zn-NO3– Battery Performance","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c04945","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-11-13","f":"2026-11-14T17:09:43Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (e-NO3– RR) to ammonia offers an effective pathway for environmental remediation and clean energy production. However, its efficiency is often constrained by sluggish multi-electron/proton transfer and mismatched intermediate adsorption. Herein, we report a bioinspired multi-metallic cobalt copper molybdate (CCM) catalyst that overcomes these limitations through a relay-type catalytic mechanism enabled by spatially distinct metal centers. In this architecture, Cu, Co, and Mo sites cooperatively orchestrate intermediate stabilization and proton activation in successive reaction steps, thereby facilitating an efficient cascade conversion of nitrate to ammonia. As a result, the optimized CCM catalyst achieves an ammonia yield rate of 2.6 mmol h–1 cm–2 and a Faradaic efficiency up to 92%. Combined experimental and theoretical analyses identify the ","au":["Kajal Sharma","Rostislav Langer","Daina D.A. Buelvas","Vinicius T. Santana","Radek Zbořil","Michal Otyepka"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"受生物启发的多金属接力催化剂用于高效硝酸盐还原及 Zn-NO3– 电池性能","zb":"研究报道了一种受生物启发的多金属钴铜钼酸盐（CCM）催化剂，通过空间分离的金属位点实现接力催化机制。该催化剂协同稳定中间体并活化质子，实现硝酸盐到氨的高效级联转化，氨产率达到 2.6 mmol h–1 cm–2，法拉第效率高达 92%。将 CCM 催化剂集成到 Zn-NO3– 电池中，输出电压为 1.34 V，功率密度为 4.1 mW cm–2。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1080/09593330.2026.2759892","t":"Strong metal–support interaction-engineered Cu/LaO x interfaces for selective electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1080/09593330.2026.2759892","s":"Environmental Technology","d":"2026-11-13","f":"2026-11-13T18:31:35Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction offers a promising route for removing nitrate contaminants from water while recovering nitrogen as ammonia, but its practical efficiency is limited by sluggish nitrate activation and competing hydrogen evolution. Herein, we report a strong metal–support interaction-engineered Cu/LaOx catalyst for selective nitrate-to-ammonia conversion. The optimized Cu/LaOx interface was constructed by regulating the Cu/LaOx ratio, where LaOx partially encapsulates Cu sites and induces interfacial La–O–Cu bonding, oxygen vacancies, and electronic redistribution around Cu centres. These interfacial features enhance nitrate adsorption, accelerate deoxygenation, and facilitate subsequent hydrogenation steps. As a result, the optimized 1:1Cu/LaOx-3DOMC catalyst achieves a high ammonia yield rate of 0.8961 mmol h−1 cm−2 and a Faradaic efficiency of 94.5% at −0.64 V versus r","au":["Xianyuan Xu","Yucan Luo","Dengsheng Ma","Peiyuan Zheng","Cheng Chi","Jingru Hu"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"强金属-载体相互作用工程化的 Cu/LaO x 界面用于选择性电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"通过调控 Cu/LaOx 比例构建优化的 Cu/LaOx 界面，LaOx 部分包覆 Cu 位点并诱导界面 La-O-Cu 键合、氧空位及电子重分布。该催化剂在 -0.64 V vs RHE 下实现 0.8961 mmol h−1 cm−2 的氨产率和 94.5% 的法拉第效率，显著优于无 LaOx 的 Cu 催化剂。原位 FTIR 和 DFT 计算证实界面耦合促进了 *H 辅助硝酸盐脱氧和 *NO 氢化，同时抑制了析氢反应。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsenergylett.6c02646","t":"Tuning Mass Transport through Pressure Modulation for Lithium-Mediated Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c02646","s":"ACS Energy Letters","d":"2026-11-13","f":"2026-11-13T18:31:35Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction (LiNRR) produces ammonia at ambient pressure and temperature, and gas diffusion electrodes (GDEs) have advanced its production rate by intensifying nitrogen availability. However, the mass transport of lithium, nitrogen, and proton donor within the GDE and how the balance of their fluxes governs LiNRR performance remain underexplored. Here, we spatiotemporally varied the balance of species fluxes in a LiNRR GDE by dynamically modulating the pressure difference across the electrode, which altered the position of the gas/electrolyte interface. We found that decoupling the pressures applied during the plating and resting steps of pulsed electrolysis leads to higher ammonia production rates compared to the corresponding static pressure conditions. Decoupled pressure modulation enables even lithium plating during electrolysis and fast transport of ","au":["Gang San Lee","Justin C. Bui","Michael A. Yusov","Spencer P. Delgado-Kukuczka","Ali R. Sial","Florian M. Grass"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"通过压力调制调控锂介导氮还原中的质量传输","zb":"通过动态调节气体扩散电极两侧的压力差，改变气液界面位置，从而调控锂、氮和质子供体的通量平衡。研究发现，在脉冲电解的沉积和休止步骤中解耦压力，能提高氨产率，并实现电解过程中的锂沉积及后续氨生成步骤中氮和质子供体的快速传输。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141983","t":"Synergistic plasma-catalytic NH3 synthesis enabled by morphology-controlled Ni/CeO2 at atmospheric pressure","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141983","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-11-13","f":"2026-11-18T19:24:37Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Decentralized, electricity-driven ammonia (NH3) synthesis under mild conditions remains challenging because of the low utilization efficiency of plasma-activated species and the limited understanding of plasma-catalyst interactions. Herein, we investigate plasma-assisted NH3 synthesis over Ni/CeO2 catalysts with irregular, rod-like, and sphere-like ceria supports in a dielectric barrier discharge (DBD) reactor operated at atmospheric pressure and 100 °C. Among the catalysts examined, the sphere-like Ni/CeO2 catalyst (Ni/CeO2-s) exhibits the highest NH3 synthesis rate, exceeding 15,000 μmol·gcat-1·h-1 at a specific energy input (SEI) of 75 kJ·L-1, compared with ~12,000 and ~ 10,700 μmol·gcat-1·h-1 for the irregular and rod-like counterparts, respectively. Under a power of 50 W and a SEI of 75 kJ·L-1, Ni/CeO2-s also delivered an energy yield of approximately 3.7 g·kWh-1. Structure-performa","au":["Xurui Chen","Qi Chen","Xiaokun Yi","Jie Chen","Running Kang","Feng Bin"],"o":"日常","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"zt":"大气压下由形貌可控Ni/CeO2协同等离子催化NH3合成","zb":"在常压和100 °C下，研究了Ni/CeO2催化剂在介质阻挡放电反应器中的等离子辅助NH3合成。球状Ni/CeO2催化剂表现出最高的NH3合成速率，在特定能量输入75 kJ·L−1时超过15,000 μmol·gcat−1·h−1，能量产率约为3.7 g·kWh−1。球状形貌促进了活性氮氢物种的生成与利用，从而增强了N2活化和表面NxHy*中间体的氢化。","ob":"其他催化反应"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127791","t":"Dynamic self-healing metal-organic frameworks for efficient electrocatalytic nitrate to ammonia conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127791","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environmental","d":"2026-11-13","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Zhipeng Pei","Yaqi Liu","Peilin Huang","Fei He","Jiacheng Li","Yitingyu Zhou"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"用于高效电催化硝酸盐-氨转化的动态自修复金属有机框架","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.55092/aimat20260014","t":"Unraveling the activity origin of M₂CO₂ MXene-supported single-atom catalysts for nitrate electroreduction: a combined DFT and machine learning study","u":"https://doi.org/10.55092/aimat20260014","s":"AI & Materials","d":"2026-11-13","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (NO₃RR) offers a transformative route for pollutant remediation and green synthesis, yet rational catalyst design remains challenging. We combined density functional theory (DFT) with machine learning (ML) to study TM@M₂CO₂ systems (M = Mo, W, and Cr; TM = 3d–5d metals). Of the 150 models, 16 passed screening for stability (formation energy and dissolution potential) and selectivity (suppression of the hydrogen evolution reaction, HER). Their limiting potentials (UL) were −0.38 V for CuI@Mo₂CO₂ and −0.45 V for RuII@W₂CO₂. These two systems are the most promising NO₃RR candidates among the systems studied. Mechanistic and kinetic analyses confirmed that both catalysts can activate nitrate effectively and exhibit lower barriers for the potential-determining step than for HER. Feature-importance and Shapley Additive Explanations (SHAP) analyses ","au":["Jing Xu","Yuqi Qiu","Wenxi Han","Jinghao Zhang","Yuan Li","Xueru Wang"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"揭示M₂CO₂ MXene负载单原子催化剂硝酸盐电还原活性起源：结合DFT和机器学习研究","zb":"结合密度泛函理论和机器学习研究了TM@M₂CO₂体系（M = Mo, W, Cr; TM = 3d–5d金属）的硝酸盐电还原制氨活性。筛选出16个稳定且抑制析氢反应的模型，其中CuI@Mo₂CO₂和RuII@W₂CO₂的极限电位分别为-0.38 V和-0.45 V。特征重要性和SHAP分析确定了平均TM-O键长、硝酸盐吸附自由能和TM电负性为关键描述符，揭示了TM-O键长与预测极限电位之间的非线性关系。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acssensors.6c04300","t":"Atomically Dispersed Pt/Pd Enables Cascade Adsorption–Oxidation for Enhanced Chemiresistive Ammonia Sensing","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssensors.6c04300","s":"ACS Sensors","d":"2026-11-13","f":"2026-11-14T03:10:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Atomically dispersed noble-metal sensitizers offer an effective means of enhancing semiconductor metal oxide gas sensors, yet a single type of atomic noble-metal site is often insufficient to optimize both gas adsorption and catalytic oxidation. Here, atomically dispersed Pt and Pd sites are co-engineered on mesoporous SnO2 nanospheres to establish a cascade adsorption–oxidation pathway for enhanced NH3 sensing. The Pt/Pd–SnO2 sensor exhibits 4.1-, 6.2-, and 26-fold higher NH3 sensitivity than Pt–SnO2, Pd–SnO2, and mesoporous SnO2, respectively, with a calculated detection limit of 100 ppb and a response time of approximately 2 s. In situ spectroscopy, temperature-programmed desorption, and density functional theory calculations reveal that Pd-associated defect motifs promote the adsorption of NH3 and O2, whereas Pt–O–Sn motifs facilitate the subsequent oxidation of adsorbed NH3","au":["Ping Li","Ou Wang","Peizhen Li","Leiyu Diao","Yaqiong Su","Yonghui Deng"],"o":"日常","zt":"原子分散的 Pt/Pd 使能级联吸附-氧化以增强化学电阻式氨传感","zb":"研究对象为原子分散的 Pt 和 Pd 位点在介孔 SnO2 纳米球上的共工程，建立级联吸附-氧化途径以增强 NH3 传感。Pt/Pd–SnO2 传感器对 NH3 的灵敏度比 Pt–SnO2、Pd–SnO2 和介孔 SnO2 分别高 4.1、6.2 和 26 倍，计算检测限为 100 ppb，响应时间约为 2 s。原位光谱、程序升温脱附和密度泛函理论计算表明，与 Pd 相关的缺陷结构促进了 NH3 和 O2 的吸附，而 Pt–O–Sn 结构促进了吸附 NH3 衍生物种的后续氧化。原子分散的 Pt 和 Pd 双敏化剂的存在因此将增强吸附与加速催化氧化相结合，为高性能气体传感提供了原子级贵金属工程策略。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.168935","t":"Electrocatalytic nitric oxide reduction to ammonia on black-phosphorus-type two-dimensional monochalcogenides","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.168935","s":"Applied Surface Science","d":"2026-11-13","f":"2026-11-14T17:09:43Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The reduction of nitric oxide (NO) is a powerful method for eliminating the pollutant NO and a feasible route for synthesizing ammonia (NH 3 ) at ambient temperature, a promise to replace the energy-consuming Haber-Bosch process. However, the design of efficient catalysts with low cost and high activity to boost the complex electron transfer process is significantly challenging. Herein, we applied state-of-the-art density functional theory (DFT) calculations for the first time to investigate NO reduction on black-phosphorus-like two-dimensional monochalcogenides GeSe and SnSe, respectively. The strong bonding state between the catalyst and the adsorbate is attributed to the activation of NO, favouring NO-side adsorption and the substantial reduction to NH 3 . The catalysts are highly efficient for nitric oxide reduction reaction (NORR), as evidenced by the low limiting potentials of −0.1","au":["Md Tarikal Nasir","Yun Han","Qingchao Fang","Dimuthu Wijethunge","Xiuwen Zhou","Aijun Du"],"o":"日常","why":["synthesizing ammonia"],"zt":"黑磷型二维单硫族化合物上电催化一氧化氮还原合成氨","zb":"利用先进的密度泛函理论（DFT）计算首次研究了黑磷型二维单硫族化合物 GeSe 和 SnSe 上的 NO 还原反应。结果表明，催化剂与吸附物之间存在强键合状态，有利于 NO 侧吸附及还原为 NH3。该催化剂对 NO 还原反应（NORR）表现出高效率，极限电位分别为 −0.19 V 和 −0.11 V，且副产物（N2O 和 N2）及析氢反应（HER）受到强烈抑制。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/smtd.71203","t":"Hydrogen Bubble Engineering of Lewis Acid Sites in Phosphorene for Efficient Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smtd.71203","s":"Small Methods","d":"2026-11-13","f":"2026-11-13T18:31:35Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT The electrochemical synthesis of ammonia through nitrogen reduction (ENRR) is hindered by N 2 inertness and competing hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Phosphorene, despite its promise, inherently lacks the eletron‐backdonation capability for effective N 2 activation. Herein, we present a water‐free hydrogen bubble electroetching strategy to simultaneously exfoliate and engineer black phosphorus into defect‐rich porous phosphorene (D‐BP ene ) with abundant in‐plane phosphorus vacancies for ENRR catalysis. Four‐dimensional scanning transmission electron microscopy resolves distorted hexagonal rings where pairs of P atoms from the upper and lower sub‐layers show mutually perpendicular orientations. D‐BP ene exhibits superior electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction performance, achieving a high NH 3 yield of 14.94 µg h −1 mg cat −1 at −0.05 V versus RHE and a Faradaic efficie","au":["Peisen Zhao","Jun Man","Qingqing Ye","Wansheng Hao","Jiarui Zhang","Yong Ning"],"o":"日常","why":["synthesis of ammonia"],"zt":"磷烯路易斯酸位点氢气泡工程用于高效氮还原","zb":"采用无水氢气泡电刻蚀策略剥离并制备富含缺陷的磷烯，利用磷空位作为路易斯酸位点，增强σ供体和π反供体作用，降低决速步能垒。该催化剂在超低过电位92 mV下实现了14.94 µg h−1 mg cat−1的氨产率和35.51%的法拉第效率，且稳定性超过36小时。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-026-79171-8","t":"Evolution of the molybdenum and vanadium cycles through time and their impact on ancient nitrogen fixation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-79171-8","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2026-11-12","f":"2026-11-12T18:57:08Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"Partitioning experiments and Fe-rich sediments show V was removed from Archean– Paleoproterozoic seawater more efficiently than Mo, enriching seawater in Mo relative to V and helping explain the early evolution of Mo-based nitrogenase.","au":["Weiduo Hao"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"通过时间和钼与钒循环及其对古代固氮的影响","zb":"研究对象为古代-古元古代海水中的钼和钒循环，通过分区实验和富铁沉积物研究，发现钒比钼更有效地从海水中去除，使海水中的钼相对于钒富集，有助于解释早期基于钼的固氮的演化。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c16282","t":"Ammonia-Driven Nanoscale Surface Restructuring of Copper Catalysts during Nitrate Reduction Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c16282","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-11-12","f":"2026-11-12T18:57:08Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract The electrolyte and applied potential are known to impact a catalyst’s structure and performance, yet the role of reaction intermediates and products in driving surface evolution remains largely unexplored. Here, using electrochemical atomic force microscopy, we show that the dynamic restructuring of copper (Cu) surfaces during nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) directly correlates with the rate and selectivity of ammonia (NH3) formation. At moderate overpotentials, where nitrite formation dominates, lateral expansion of Cu terraces is observed, whereas rapid NH3 formation at higher cathodic potentials induces Cu adislands enriched in low-coordinated step sites, revealing distinct restructuring pathways that accompany the transition from nitrite- to ammonia-selective NO3RR. These transformations are rationalized by an NH3-mediated Cu dissolution-redeposition mechanism. Our resul","au":["Yujie Peng","Mael Brule","Yawei Zhou","Beatriz Roldan Cuenya","Christopher S. Kley"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"在硝酸盐还原反应期间铜催化剂的纳米级表面重构受氨驱动","zb":"研究铜催化剂在硝酸盐还原反应中的表面重构，发现动态重构与氨形成速率和选择性直接相关。在中等过电位下，观察到铜台地的横向扩展，而在高阴极电位下快速形成氨时，观察到富集在低配位台阶位点的铜吸附岛，揭示了从亚硝酸盐到氨选择性的硝酸盐还原反应的转换过程中不同的重构途径。这些转变通过氨介导的铜溶解-再沉积机制得到解释。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta07397b","t":"Advances in MXene-based Materials for Electrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction: Machine Learning-Driven Design and Experimental Exploration","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta07397b","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-11-12","f":"2026-11-12T03:47:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia is a critical bulk commodity chemical for sustaining the growing global population. Despite the maturity of the traditional Haber-Bosch ammonia synthesis process, its heavy fossil fuel dependence and high...","au":["Shihao Wang","Shaobin Li","Li Zhang","Xiaoqing Lv","Huiwen Jia"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zb":"氨是维持全球人口增长的关键大宗化学品。尽管传统的Haber–Bosch氨合成工艺已成熟，但其对化石燃料的依赖性高且...","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c07588","t":"Modulating NO3–/H2O Competitive Adsorption via a Defective ZnO/Cu Single–Atom for Ammonia Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c07588","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2026-11-12","f":"2026-11-12T03:47:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NitRR) offers a sustainable route for nitrate removal and ammonia production, yet its efficiency is limited by sluggish multistep kinetics and competitive hydrogen evolution. Herein, a CuSA–ZnO@CW electrocatalyst was constructed by stabilizing O–coordinated Cu single atoms on defective ZnO supported by carbonized wood. The conductive wood-derived scaffold facilitates mass/electron transport, while the defective ZnO/Cu–O3 interface regulates local adsorption competition between NO3– and H2O. CuSA–ZnO@CW delivers an NH3 yield of 3561.9 μg h–1 cm–2 and a Faradaic efficiency of 97.07% at –1.1 V vs RHE, with stable performance over 36 cycles. Mechanistic studies reveal that ZnO preferentially accommodates interfacial H2O, whereas Cu–O3 sites selectively activate NO3– and promote NOX intermediate conversion, thereby reducing the free-energy","au":["Yuanyuan Yu","Lujie Chen","Hewei Hou","Huashuang Huo","Huibing He","Douyong Min"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zb":"构建了CuSA–ZnO@CW电催化剂，利用导电木材衍生的支架促进质量/电子传输，缺陷ZnO/Cu–O3界面调节NO3–与H2O的局部吸附竞争。在–1.1 V vs RHE下，NH3产率为3561.9 μg h–1 cm–2，法拉第效率为97.07%，且性能稳定36个循环。机制研究表明ZnO优先容纳界面H2O，而Cu–O3位点选择性激活NO3–并促进NOX中间体转化，从而降低决速步的自由能要求并抑制析氢反应。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.17185/duepublico/88455","t":"Atomic-scale insights into Mo-based MXenes for controlling selectivity in competing nitrogen reduction and hydrogen evolution reactions","u":"https://doi.org/10.17185/duepublico/88455","s":"DuEPublico (University of Duisburg-Essen)","d":"2026-11-12","f":"2026-11-13T18:31:35Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) offers a sustainable route to ammonia synthesis under ambient conditions; however, its practical realization is fundamentally limited by the competing hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), which dominates under the same cathodic potential window. Molybdenum-based MXenes have emerged as a promising catalyst class due to their tunable surface chemistry and intrinsic electronic flexibility, yet a mechanistic understanding of how NRR and HER compete on these surfaces has remained incomplete. This thesis addresses this challenge using a density functional theory (DFT) framework to resolve catalytic behavior under electrochemical conditions and to identify the fundamental origin of selectivity. The work is structured around four complementary strategies for modulating the surface structure and chemistry of Mo-based MXenes to control the compet","au":["Diwakar Singh"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于钼基MXene控制竞争性氮还原与析氢反应选择性的原子尺度洞察","zb":"利用密度泛函理论框架研究钼基MXene表面结构调控策略，发现氮富集环境可增强氮活化并抑制氢吸附，从而逆转催化选择性。研究表明，混合氟、氧和羟基表面配置能提供NRR活性和HER抑制的最佳平衡，且晶格应变和电势诱导表面重构也能有效调控反应选择性。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142128","t":"Poplar catkin-derived porous carbon for enhanced ammonia borane thermal dehydrogenation via synergistic nanoconfinement and surface anchoring","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142128","s":"Fuel","d":"2026-11-12","f":"2026-11-12T18:57:08Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Wenlong Lv","Xiaojing Wei","Haiyan Song","Yanan Feng","Zhuhe Zhai","Shengqiang Chen"],"o":"日常","zt":"柳树花毛刺衍生的多孔碳通过协同纳米限域和表面锚定增强氨硼烷热脱氢","ob":"氨硼烷水解；涉及碳材料","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/cphc.70624","t":"Early N─O Bond Cleavage Unlocks Barrier‐Free Nitric Oxide Electroreduction to Ammonia on B‐Doped GeS 2 Monolayer: A Comprehensive Density Functional Theory Study","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cphc.70624","s":"ChemPhysChem","d":"2026-11-12","f":"2026-11-14T17:09:43Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Electrochemical reduction of nitric oxide (NO) to ammonia (NH 3 ) integrates pollutant abatement with green chemical synthesis. Using density functional theory with the computational hydrogen electrode model, we investigate NO electroreduction on a boron‐doped GeS 2 monolayer (B@S‐GeS 2 ) containing complementary Ge and B active centers. At the Ge site, the distal pathway operates as the minimum‐energy pathway under gas‐ and aqueous‐phase conditions, achieving a barrier‐free limiting potential ( U L = 0 V vs. RHE) driven by early N─O bond cleavage following double O‐end protonation. Conversely, the electron‐deficient B site exhibits stronger NO binding ( E ads = −2.14 eV). Although strong postcleavage N stabilization yields U L = −0.218 V, implicit solvation stabilizes polar intermediates, establishing a near‐degenerate dual‐pathway mechanism (Δ U L = 0.027 V). Both sites intrinsically s","au":["Venkata Surya Kumar Choutipalli","Naga Venkateswara Rao Nulakani","Ramachandran Sathees Kumar","Muthupandi Senthilkumar","V. Subramanian"],"o":"日常","zt":"早期 N─O 键断裂解锁 B 掺杂 GeS2 单层上无障碍一氧化氮电还原合成氨：综合密度泛函理论研究","zb":"利用计算氢电极模型，研究了含互补 Ge 和 B 活性中心的硼掺杂 GeS2 单层（B@S-GeS2）上的 NO 电还原。在 Ge 位点，早期 N─O 键断裂和双 O 端质子化驱动了无障碍极限电位（UL = 0 V vs. RHE）。B 位点表现出强 NO 结合能（E ads = −2.14 eV），且两种位点均通过严重 H 过结合抑制析氢反应。B@S-GeS2 表现出优于基准 2D 催化剂的性能，是环境友好的 NO-到-NH3 转化平台。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsapm.6c04260","t":"Nanoscale ZnO Coatings on Poly(methyl methacrylate) Submicron Spheres via Low-Temperature Atomic Layer Deposition for Enhanced UV-Blocking Properties","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsapm.6c04260","s":"ACS Applied Polymer Materials","d":"2026-11-11","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Poly(methyl methacrylate) (PMMA), a synthetic thermoplastic polymer, has been extensively used in our lives due to its advantageous properties such as high transparency, lightweight, and biocompatibility. Although PMMA exhibits great potential in sunscreens, its poor UV-blocking properties hinder its practical applications. In this study, we modified the PMMA submicron spheres (120–150 nm) with nanoscale ZnO using atomic layer deposition (ALD) in a fluidized bed reactor at a low temperature of 40 °C, with diethylzinc (DEZ) and water as precursors. We systematically investigated the ZnO-coated PMMA microspheres using FTIR, XRD, SEM, TEM, XPS, and TG to elucidate the mechanism of nucleation and growth of ZnO. The results revealed that the ZnO deposited was polycrystalline, displaying a granular morphology on the PMMA surfaces. Specifically, a nanoparticle-coated structure was obse","au":["Guanghui Yan","Zhijian Lv","Yi Ouyang","Guoxiang Chen","Zehua Jin","Lu Jin"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zb":"利用原子层沉积在40 °C低温下对PMMA亚微米球进行纳米级ZnO涂层，研究ZnO的成核与生长机制。结果显示ZnO呈多晶颗粒状，在低循环ALD下形成纳米粒子涂层，高循环ALD下形成连续纳米薄膜。涂覆后PMMA在280–400 nm紫外区的反射率从约95%降至19%，平均可见光反射率保持在93%以上。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/adma.75146","t":"Locally Water‐Rich Interfacial Microenvironment Enables Self‐Powered High‐Current Ammonia Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.75146","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2026-11-11","f":"2026-11-12T18:57:08Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"This work reduces the high energy consumption of electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia by coupling the hydrazine oxidation reaction (HzOR) with the nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR). The electrocatalyst design introduces P vacancies into CoP to form an atomic-scale electric field, which enhances the activity and selectivity of both HzOR and NO 3 RR, thereby ensuring a high ammonia yield. ABSTRACT Electrochemical nitrate-to-ammonia conversion holds great promise for sustainable nitrogen fixation, yet its industrial‑level current density operation is limited by cathodic active hydrogen (*H) supply shortage and high energy consumption caused by anodic oxygen evolution reaction (OER). Here, we develop a bifunctional CoP electrocatalyst with engineered phosphorus vacancies that generate atomic-scale electric fields to enrich interfacial water molecules via enhanced hydrogen-bonding","au":["Kang Ji","Jing Wang","Jingyu Wu","Wanlong Bai","Chao Yi","Hongjing Wang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"局部富水界面微环境使自驱动高电流氨电合成成为可能","zb":"通过将肼氧化反应与硝酸盐还原反应耦合，降低了电催化硝酸盐还原至氨的高能耗。电催化剂设计将磷空位引入钴磷中形成原子级电场，增强了肼氧化反应和硝酸盐还原反应的活性和选择性，从而确保了高氨产率。电解槽在500 mA cm −2 和 0.962 V 的电池电压下提供 49.64 mg h −1 cm −2 的氨产率，并实现 0.769 g L −1 h −1 的自驱动氨生产，无需外部能量输入。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1080/00219592.2026.2750603","t":"Surrogate Model Selection and Practical Guidelines for Constrained Bayesian Optimization in Chemical Process Design: Insights from Ammonia Synthesis Simulations","u":"https://doi.org/10.1080/00219592.2026.2750603","s":"Journal of Chemical Engineering of Japan","d":"2026-11-11","f":"2026-11-12T03:47:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Constrained Bayesian optimization (BO) is a promising approach for optimizing chemical processes under limited evaluation budgets. In this study, BO was applied to an ammonia production process, and three surrogate models—Gaussian process regression (GPR), random forest (RF), and Bayesian linear regression (BLR)—were systematically compared. GPR achieved the highest optimization performance in terms of best-observed profit, whereas RF provided superior robustness with consistent identification of feasible solutions. BLR showed balanced performance with lower computational cost. Sensitivity analysis revealed that system behavior is governed by a small subset of variables, indicating low effective dimensionality. This structural property explains the strong performance of GPR. In addition, the relative performance of surrogate models was found to depend on economic conditions and optimizat","au":["Koki Ito","Souta Miyamoto","Katsuaki Tanabe"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"替代模型选择和实际指南用于化学过程设计中的约束贝叶斯优化：来自氨合成模拟的见解","zb":"将贝叶斯优化（BO）应用于氨生产过程，并系统地比较了三种替代模型：高斯过程回归（GPR）、随机森林（RF）和贝叶斯线性回归（BLR）。GPR 在最佳观测利润方面实现了最高优化性能，RF 提供了更强的鲁棒性，始终识别出可行的解决方案。BLR 表现出平衡的性能，计算成本较低。敏感性分析表明，系统行为受一小部分变量控制，表明有效维度较低。这一结构特性解释了 GPR 的强大性能。此外，替代模型的相对性能取决于经济条件和优化设置，因为主导变量的变化改变了模型的适用性。定量地，GPR 的平均最佳观测利润比 RF 和 BLR 分别高 10.4% 和 5.2%；RF 识别了 40.3% 更多可行的解决方案，BLR 仅需 GPR 和 RF 的 BO 计算时间的 1/13 和 1/319。这些结果表明，在约束 BO 中选择替代模型应根据问题结构和计算需求进行调整，而不是依赖单一模型。"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ra07025f","t":"Ultrasound-driven nitrogen oxidation: a sonoelectrochemical pathway to ammonia synthesis boosted by contact-electro-catalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ra07025f","s":"RSC Advances","d":"2026-11-11","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"A new method was developed for green ammonia production by integrating ultrasound-assisted nitrogen activation and electrochemical NO x reduction to NH 3 .","au":["Arash Toghraei","Daniel Guay"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zb":"开发了一种通过超声辅助氮活化与电化学NOx还原制氨的新方法，利用接触电催化机制提升氨合成效率。","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/w18222814","t":"Catalyst Engineering for Urea-Assisted Water Splitting: Bridging Energy and Remediation","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/w18222814","s":"Water","d":"2026-11-11","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Electrocatalytic water splitting (EWS) offers a sustainable route for green hydrogen (H2) generation; however, the anodic oxygen evolution reaction (OER) suffers from sluggish kinetics and high thermodynamic overpotential, severely hindering overall system efficiency. Replacing the traditional OER with the urea oxidation reaction (UOR) offers a highly attractive alternative, as it lowers the cell voltage needed for hydrogen evolution and can contribute to the treatment of urea-containing wastewater, provided that urea is converted selectively to N2. This review comprehensively examines recent advances in electrocatalytic materials for urea-assisted water splitting (UAWS). It highlights key catalyst engineering strategies, including compositional tuning, heteroatom doping, and modification of structural and morphological, phase and interface properties, electronic conductivity, and durabi","au":["Md Ahasan Habib"],"o":"日常","zt":"尿素辅助水分解的催化剂工程：连接能源与修复","zb":"该综述探讨了尿素辅助水分解（UAWS）以替代传统的析氧反应（OER），旨在降低产氢电压并处理含尿素废水。文章评估了催化剂工程策略，包括组分调控、掺杂和结构修饰，并对比了四种标准，为设计高性能、低成本且可扩展的资源正性能源系统提供指导。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1080/00103624.2026.2762883","t":"Effects of Integrated Nitrogen Management on Productivity, Profitability and Nitrogen Use Efficiency of Little Millet Cultivars ( Panicum sumatrense L.) Under Rainfed Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1080/00103624.2026.2762883","s":"Communications in Soil Science and Plant Analysis","d":"2026-11-11","f":"2026-11-12T18:57:08Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Despite its importance as a climate-resilient nutri-cereal, little millet has received limited attention with respect to nitrogen management and nitrogen use efficiency (NUE) studies. Excessive reliance on inorganic fertilizers often leads to poor nitrogen utilization, whereas integrated application of organic and inorganic nitrogen sources may improve nitrogen uptake and crop productivity. Therefore, a field experiment was conducted during the kharif seasons of 2023 and 2024 at the Research Farm of Advanced Center for Rainfed Agriculture, Rakh Dhiansar, Sher-e-Kashmir University of Agricultural Sciences and Technology of Jammu to evaluate the effect of cultivars and nitrogen management practices on growth, yield, nitrogen uptake and NUE of little millet. The experiment was laid out in randomized complete block design with factorial arrangement and replicated thrice, comprising three cul","au":["Meenakshi Gupta","Brinder Singh","Vivek Bhagat","Banti","Dhamni Patyal"],"o":"日常","zt":"集成氮管理对雨养条件下小米品种（ Panicum sumatrense L.）的产量、盈利能力和氮利用效率的影响","zb":"对小米品种（ Panicum sumatrense L.）在雨养条件下的生长、产量、氮吸收和氮利用效率（NUE）进行了研究。实验包括三种品种和六种氮管理处理。BL 6 (V2) 品种在生长参数、产量属性、谷粒产量、秸秆产量、氮吸收和 NUE 方面显著高于 GPUL 6 (V1) 和当地品种（V3）。氮处理中，10 kg ha−1 的厩肥（FYM）+ 30 kg ha−1 的尿素（N6）显著高于其他处理，除了 40 kg ha−1 的尿素（N2），两者在统计学上相当。N2 的成本效益比最高。谷粒产量与每穗粒数（R2 = 0.99）和总氮吸收（R2 = 0.93）呈正相关，系数最高。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta07581a","t":"Enhanced Nitrate Electroreduction to Ammonia via An Active Hydrogen Pump Gated by Hydrogen-Bonding Network","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta07581a","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-11-11","f":"2026-11-12T03:47:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate-to-ammonia (NO3- → NH3) conversion offers a green route for nitrate valorization, but its efficiency is severely limited by slow hydrogenation kinetics arising from insufficient active hydrogen (*H) supply....","au":["Yuzhong Fang","Hansong Zhang","Ziwei Zhao","Xiangxiang Cheng","Wan Zhang","Yong-Ho Ra"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"通过氢键网络门控的活性氢泵增强硝酸盐电还原为氨","zb":"电催化硝酸盐到氨（NO3- → NH3）的转化提供了一条绿色路线，但其效率受限于缓慢的氢化动力学，这是由于活性氢（*H）供应不足造成的。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.iecr.6c04260","t":"Single-Atom-Based Catalysts for the Efficient Synthesis of Dimethyl Carbonate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.iecr.6c04260","s":"Industrial & Engineering Chemistry Research","d":"2026-11-11","f":"2026-11-12T03:47:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract As a low-toxic and environmentally benign organic chemical feedstock, dimethyl carbonate exhibits widespread applications in numerous fields. Accordingly, the development of highly efficient and stable catalysts constitutes a key research focus for dimethyl carbonate synthesis. Recently, single-atom-based catalysts have emerged as a frontier in heterogeneous catalysis witnessing rapid development. Despite the considerable potential of single-atom-based catalysts for dimethyl carbonate synthesis, comprehensive and systematic overviews of the relevant research progress remain insufficient. Therefore, this review comprehensively summarizes the advances in single-atom-based catalysts for the synthesis of dimethyl carbonate via routes including transesterification, methanol oxidative carbonylation, methyl nitrite carbonylation, and electrosynthesis, while elaborating on their prepara","au":["Xin Tian","Chunli Li","Wenchao Peng","Jiapeng Liu"],"o":"日常","zt":"基于单原子的催化剂用于高效合成碳酸二甲酯","zb":"碳酸二甲酯作为一种低毒性和环境友好的有机化学原料，在许多领域具有广泛的应用。因此，开发高效和稳定的催化剂是碳酸二甲酯合成关键研究重点。最近，基于单原子的催化剂作为多相催化的前沿领域迅速发展。尽管基于单原子的催化剂在碳酸二甲酯合成中具有巨大潜力，但相关研究进展的综合和系统概述仍然不足。因此，本综述全面总结了通过酯交换、甲醇氧化羰基化、甲基硝基羰基化和电合成等路线合成碳酸二甲酯的基于单原子的催化剂的进展，同时阐述了其制备策略、催化性能和反应机理。同时，本综述提出了用于碳酸二甲酯合成的基于单原子的催化剂的未来发展方向。这项工作有望为设计高性能的基于单原子的催化剂用于高效碳酸二甲酯合成提供指导。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.78813","t":"Sulfur‐Regulated Adaptive Reconstruction of Sn@SnOx Interfaces via Inducing Buffered Hydroxyl Radical Microenvironment for Enhanced Oxime Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.78813","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-11","f":"2026-11-12T18:57:08Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Sulfur-regulated Sn@SnO x interfaces enable durable cyclohexanone oxime electrosynthesis through dual interfacial modulation. Cathodic potential-driven sulfur leaching buffers interfacial •OH, suppressing SnO x overgrowth and maintaining dynamically stable Sn@SnO x interfaces. Residual sulfur promotes water activation and *H generation, accelerating NO 2 − hydrogenation to NH 2 OH and subsequent oximation with cyclohexanone. ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic oxime synthesis from NO x and carbonyl compounds offers a sustainable alternative to conventional routes but remains limited by poor *NH 2 OH control and catalyst instability. Herein, we report a sulfur-decorated Sn@SnO x dendritic catalyst for efficient cyclohexanone oxime electrosynthesis from nitrite and cyclohexanone. Under operating conditions, the catalyst undergoes an adaptive reconstruction, where the cathodic potential-driven sulfur","au":["Xiaolong Yu","Yunju Li","Yunan Wang","Yihang Xu","Jin Xi","Jong‐Min Lee"],"o":"日常","zt":"硫调控 Sn@SnO x 界面的自适应重建通过诱导缓冲羟基自由基微环境增强肟电合成","zb":"硫调控 Sn@SnO x 界面通过双界面调制实现耐久的环己酮肟电合成。阴极电位驱动的硫浸出缓冲界面 •OH ，抑制 SnO x 过生长并保持动态稳定的 Sn@SnO x 界面。残留硫促进水活化并 *H 生成，加速 NO 2 − 加氢至 NH 2 OH 并随后的环己酮肟化。在可逆氢电极电位 -1.0 V 下，重建催化剂实现最优法拉第效率 84.4% ，产率为 87.1% ，产率速率为 1.48 mmol h −1 cm −2 。这项工作建立了硫介导的界面调控作为 Sn 基催化剂在 NO x 至肟转化中协调活性和耐久性的有效策略。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.78748","t":"Dual‐Ion Reconstruction of a LiF/NaF–N‐Rich Hybrid Interphase for Durable Silicon‐Carbon Anodes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.78748","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-11","f":"2026-11-12T18:57:08Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"NaNO 3 -DMSO reorganizes the local ion-association environment of a carbonate electrolyte by coupling Na + with PF 6 − while retaining reducible nitrate near the reaction interface. This dual-ion chemistry directs SEI formation toward a uniform LiF/NaF–N-rich interphase, enabling rapid Li + transport, suppressed side reactions, and durable cycling of Si/C anodes. ABSTRACT Silicon-carbon anodes offer high capacity for lithium-ion batteries, yet their cycling stability is limited by repeated solid-electrolyte-interphase (SEI) rupture during drastic volume changes. Herein, we introduce a NaNO 3 -DMSO additive into a conventional LiPF 6 /carbonate electrolyte to construct a durable LiF/NaF–N-rich interphase on a porous silicon-carbon composite (Si@pSC) through a dual-ion cooperative mechanism. We reveal that DMSO enables NaNO 3 incorporation while preserving the carbonate-rich Li + primary s","au":["Xiaoxiao Pan","Kun Tian","Shuxin Zhuang","Liang Pang","Jiamin Zhu","Wubin Qi"],"o":"日常","zt":"LiF/NaF–氮富集混合界面双离子重建用于耐久性硅-碳负极","zb":"将 NaNO 3 -DMSO 添加剂引入 LiPF 6 /碳酸盐电解质中，通过双离子协同机制在多孔硅-碳复合材料（Si@pSC）上构建耐久的 LiF/NaF–氮富集界面。DMSO 使 NaNO 3 融入的同时保留了富含 Li + 的碳酸盐初级溶剂化鞘，Na + 与 PF 6 − 强烈结合，NO 3 − 发生早期界面还原以播种含氮无机物种。这种双离子协同重建了含碳酸盐的传统 SEI，通过掺入 LiF/NaF 纳米晶体域和硝酸盐衍生的含氮物种，限制了持续的寄生界面反应，同时提供了加速 Li + 运输的途径。优化电解质使 Si@pSC 半电池在 1 A g −1 下循环 1000 次后容量为 365 mAh g −1 ，LFP||Si@pSC 全电池在 2 C 下循环 1000 次后容量保持率为 85.6% ，NCM811||Si@pSC 全电池在 2 C 下循环 500 次后容量保持率为 95","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adem.71392","t":"Adjusting Nucleation Chemistry for the Atomic Layer Deposition of Antimony Selenide on Metal Oxide Surfaces","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adem.71392","s":"Advanced Engineering Materials","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-10T18:41:20Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Mixed antimony chalcogenides (Sb 2 E 3 , E = S, Se) as solar light absorbers offer bandgap tunability with favorable optical and electrical properties. However, depositing continuous films of thickness adjusted to the high optical absorption coefficients (<100 nm) has been challenging due to the favored formation of crystalline needles. Atomic layer deposition (ALD) as an ideally conformal deposition method is suited to addressing this challenge, but in the case of Sb 2 Se 3 , nucleation chemistry effects can render the substrate inert. Using tris(dimethylamido)antimony (Sb(NMe 2 ) 3 ) and bis(trimethylsilyl)selenide ((Me 3 Si) 2 Se) as precursors, we demonstrate that undesirable silylation of surface hydroxyl groups can be minimized by a pretreatment with Sb(NMe 2 ) 3 . The near‐saturation of nucleation sites on a metal oxide surface is demonstrated by scanning transmission electron mic","au":["Pei‐Chun Liao","Klaus Götz","Johannes Will","Mingjan Wu","Martin Dierner","Patrick Duchstein"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"调整金属氧化物表面锑化硒原子层沉积的成核化学","zb":"利用三(二甲氨基)锑预处理金属氧化物表面，最小化表面羟基的 undesirable 硅化，实现了锑化硒原子层沉积的近饱和成核位点。密度泛函理论揭示了表面抑制和再活化的热力学重要性。该方法制备了光滑、连续的超薄(<50 nm)锑化硒薄膜，并成功应用于功能太阳能电池。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c03968","t":"Hydrometallogel-Templated, Plasmonic Au Nanoparticle Assemblies for NIR-Activated H2 Release from Ammonia-Borane","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c03968","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-10T18:41:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The addition of [Au(acac)(PMe3)] (acac = acetylacetonate) to orotic acid affords the mononuclear complex [Au(N-orotate)(PMe3)] (1) and the dinuclear species [{Au(PMe3)}2(μ-O,N-orotate)] (2), with the crystal structures of two polymorphs of complex 2 fully elucidated by X-ray diffraction studies. Remarkably, complex 1 undergoes ultrasound-induced supramolecular self-assembly in water to form a robust Au(I) hydrometallogel (1-hyd), whereas 2 lacks the capacity to gelate due to coordination-induced suppression of intermolecular hydrogen bonding. The hydrometallogel acts as both a soft template and an in situ gold precursor, enabling the formation of densely packed, belt-like assemblies of plasmonic Au nanoparticles (1-hyd-Au NPs) upon mild and short thermal treatment. These anisotropic nanoarrays display strong interparticle coupling, yielding a broad, red-shifted localized surface","au":["Ainhoa Rodríguez-Gobernado","Daniel Blasco","Sonia Moreno","Hippolyte Amaveda","Mario Mora","M. Elena Olmos"],"o":"日常","zt":"水金属凝胶模板化、等离激元金纳米粒子组装用于氨硼烷近红外激活释氢","zb":"超声诱导金(I)水金属凝胶自组装形成软模板和金前驱体，经热处理生成密集排列的带状等离激元金纳米粒子组装体。该组装体在808 nm激发下表现出高效光热转换和局域表面等离激元共振吸收。利用此双激活模式，组装体催化氨硼烷甲醇解，显著增强释氢效率。","ob":"光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.78759","t":"Stabilization of Strongly Reduced Fe(I) Single Atom Species Coordinated in a 2D Self‐Assembled Metal–Organic Network","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.78759","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"A graphene-supported 2D metal–organic network stabilizes highly reactive Fe(I)-N 4 single sites through Co-induced charge redistribution. Combined experiments and theory reveal Fe(I) formation, oxygen-driven oxidation, and O 2 activation mechanisms, offering a strategy to access low-valent iron centers relevant to catalytic and biological processes. ABSTRACT Stabilization of low-valent iron centers in atomically defined coordination environments remains a major challenge in the design of reactive metal–organic materials. Here, we report the rational stabilization of Fe(I)-N 4 single sites in a graphene-supported, two-dimensional metal–organic network assembled from FeTPyP tectons and Co coordination nodes. We find that nitrogen tetra-coordination in this specific bidimensional metal–organic network allows the stabilization of iron in the +1 oxidation state. Using state-of-the-art experim","au":["Alessandro Namar","Basant Roondhe","Michela De Col","Stefania Baronio","Matteo Jugovac","Mattia Scardamaglia"],"o":"日常","why":["synthesis of ammonia"],"zb":"在石墨烯支撑的二维金属有机网络中稳定了高反应性的Fe(I)-N4单原子位点，Co配位诱导电荷重分布将卟啉铁中心还原为Fe(I)。实验与理论结合揭示了Fe(I)的形成、氧驱动氧化及O2活化机制，表明该策略在生物合成氨等关键反应中具有潜在应用价值。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.9224223","t":"Sustainable Electrosynthesis of Hexamethylenetetramine via Paired Electrolysis of Nitrate and PET Waste","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.9224223","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"First electrocatalytic synthesis of hexamethylenetetramine (HMTA) via paired electrolysis: A bifunctional Fe–Ni 2 P catalyst concurrently reduces nitrate to ammonia (∼96.0% FE) and oxidizes ethylene glycol to formaldehyde intermediates, coupling them into HMTA with ∼75.2% carbon selectivity. ABSTRACT Hexamethylenetetramine (HMTA) is a critical organonitrogen compound widely used in the defense, pharmaceutical, and polymer industries. Conventional HMTA production relies on toxic formaldehyde (HCHO) and energy-intensive Haber–Bosch-derived ammonia (NH 3 ) as feedstocks. This study demonstrates a sustainable electrocatalytic approach for the direct synthesis of HMTA via paired electrolysis, using nitrate (NO 3 − ) and polyethylene terephthalate (PET) waste as nitrogen and carbon sources, respectively. With iron-doped nickel phosphide (Fe–Ni 2 P) as a bifunctional catalyst, the system achiev","au":["Jingtao Zhou","Jiu Chen","Rui Shi","Zhengxiao Guo","Edmund C. M. Tse","Fulai Liu"],"o":"日常","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zb":"利用Fe掺杂Ni2P双功能催化剂，通过硝酸盐和PET废料的配对电解直接合成六亚甲基四胺。阴极将硝酸盐还原为氨（约96.0%法拉第效率），阳极将PET衍生的乙二醇氧化为甲醛中间体，两者偶联生成HMTA（约75.2%碳选择性）。Fe掺杂诱导电荷重分布，降低了*HCHO中间体形成的能垒。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6qi01755j","t":"Cu–Co electronic synergy in Cu-doped CoCO3 enabling high-performance electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6qi01755j","s":"Inorganic Chemistry Frontiers","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-10T04:37:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO3–RR) has emerged as a promising strategy for green ammonia synthesis. However, developing robust catalysts with high activity and selectivity remains a significant challenge. Here,...","au":["Ning Wang","Qian Wang","Zhongcan Wang","Mingqi Zhang","Shipeng Wu","Qinghu Tang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Cu–Co 电子协同效应在 Cu 掺杂 CoCO3 中实现高性能电催化硝酸根还原制氨","zb":"Cu 掺杂 CoCO3 利用了 Cu–Co 电子协同效应，实现了电催化硝酸根还原反应的高活性与高选择性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.78831","t":"Tandem Catalysis Sites in Co‐NO/C for Efficient and Scalable Electrocatalytic Nitrate to Ammonia Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.78831","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This work reports a Co-NO/C catalyst featuring Co 3 O 4 and Co 4 N sites that synergistically activate nitrate for electrocatalytic reduction to ammonia (NH 3 ). Co 3 O 4 sites adsorb and activate NO 3 − , while Co 4 N sites provide active hydrogen (H * ). The system achieves high NH 3 selectivity and efficiency, demonstrating scalable nitrate remediation and ammonia recovery in a Zn–NO 3 − battery and MEA reactor. ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (eNO 3 RA) represents an emerging strategy for coupling nitrate remediation with nitrogen recovery and value-added ammonia production, but it remains challenging to simultaneously promote nitrate activation and downstream hydrogenation. Herein, we report a Co -NO/C catalyst featuring Co 3 O 4 /Co 4 N tandem catalysis sites embedded in a conductive carbon matrix. Structural and spectroscopic analyses suggest that Co 3 O 4 s","au":["Jingyi Sun","He Wang","Chengye Wang","Wenhao Liu","Qiang Liu","Kaiyi Chen"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zb":"报道了Co-NO/C催化剂，其Co3O4和Co4N位点协同激活硝酸盐进行电催化还原氨。Co3O4位点吸附活化NO3-，Co4N位点提供活性氢。在H型电池中，该催化剂在-0.6 V vs. RHE下达到99.7%的法拉第效率和62.4 mg h−1 mg cat.−1的氨产率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.78809","t":"Copper Single Atoms on a Photothermal Heterostructure for Dual‐Field‐Driven Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.78809","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This work presents a dual-field-driven strategy integrating a localized thermal field and a built-in electric field within a photothermal heterostructure. Cu single atoms anchored on CeO 2 /Co 3 O 4 promote NO 3 − adsorption and effectively inhibit the hydrogen evolution reaction. The dual-field facilitates the interfacial charge transfer and enhances the reaction rate, achieving efficient nitrate electroreduction to ammonia. ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic reactions involving multiple electrons and protons, such as nitrate reduction to ammonia, are constrained by sluggish interfacial charge-transfer and inefficient mass transport. Here, we propose a dual-field-driven strategy that integrates the local thermal field and the built-in electric field within a photothermal heterostructure, enabling concerted control over both atomic-scale active-site construction and the reaction microenvironment.","au":["Chuanzhen Feng","Shuangshuang Tang","Yating Wu","Qi Lan","Shicheng Xu","Jiangli Zhang"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"光热异质结构上铜单原子用于双场驱动硝酸盐制氨","zb":"该研究构建了集局部热场与内建电场于一体的光热异质结构，利用光生电子引导单原子铜锚定在CeO2/Co3O4上。在近红外照射下，该催化剂在-0.4 V vs. RHE下实现了110.5 µmol h−1 cm−2的氨产率，在-0.2 V vs. RHE下达到95.8%的法拉第效率，显著优于暗态性能。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.64898/2026.11.09.763769","t":"Gene-resolved metagenomics reveals partitioned nitrogen transformation potential in a landfill leachate sequencing batch reactor microbiome","u":"https://doi.org/10.64898/2026.11.09.763769","s":"预印本","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-11T02:45:15Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Landfill leachate can contain high concentrations of ammonia and organic nitrogen requiring treatment before discharge. Sequencing batch reactors (SBRs) promote biological nitrogen removal through alternating aerobic and anoxic conditions, but taxonomic profiling alone cannot resolve how nitrogen transformation and competing retention pathways are distributed across microbial communities. This study applied gene-resolved metagenomics to a sludge sample collected from a UK landfill leachate SBR. Nitrogen-metabolism genes were linked to contig-level taxonomic assignments and metagenome-assembled genome bins to examine nitrification, denitrification, dissimilatory nitrate reduction to ammonium (DNRA), and assimilatory nitrate reduction (ANR). Nitrogen-transformation potential was partitioned across dominant and minor taxa. Nitrospirota and Pseudomonadota were the most abundant classified ph","au":["Samuel Rattray","Lynsay Blake","Nicola Ingrey","Iain MacArthur"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zb":"该研究利用基因解析宏基因组学分析了垃圾渗滤液序批式反应器微生物组，发现Nitrospirota和Pseudomonadota是优势菌门，而Nitrospira和Pseudomonas等属在氮转化基因分布上具有显著差异，揭示了低丰度贡献者及氮保留潜力。","ob":"其他催化反应","pre":1},{"id":"10.3390/nano16221454","t":"Facet- and Potential-Dependent Electroreduction of Nitrate Ions on Model Copper Electrodes","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/nano16221454","s":"Nanomaterials","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) offers a sustainable pathway for both wastewater treatment and ammonia synthesis, yet its performance is highly sensitive to the catalyst surface structure and electrolyte composition. Here, we systematically investigate the facet-dependent activity on Cu(111), Cu(110), and Cu(100) single-crystal electrodes toward NO3RR in alkaline and bicarbonate media. Our results reveal that the activity trend for both nitrite and ammonia formation follows the order Cu(111) < Cu(110) < Cu(100) in both electrolytes. Cu(100) exhibits the highest activity for ammonia production, while Cu(111) suffers from pronounced kinetic hindrance due to the accumulation of *NOx intermediates that block the surface, leading to significant time-dependent deactivation. While (bi)carbonate anions inhibit NO3RR by competitive adsorption, they also inhibit hydrogen evo","au":["Maria R. Ehrenburg","Elena B. Molodkina","Zi-Han Chen","Jianfeng Li","Alexander V. Rudnev"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"模型铜电极上硝酸根离子面依赖性与电位依赖的电还原","zb":"该研究系统研究了Cu(111)、Cu(110)和Cu(100)单晶电极在碱性和碳酸氢盐介质中硝酸根还原反应（NO3RR）的面依赖性。结果表明氨生成活性顺序为Cu(100) > Cu(110) > Cu(111)，且Cu(111)因中间体*NOx积累导致动力学受阻。在KHCO3中，碳酸氢根离子通过竞争吸附抑制析氢反应，实现了近100%的法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c03827","t":"Converting Waste Tires into Blue Ammonia: Safe and Sustainable Process Design, Multiobjective Optimization and Comprehensive Assessment","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c03827","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-10T18:41:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia synthesis based on steam methane reforming (SMR) is characterized by intensive energy consumption and high carbon emissions. To address these limitations, novel processes integrating gasification and carbon capture technologies were proposed for converting waste tires into blue ammonia. Detailed safety, techno-economic, and life cycle assessments were conducted to evaluate comprehensive performance. Machine learning-driven multiobjective operation optimization was carried out for reducing levelized cost of ammonia (LCOA) while enhancing safety and sustainability scores based on safe-and-sustainable-by-design framework. Our results highlight the critical role of artificial neural networks in achieving efficient optimization. Additionally, the quantitative impacts of integrating various renewable energy sources were investigated. The results showed the conventional gasific","au":["Jingyuan Liu","Jianzhao Zhou","Qiming Qian","Sheng Yang","Chang He","Jingzheng Ren"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"将废轮胎转化为蓝色氨：安全可持续工艺设计、多目标优化与综合评估","zb":"提出将废轮胎气化与碳捕集技术结合的工艺设计用于合成蓝色氨。基于安全可持续设计框架，利用机器学习进行多目标操作优化。在当前电力情景下，传统气化结合MDEA碳捕集的LCOA为358.1 $/吨，环境可持续性评分达0.443，优于传统SMR工艺。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142094","t":"Synergistic effect of AlH3 catalysis and ZIF-8 nanoconfinement on ammonia borane dehydrogenation for onboard applications: by DFT calculations and experiments","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2026.142094","s":"Fuel","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-10T18:41:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Mengbo Wu","Qingrong Zheng"],"o":"日常","zt":"AlH3催化和ZIF-8纳米受限对车载应用氨硼烷脱氢的协同效应：DFT计算与实验","ob":"氨硼烷水解","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.egyr.2026.109890","t":"Systematic and critical review of optimization models for green hydrogen and ammonia supply chains","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.egyr.2026.109890","s":"Energy Reports","d":"2026-11-10","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Green hydrogen and green ammonia supply chains integrate variable renewable electricity with electrolysis, nitrogen separation, ammonia synthesis, storage, transportation, reconversion, and end-use decisions. However, the optimization literature remains heterogeneous in mathematical assumptions, system boundaries, temporal representation, uncertainty treatment, adaptive decision mechanisms, and computational tractability, limiting consistent model selection and cross-study comparison. This paper presents a systematic and critical review of optimization models for integrated green hydrogen and ammonia supply chains, based on 118 studies. The review applies a controlled record-level taxonomy covering the base modeling or assessment approach, objective structure, dominant supply-chain scope, spatial scale, temporal structure, time-step resolution, uncertainty treatment, and adaptive or onli","au":["Asmaa Khourdifi","Yassine Eddouh","Rabie El Otmani","Khalid Kandoussi"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"绿色氢气和氨气供应链优化模型的系统与关键综述","zb":"该文基于118项研究，系统综述了集成绿色氢气和氨气供应链的优化模型。分析表明现有文献在数学假设、系统边界和不确定性处理上存在异质性，线性规划和网络规划方法占主导，而全链路集成和鲁棒性处理仍不成熟。文章提出了决策导向的模型选择框架和未来研究方向。"},{"id":"10.21203/rs.3.rs-11191906/v1","t":"Carbon Di-carbene Allotrope as a Zero- Dimensional Carbon Platform for Small-Molecule Activation and Nitrogen-to-Ammonia Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-11191906/v1","s":"Research Square","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Abstract Carbon allotropes span molecular to extended architectures, with dimensional-ity playing a central role in determining their electronic structure and chemical reactivity. Inspired by the unique electronic characteristics of carbenes and the functional diversity of carbon allotropes, we computationally design a previously unexplored zero-dimensional carbon dicarbene allotrope (CDCA) at the ωB97XD/Def2-TZVP level. CDCA is composed exclusively of carbon atoms and incorporates two electronically communicating carbene centres within a cyclic molecular framework. Density-of-states analysis and ab initio molecular dynamics simulations are employed to characterize its electronic structure, reactive sites, and structural stability. The singlet state is substantially more stable than the triplet state, while the carbon framework remains structurally stable during the investigated finite-t","au":["Rahul das","Purnendu Mahata","Arijit Bag"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrogen-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"碳二卡宾同素异形体作为零维碳平台用于小分子活化与氮气转化为氨","zb":"基于卡宾独特的电子特性和碳同素异形体的功能多样性，研究者在 ωB97XD/Def2-TZVP 水平上计算设计了一种此前未探索的零维碳二卡宾同素异形体（CDCA）。密度态分析和从头算分子动力学模拟表明 CDCA 对 SO2、NO、CO2 等小分子具有显著反应性，且能通过双中心构型促进 N2 的取向依赖性活化与 N–N 键断裂，最终提供了一条计算出的 NH3 形成路径。","ob":"其他催化反应","pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jpclett.6c03171","t":"Acid-Etched Lead Telluride with Defect-Regulated Surfaces Enables Efficient Mechanical-Energy-Driven Nitrogen Fixation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpclett.6c03171","s":"The Journal of Physical Chemistry Letters","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-10T18:41:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Abstract Ambient ammonia synthesis is important for carbon neutrality. Tribo-electro-catalysis, which converts mechanical friction into chemical driving force through contact electrification and charge transfer, offers a route for nitrogen (N2) fixation. However, inefficient utilization of friction-induced charges and insufficient N2 activation remain major challenges. Herein, acid-etching defect engineering regulates the surface and electronic structures of lead telluride (PbTe) for N2 fixation. The catalyst etched for 90 min exhibits the enhanced activity under dark ambient conditions, delivering ammonium (NH4+) production rates of 258.98 and 329.60 μmol L–1·g–1·h–1 without and with 10 vol % methanol, respectively. Analyses reveal that etching reconstructs the surface, generates defect sites, facilitates N2 adsorption and activation, and promotes friction-induced charge utilization. Ex","au":["Hongda Zhu","Zheng Wu","Luohong Zhang","Siqi Hong","Huijuan Li","Huilin You"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"酸蚀缺陷调控表面的铅碲用于高效机械能驱动氮固定","zb":"通过酸蚀缺陷工程调控铅碲的表面和电子结构，实现了暗环境下的氮固定。经90分钟酸蚀的催化剂在无甲醇和含10%甲醇条件下，NH4+产率分别为258.98和329.60 μmol L–1·g–1·h–1。研究表明酸蚀重构表面并生成缺陷位点，促进N2吸附活化及摩擦诱导电荷利用。"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta07010h","t":"Nucleation, orientation, and optical properties of ultrathin iron oxide grown by atomic layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta07010h","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Oriented, crystalline hematite is grown on sapphire by atomic layer deposition (ALD) at temperatures as low as 200 °C. Growth on ALD Ga 2 O 3 on sapphire also produces hematite with complex refractive indices characteristic of crystalline hematite.","au":["Alex B. F. Martinson","Ashley R. Bielinski","Asare Dua"],"o":"日常","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积生长的超薄氧化铁的成核、取向和光学性质","zb":"在 200 °C 的低温下，原子层沉积（ALD）在蓝宝石上生长了取向的结晶赤铁矿，在 ALD Ga2O3 蓝宝石衬底上生长的赤铁矿也表现出结晶赤铁矿的特征复折射率。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Fe/铁体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c09970","t":"Defect-Driven Bimetallic Modulation: Accelerating Electrocatalytic Ammonia Oxidation Kinetics via a Nitrogen-Deficient FeCuN-Derived Architecture","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c09970","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic ammonia oxidation (AOR) offers an energy-efficient route to carbon-free hydrogen production but is constrained by sluggish multielectron-transfer kinetics and adsorbate evolution mechanism (AEM) scaling relationships. Here, electrodeposition yielded a nickel-foam-supported bimetallic FeCuN catalyst (FeCuN-BH), followed by high-temperature hydrogenation to introduce abundant lattice nitrogen vacancies (FeCuN-AH). The rationally engineered FeCuN-AH architecture demonstrates superior AOR performance, requiring an exceptionally low applied potential of 0.61 V vs the saturated calomel electrode (SCE) to reach 50 mA cm–2, together with an apparent Tafel slope of 934.7 mV dec–1, substantially lower than the 2408 mV dec–1 measured for FeCuN-BH, and stable operation over 50 h. Comprehensive density functional theory (DFT) calculations elucidate a lattice nitrogen vacancy","au":["Rongtian Jiang","Zhipin Xu","Xin Yao","Dashuai Wang","Hui Zeng","Junhui Liang"],"o":"日常","why":["Electrocatalytic Ammonia"],"zt":"缺陷驱动双金属调制：通过氮缺陷 FeCuN 衍生架构加速电催化氨氧化动力学","zb":"研究对象为电催化氨氧化 (AOR) 体系，采用电沉积法制备镍泡沫支持的双金属 FeCuN 催化剂 (FeCuN-BH)，再经高温氢化引入丰富的晶格氮空位 (FeCuN-AH)。FeCuN-AH 架构表现出优异的 AOR 性能，在饱和甘汞电极 (SCE) 下 0.61 V 的极低施加电位下达到 50 mA cm–2，表观 Tafel 斜率为 934.7 mV dec–1，远低于 FeCuN-BH 的 2408 mV dec–1，且稳定运行 50 h。DFT 计算阐明晶格氮空位介导的双位点协同机制 (LNVM-MSM)，氮空位作为氨吸附的优选活性中心，并将决速步骤 (*NH2 到 *NH) 的动能垒从铜位点的 2.04 eV 降低至 0.90 eV。","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158547","t":"Descriptor-Guided Design of Ruthenium Catalysts for Ammonia Synthesis and Decomposition: From Promoters to Interfaces","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158547","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-10T04:37:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ruthenium (Ru) catalysts exhibit high activity for ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis and decomposition, governed by promoter chemistry, catalyst structure, and metal–support interactions (MSI). This review presents a descriptor-guided framework linking electronic, geometric, interfacial, and dynamic properties to reaction mechanisms and catalytic performance. Key steps, including nitrogen (N 2 ) dissociation, hydrogenation, nitrogen recombination, and hydrogen (H 2 ) inhibition, are examined alongside support selection, particle-size control, morphology, and interfacial engineering. Alkali, alkaline-earth, and rare-earth promoters are evaluated for their effects on Ru electronic structure, adsorption energetics, and active-site accessibility. Oxygen vacancies (OVs), strong metal–support interactions (SMSI), and electronic metal–support interactions (EMSI) are discussed as regulators of interfaci","au":["Sameer Khan","Swati Singh","Tan Mingwu","Kyriaki Polychronopoulou"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"用于氨合成与分解的钌催化剂的描述符引导设计：从助剂到界面","zb":"综述了钌催化剂在氨合成与分解中的性能，基于电子、几何、界面和动态性质建立了描述符框架。文章评估了碱金属、碱土金属和稀土助剂对钌电子结构和吸附能的影响，并讨论了氧空位和金属-载体相互作用对界面反应活性的调控作用。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1007/s40820-026-02359-6","t":"Interfacial Electronic Regulation in N-Doped Carbon-Encapsulated NiCo Alloy Enables High-Current Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s40820-026-02359-6","s":"Nano-Micro Letters","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrochemical nitrate reduction (NO 3 − RR) offers a route to couple wastewater remediation with green ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis, but remains kinetically and mechanistically challenging under high-current-density operation. Herein, an N-doped carbon-encapsulated NiCo alloy catalyst (NiCo@NC) is derived from a NiCo-ZB precursor supported on conductive carbon black. The cathodic NO 3 − RR over NiCo@NC achieves an NH 3 yield rate of 187 mol h −1 g cat −1 with 95% Faradaic efficiency (FE) at −0.6 V RHE in an H-type cell and sustains ~92% FE at 2.0 A cm −2 under a cell voltage of 3.3 V in a membrane–electrode assembly. Pairing this cathodic NO 3 − RR with anodic methanol oxidation to formate enables simultaneous NH 3 and formate production at 2.1 A cm −2 under a cell voltage of 2.8 V, while maintaining NH 3 and formate FEs above 90% and 96%, respectively. In situ Fourier transform ","au":["Qizhi Hu","Siyu Zhu","Biao Meng","Mingdong Sun","Ming Wang","Xiaoling Liu"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"界面电子调控：氮掺杂碳包覆 NiCo 合金实现高电流硝酸盐至氨电合成","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐还原 (NO 3 − RR) 体系，制备氮掺杂碳包覆 NiCo 合金催化剂 (NiCo@NC)。在 H 型电池中，NiCo@NC 在 –0.6 V RHE 下实现 187 mol h −1 g cat −1 的氨产率，95% 法拉第效率 (FE)，在 3.3 V 电池电压下，膜电极组件中 2.0 A cm −2 下维持 ~92% FE。阴极 NO 3 − RR 与阳极甲醇氧化联产氨和甲酸盐，在 2.8 V 电池电压下 2.1 A cm −2 下氨和甲酸盐 FE 分别高于 90% 和 96%。原位傅里叶变换红外光谱和原位 X 射线吸收精细结构光谱揭示 *NO 优先稳定和钴价态/配位的可逆性，理论计算披露 NiCo 合金核与氮掺杂碳壳之间的界面电荷极化，构建电子贫乏的石墨碳和电子丰富的吡啶氮区域组成的双位点，加速水裂解/质子供应，降低 *NO → *NOH 决速步骤的势垒","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s11814-026-00878-x","t":"Mechanochemical Synthesis of Ru/γ-Al2O3 Catalysts: Influence of Ru Precursor and Milling Parameters on Structure–Activity Correlation for NH3 Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11814-026-00878-x","s":"Korean Journal of Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-10T18:41:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["ChangJin Han","Jae Min Park","Do Heui Kim"],"o":"日常","why":["NH3 Decomposition"],"zt":"机械化学合成Ru/γ-Al2O3催化剂：Ru前驱体和研磨参数对NH3分解结构-活性相关性的影响","ob":"机械化学制氨；涉及Ru/钌体系｜机械力驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1007/s11426-026-3877-8","t":"Electrolyte-additive engineering for lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11426-026-3877-8","s":"Science China Chemistry","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-13T18:31:35Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Zhenhao Wang","Qianji Gao","Liqi Shi","Jieshan Qiu","Shaofeng Li"],"o":"日常","why":["lithium-mediated nitrogen"],"zt":"锂介导的氮还原的电解质添加剂工程","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1021/acs.est.6c07061","t":"Basalt Application Alters the Nitrogen Budget of Midwestern U.S. Agricultural Soils through Reduced Nitrous Oxide Fluxes and Increased Nitrogen Leaching","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.est.6c07061","s":"Environmental Science & Technology","d":"2026-11-09","f":"2026-11-12T03:47:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Land-based enhanced rock weathering (ERW)─applying ground silicate rock to soils─is being explored for sequestration of CO2 from the atmosphere, with impacts beyond carbon storage. Weathering of basalt releases base cations increasing alkalinity and soil pH, which we hypothesized would reduce N2O emissions. Repeated applications of basalt to a heavily fertilized annual Zea mays and Glycine max rotation (maize and soybean) and the low-fertilized perennial bioenergy grass Miscanthus x giganteus (miscanthus) in Illinois raised soil pH from 6.6 to 7.1 in maize/soybean and from 5.4 to 6.3 in miscanthus and consistently reduced annual N2O emissions by 16–40% over 7 growing seasons. Although not statistically significant for any given crop, our results indicate an emerging trend of increased N leaching (23% pooled across crops and years), suggesting a potential shift in N loss from the","au":["Ilsa B. Kantola","Elena Blanc-Betes","Michael D. Masters","Maria Val Martin","David J. Beerling","Evan H. DeLucia"],"o":"日常","zt":"玄武岩应用通过减少一氧化二氮通量和增加氮淋溶改变了美国中西部农业土壤的氮收支","zb":"基于土地的增强岩石风化（ERW）——将硅酸盐岩石施用于土壤——正在探索从大气中捕获CO2，其影响超出了碳储存。玄武岩的风化释放了碱金属阳离子，增加了碱性和土壤pH值，我们假设这将减少N2O排放。在伊利诺伊州对高度施肥的年度玉米和大豆轮作以及低施肥的多年生生物能源草芒草x giganteus（芒草）重复施用玄武岩，将玉米/大豆的土壤pH值从6.6提高到7.1，将芒草的土壤pH值从5.4提高到6.3，并在7个生长季节内持续减少年度N2O排放16–40%。虽然对任何特定作物都没有统计学意义，但结果表明N淋溶（23%跨作物和年份）增加的趋势，表明氮损失可能从大气转移到地下水。作物产量增加或保持不变，表明增强风化与传统农业实践兼容。区域土地模型模拟表明，在美国玉米带部署ERW可以在中等部署路径下将土壤N2O排放减少11%，在更密集的部署路径下减少24%。增强风化的影响超出了CO2封存，可能有利于温室","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.2045143","t":"A Single‐COF Photocatalytic System for One‐Pot Oxygen Reduction Coupled Ammoximation of Cyclic Ketones","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.2045143","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-08","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":13,"ab":"Porphyrin–polyimide COFs enable one-pot oxygen reduction coupled ammoximation of cyclic ketones. Photoinduced electron transfer activates O 2 at imide carbonyl sites, generating *OOH that directly oxidizes NH 4 + to NH 2 OH, which then condenses with ketones. IMCOF-1 delivers cyclohexanone oxime at 18.55 mmol g − 1 h − 1 , avoiding H 2 O 2 accumulation and enabling a single-COF cascade. ABSTRACT Photocatalytic oxygen reduction over covalent organic frameworks (COFs) has been extensively studied for H 2 O 2 production, but the in situ utilization of oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) intermediates in chemical synthesis remains underexplored. Herein, two porphyrin-based polyimide COFs, IMCOF-1 and IMCOF-2, are reported as photocatalysts for the one-pot ORR-coupled ammoximation of cyclic ketones using O 2 and NH 4 OAc. Under light irradiation, IMCOF-1 achieves a cyclohexanone oxime formation r","au":["Jiali Li","Ruipeng Li","Chuanbao Jiao","Jiashuai Teng","Xueshan Xing","Hui Li"],"o":"日常","zt":"单-COF光催化系统用于一锅氧还原耦合环酮肟化","zb":"报道了两种基于卟啉的聚酰亚胺 COFs（IMCOF-1 和 IMCOF-2）作为光催化剂，用于环酮的一锅氧还原耦合肟化反应。光诱导电子转移在酰亚胺羰基位点活化 O2，生成的 *OOH 直接氧化 NH4+ 为 NH2OH，进而与酮缩合生成肟。IMCOF-1 在光照射下实现了 18.55 mmol g−1 h−1 的环己酮肟生成速率，避免了 H2O2 积累。","ob":"光驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apenergy.2026.129211","t":"Techno-economic optimization of a low-carbon ammonia synthesis system integrated with coal-to‑hydrogen and power-to‑hydrogen production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apenergy.2026.129211","s":"Applied Energy","d":"2026-11-07","f":"2026-11-07T16:50:48Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Ruizhe Wang","Hanfei Zhang","Mingjia Sun","Luyao Liu","Liqiang Duan","Jihong Fan"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"与煤制氢和电制氢生产集成的低碳氨合成系统的技术经济优化","bt":1},{"id":"10.1007/s13391-026-00672-1","t":"Spinel Cobalt Oxide-based Electrocatalysts for Nitrate-to-Ammonia Conversion: Catalyst Design and Dynamic Surface Reconstruction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s13391-026-00672-1","s":"Electronic Materials Letters","d":"2026-11-07","f":"2026-11-07T16:50:48Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Seonghyeon Park","Jinuk Choi","Myeong Gon Kim","Hyojung Lim","Chanmin Jo","Uk Sim"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"用于硝酸盐到氨转化的尖晶石氧化物基电催化剂：催化剂设计与动态表面重构","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c04345","t":"Incorporating Co-Encapsulated N-Doped Carbon Nanotube with Zn Phthalocyanine: Accelerated Water Dissociation Kinetics for Hydroxylamine Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c04345","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2026-11-07","f":"2026-11-08T17:04:56Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrite (NO2–) reduction to hydroxylamine (NH2OH) under ambient conditions is regarded as a sustainable way to simultaneously enable pollutant abatement and value-added chemical synthesis; however, the intrinsically sluggish kinetics and competing over-reduction to ammonia necessitate the rational exploration of robust electrocatalytic systems. Herein, we report the anchoring of zinc phthalocyanine (ZnPc) molecules onto bamboo-like nitrogen-doped carbon nanotubes encapsulating metallic cobalt nanoparticles (Co-NCNT) for selectively converting NO2– to NH2OH. The resulting ZnPc/Co-NCNT electrocatalyst achieves a considerable NH2OH yield of 0.25 mmol h–1 mgcat–1 and a high Faradaic efficiency of 64.32% at −0.3 V vs RHE, significantly outperforming its monocomponent counterparts. Mechanistic investigations reveal that the Co-NCNT facilitates charge transfer and lowe","au":["Junyu Chen","Jingyao Zhao","Lunhong Ai","Aike Liu","Jing Jiang"],"o":"日常","zt":"将 Co-包覆的氮掺杂碳纳米管与 Zn 菁菁：加速羟胺电合成的水解动力学","zb":"研究对象为 ZnPc/Co-NCNT 电催化剂对亚硝酸根 (NO2–) 还原为羟胺 (NH2OH) 的催化性能。Co-NCNT 促进电荷转移并降低水水解势，实现 0.25 mmol h–1 mgcat–1 的 NH2OH 产率和 64.32% 的法拉第效率。构建的 Zn–NO2– 电池同时生成 NH2OH 并提供 7.22 mW cm–2 的峰值功率密度。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1117/12.3123214","t":"Effect of annealing on the properties of TiO2 film prepared by atom layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1117/12.3123214","s":"Twenty-First National Conference on Laser Technology and Optoelectronics","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-06T03:24:56Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Atomic layer deposition (ALD) TiO₂ thin films are widely used in optoelectronics, photocatalysis, and biomedical applications. However, their intrinsic absorption and defect-induced absorption limit their application in high-power laser optics. Annealing is an important post-treatment method to modulate the optical properties and reduce absorption. In this work, ALD-TiO₂ thin films were annealed in O₂ atmosphere at different temperatures. The effects of annealing temperature on the optical constants, surface morphology, crystal structure, and impurity states were systematically investigated using spectroscopic ellipsometry, atomic force microscopy (AFM), X-ray diffraction(XRD), Fourier-transform infrared spectroscopy(FTIR), and X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS). This work provides theoretical and experimental guidance for the preparation of low-absorption, high laser-damage-resistan","au":["Junhui Die","Bingcheng Xiong","Zhao Qiao","Liang Lv","Guorui Zhou","Fumin Qiu"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积制备的 TiO2 薄膜退火对其性能的影响","zb":"原子层沉积法制备的 TiO₂ 薄膜在光电子、光催化和生物医学应用中广泛使用，但其固有的吸收和缺陷诱导吸收限制了它们在高功率激光光学中的应用。退火是一种重要的后处理方法，用于调节光学性能并减少吸收。本研究中，在不同温度下将原子层沉积法制备的 TiO₂ 薄膜在 O₂ 气氛中退火，并使用光谱椭偏仪、原子力显微镜（AFM）、X 射线衍射（XRD）、傅里叶变换红外光谱（FTIR）和 X 射线光电子能谱（XPS）系统地研究了退火温度对光学常数、表面形貌、晶体结构和杂质状态的影响。这项工作为通过后退火处理制备低吸收、高激光损伤耐受性的原子层沉积 TiO₂ 光学薄膜提供了理论和实验指导。","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1016/j.aqrep.2026.103903","t":"Role of phycospheric bacteria: Promoting the growth of Isochrysis zhanjiangensis and ammonia nitrogen removal in rearing water","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aqrep.2026.103903","s":"Aquaculture Reports","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"Isochrysis zhanjiangensis is crucial in the breeding of bivalves larval as an artificially cultivated feed microalga. To investigate their roles in algal–bacterial interactions, we isolated and identified two phycospheric bacterial strains, Halomonas piezotolerans and Alteromonas abrolhosensis, from I. zhanjiangensis and examined their effects on algal growth and ammonia nitrogen removal in aquaculture systems. The results indicated that both bacterial strains promoted the growth of I. zhanjiangensis; however, the effect of A. abrolhosensis was more pronounced. At a concentration of 108 cfu/mL, the A. abrolhosensis treatment group reached a cell density of 1.082 × 107 cells/mL on day 10, significantly higher than the control group by 16.26% (p 0.05). Furthermore, H. piezotolerans enhanced soluble protein synthesis at low concentrations. In ammonia nitrogen removal experiments, H. piezoto","au":["Jin Huang","Jian Liang","Huiru Liu","Shuang Liang","Yongren Li","Limei Chen"],"o":"日常","zt":"球藻细菌的作用：促进 Isochrysis zhanjiangensis 的生长和养殖水中氨氮去除","zb":"从 Isochrysis zhanjiangensis 中分离并鉴定了两种球藻细菌菌株 Halomonas piezotolerans 和 Alteromonas abrolhosensis，研究了它们对藻类生长和养殖系统中文氨氮去除的影响。结果显示，两种细菌菌株都促进了 I. zhanjiangensis 的生长，其中 A. abrolhosensis 的效果更显著。在 108 cfu/mL 浓度下，A. abrolhosensis 处理组在第 10 天达到 1.082 × 107 cells/mL 的细胞密度，比对照组高 16.26%。此外，H. piezotolerans 在低浓度下增强了可溶性蛋白合成。在氨氮去除实验中，H. piezotolerans 表现出优异和稳定的活性，而 A. abrolhosensis 也促进了氮还原。qPCR 验证显示，H. piezotolerans"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c16802","t":"Reorganization of Interfacial Water by Cu–Ru Interfaces for Efficient Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c16802","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-07T16:50:48Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction offers a sustainable route for ammonia (NH3) synthesis, yet its efficiency is limited by sluggish N–O bond cleavage, incomplete NOx hydrogenation, and competing hydrogen evolution reaction. However, how catalyst structural engineering regulates the interfacial microenvironment remains unclear, despite its critical importance for constructing efficient catalysts. Here, we report a Cu3Ru7 catalyst with abundant Cu–Ru interfaces, where interface-induced water reorganization enables efficient NH3 production. The Cu3Ru7 catalyst exhibits an impressive NH3 formation rate of 19.7 mmol h–1 cm–2 at 5 A cm–2 in a membrane electrode assembly (MEA) electrolyzer and remains stable at 2 A cm–2 with an NH3 Faradaic efficiency of ∼86% for 500 h. A scale-up demonstration using a 100 cm2 MEA electrolyzer affords an NH3 formation rate up to 1.5 mol h–1 at 400 A. ","au":["Jing Xue","Tianfu Liu","Yi Wang","Yunfan Fu","Pengfei Wei","Yanpeng Song"],"o":"日常","why":["NH3 production"],"zt":"Cu–Ru 界面重排界面水以实现高效硝酸盐到氨的电合成","zb":"报道了具有丰富 Cu–Ru 界面的 Cu3Ru7 催化剂，通过界面诱导的水重排实现高效 NH3 生成。在膜电极组件电解槽中，该催化剂在 5 A cm-2 下 NH3 生成率为 19.7 mmol h-1 cm-2，并在 2 A cm-2 下保持约 86% 的 NH3 法拉第效率长达 500 小时。原位 ATR-SEIRAS 和 AIMD 模拟表明，Cu–Ru 界面通过氢键网络稳定解离氧原子，促进 NOx 脱氧，同时 Cu 基体抑制了 Ru 的过量 *H 积累。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.1880547","t":"Weak Solvation Engineering of Reduction‐Stable Electrolytes for Durable Continuous Lithium‐Mediated Ammonia Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.1880547","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-07T16:50:48Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"ABSTRACT Continuous lithium‐mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li‐NRR), which integrates anodic hydrogen oxidation with cathodic nitrogen fixation, opens a viable pathway for ambient ammonia synthesis. Nevertheless, its long‐term and efficient operation remains tremendously challenging due to severe solvent issues including polymerization, volatilization, and reductive decomposition. Here, we fundamentally uncover the intrinsic reductive decomposition mechanism of solvent molecules in ion–solvent complex‐dominated electrolytes, and develop a weak‐solvent modulation strategy to significantly enhance the reduction stability of solvent frameworks toward durable and efficient Li‐NRR operation. The optimized weakly solvating electrolyte attenuates solvent molecule distortion by Li + and promotes the formation of an anion‑enriched solvation sheath and a nanocrystalline LiF‑rich solid electr","au":["Kuiquan Yan","Yicheng Zhou","Yang Hong","Haixia Zhong","Xinbo Zhang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于持久连续锂介导氨电合成的还原稳定电解质的弱溶剂工程","zb":"针对锂介导氮还原反应（Li-NRR）中溶剂聚合、挥发和还原分解的问题，开发了弱溶剂调制策略。该策略通过优化电解质，构建富阴离子溶剂鞘和纳米晶 LiF 富集固体电解质界面（SEI），有效抑制溶剂分解并促进 Li+ 传输。在优化条件下，实现了超过 300 小时的稳定连续 N2 电还原，NH3 法拉第效率达 69.5%，能量效率高达 23.2%。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c14894","t":"Site Sensitivity Resulting in Selective Hydroxylamine Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c14894","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-07T16:50:48Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Abstract The electroreduction of nitrogen oxides offers a promising route for green synthesis of hydroxylamine (NH2OH). Although Pd exhibited high selectivity toward NH2OH production experimentally, we found the dominant hollow sites of pristine Pd prefer ammonia production via the NOH*-pathway. This discrepancy was resolved by unveiling the critical roles of in situ hydriding of Pd under operando conditions. Using Grand Canonical Monte Carlo simulations driven by machine learning potential, we demonstrated the potential-dependent structural evolution from pristine Pd to palladium hydride (PdHx) under −0.11 to −0.51 V vs RHE. For the in situ-generated PdHx surfaces with some amorphous or disordering features, the dominant hollow sites of Pd are blocked by adsorbed H* species, thereby repelling NO* to adsorb obliquely on PdHx top sites. The adsorption configuration of NO* steers the react","au":["Huijuan Jing","Jun Long","Chenyu Yang","Pu Guo","Jianping Xiao"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"导致选择性羟胺电合成的位点敏感性","zb":"研究发现原位生成的 PdHx 表面通过改变位点结构，使 Pd 的主导空位被 *H 物种占据，迫使 NO* 斜向吸附在 PdHx 顶位，从而引导反应路径从 NOH* 转向 HNO*，最终生成 NH2OH*。PdHx 顶位 d 带中心下移促进了 NH2OH* 脱附并防止过度还原为氨。基于多种催化剂的分析，确定了 HNO* 与 NOH* 的形成能及 NH2OH* 的吸附能是决定高羟胺选择性的关键特征。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta06914b","t":"CuCo Bimetallic Synergy: Layered Double Hydroxides for Efficient Ammonia Production from Electrocatalytic Nitrite Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta06914b","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This study employed a straightforward hydrothermal method to successfully co-precipitate CuCoAl layered double hydroxide (LDH). By varying the Cu:Co molar ratio, LDH nanosheets approximately 200 nm in size were obtained,...","au":["Yang Wang","ＹＵＡＮ ＷＡＮＧ","Cuilian Sun","Tianxing Wu","Xiujing Xing","Wei Xiong"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zt":"CuCo 双金属协同：层状双氢氧化物用于高效的电催化亚硝酸还原制氨","zb":"本研究采用简单的水热法成功共沉淀 CuCoAl 层状双氢氧化物（LDH）。通过改变 Cu:Co 摩尔比，获得了约 200 nm 的 LDH 纳米片。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1038/s41893-026-01981-x","t":"Photocatalytic nitrogen reduction to high-concentration ammonia via interfacial evaporation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41893-026-01981-x","s":"Nature Sustainability","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Synthesis of valuable ammonia through photocatalytic reduction of nitrogen is a promising sustainable route, but its efficiency remains limited. This work shows that coupling the reaction with solar-driven interfacial evaporation can substantially improve ammonia yield, concentration and purity.","au":["Bowen Lv","Xinfei Fan","Yuanlu Xu","Yanbin Xin","Chengwen Song","Yanming Liu"],"o":"日常","why":["Photocatalytic nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"通过界面蒸发进行光催化氮还原以获得高浓度氨","zb":"通过光催化还原氮合成有价值的氨是一种可持续的途径，但其效率仍然有限。本研究表明，将反应与太阳能驱动的界面蒸发相结合可以显著提高氨的产率、浓度和纯度。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acsanm.6c04063","t":"Metal−Organic Framework Nanosheet-Derived CuO for Efficient Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsanm.6c04063","s":"ACS Applied Nano Materials","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (NO3RR) offers a “two birds with one stone” strategy by simultaneously removing pollutants and producing value-added ammonia (NH3). However, its multiple electron- and proton-transfer steps require catalysts with both high activity and selectivity. Copper (Cu) is widely regarded as one of the most promising NO3RR electrocatalysts due to its low cost and relatively high activity, yet its ammonia yield rate is usually constrained by sluggish nitrite conversion kinetics. Herein, a series of Cu-based catalysts with distinct oxidation states and crystallinity were derived from Cu-based metal−organic framework nanosheets (Cu-MOF NSs) by adjusting the pyrolysis conditions, and their NO3RR performance in alkaline media was evaluated. The low-crystallinity copper oxide catalyst (CuO-1) achieved the highest NH3 yield rate of 11.5 mg cm−2 h−1 at −0.8 V vs","au":["Yu Fan","Zhenyang Meng","Jiarui Zhang","Xianghui Jiang","Wei Cui","Yecan Pi"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"金属-有机框架纳米片衍生的 CuO 用于高效电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"电催化硝酸盐还原 (NO3RR) 通过同时去除污染物和生产有价值的氨 (NH3) 提供了一种“一石二鸟”的策略。然而，其多电子和质子转移步骤需要具有高活性和选择性的催化剂。铜 (Cu) 由于其低成本和相对较高的活性，被广泛认为是 NO3RR 电催化剂中最有希望的之一，但其氨产率通常受到亚硝酸转化动力学缓慢的限制。在此，通过调整热解条件，从基于铜的金属-有机框架纳米片 (Cu-MOF NSs) 衍生了一系列具有不同氧化态和结晶度的铜基催化剂，并评估了它们在碱性介质中的 NO3RR 性能。低结晶度氧化铜催化剂 (CuO-1) 在 -0.8 V vs 可逆氢电极 (RHE) 下实现了 11.5 mg cm−2 h−1 的最高 NH3 产率，显著优于金属铜催化剂 (Cu@NC)、高结晶度氧化铜催化剂 (CuO-2) 和大多数先前报道的催化剂。机理研究表明，CuO-1 在反应过程中部分还原以产生 C","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.6c18993","t":"Interfacial Synergy Triggered Intrinsic Tandem Catalysis for High-Efficiency Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c18993","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-06T03:24:56Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) has emerged as a sustainable circular-economy approach that enables simultaneous remediation of nitrate-contaminated wastewater and green ammonia synthesis. However, practical implementation of NO3RR is severely hindered by complicated multi-proton-electron transfer processes, undesirable nitrite accumulation, and competing hydrogen evolution reactions. While bimetallic heterostructured tandem catalysts hold great potential to address these issues, conventional spatially separated dual-site configurations still suffer from sluggish intermediate relay, mismatched reaction kinetics, and uncontrollable nitrite desorption. Herein, we fabricate a nanoparticle-assembled needle-like CuO/Co3O4 heterostructure and propose an interfacial synergy-triggered intrinsic tandem catalysis strategy. The optimized CuO/Co3O4 (1:1) delivers an NH3 y","au":["Haoyu Qiu","Xinfa Zhang","Xiaoyang Yang","Wei Jiang","Zhenqiang Yuan","Pan Chu"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"界面协同触发的内在串联催化用于高效电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"电化学硝酸盐还原反应（NO3RR）作为一种可持续的循环经济方法，能够同时修复硝酸盐污染的废水和绿色氨合成。然而，NO3RR 的实际应用受到复杂的质子-电子转移过程、不希望的亚硝酸盐积累和竞争性析氢反应的严重阻碍。双金属异质结构串联催化剂具有巨大的潜力来解决这些问题，但传统的空间分离双位点配置仍然存在中间体传递缓慢、反应动力学不匹配和亚硝酸盐脱附不可控的问题。本研究中，我们制备了纳米颗粒组装的针状 CuO/Co3O4 异质结构，并提出了一种界面协同触发的内在串联催化策略。优化的 CuO/Co3O4 (1:1) 在 –0.9 V vs RHE 下提供 NH3 收率为 1.06 ± 0.07 mmol h–1 mg–1 (0.53 ± 0.035 mmol h–1 cm–2)，在 –0.8 V vs RHE 下最大法拉第效率为 95.57 ± 1.15%，优于单金属对应物和物理混合物。异质界面调","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3389/fpls.2026.2010688","t":"Physiology-informed UAV multispectral estimation of tobacco leaf nitrogen nutrition index for variable nitrogen management","u":"https://doi.org/10.3389/fpls.2026.2010688","s":"Frontiers in Plant Science","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-11T02:45:15Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Introduction Spatial variability in crop nitrogen (N) status limits the effectiveness of uniform fertilization in tobacco, yet remotely sensed spectral signals cannot be directly translated into crop N demand. This study developed a physiology-informed unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV) multispectral framework linking leaf dry matter (LDM), leaf N concentration (LNC), the leaf nitrogen nutrition index (NNIleaf), and variable N management. Methods Field experiments involving seven N application rates (0–150 kg N ha −1 ) were conducted in Yunnan, China, during 2023–2024. A critical leaf-N relationship was established using ln(LDM) and LNC. Multispectral vegetation indices were screened using Pearson correlation analysis and recursive feature elimination. Partial least squares regression (PLSR), random forest (RF), and extreme gradient boosting (XGBoost) were compared for estimating ln(LDM) and ","au":["Jizhong Yang","Chuixin Lou","Shaorong Yang","Wenbiao Wu","Lin Peng","Xiangqi Xu"],"o":"日常","zb":"该研究建立了基于无人机多光谱框架的烟草叶片干物质、氮浓度及氮营养指数估算模型，通过2023–2024年田间实验筛选关键关系，在2024年独立验证中R²达到0.826，并推荐了97.12 kg N ha−1的平均施氮量以优化产量和变异性。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1038/s41893-026-01982-w","t":"Making ammonia at the water’s edge","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41893-026-01982-w","s":"Nature Sustainability","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Photocatalytic nitrogen fixation can make ammonia from nitrogen and water under mild conditions, but slow nitrogen delivery and product build-up limit output. Now, a floating solar interface couples nitrogen reduction with evaporation, greatly speeding up ammonia formation and concentrating a high-purity product in the condensate.","au":["Shuai Guo","Hui Ying Yang"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"在水边制氨","zb":"光催化氮固定可以在温和条件下将氮和水转化为氨，但氮传递缓慢和产物积累限制了产量。现在，一个浮动的太阳能界面将氮还原与蒸发耦合，大大加快了氨的形成，并在冷凝水中集中了高纯度的产物。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jchemed.6c01163","t":"Catalytic Hydrolysis of Ammonia Borane: An Integrated Undergraduate Experiment on Hydrogen Production and Utilization","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jchemed.6c01163","s":"Journal of Chemical Education","d":"2026-11-06","f":"2026-11-09T02:38:23Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia borane (NH3BH3, AB) is a chemical hydrogen storage material with high hydrogen content, low molecular weight, and good stability. Herein, an undergraduate laboratory experiment was designed for students in materials science, chemical engineering, energy science, and related disciplines to demonstrate H2 production from AB hydrolysis and its application. A Pd/C nanocomposite was employed as a catalyst in the experiment that integrates kinetic analysis with practical utilization. Students first recorded H2-production curves and determined key parameters of turnover frequency and activation energy and then used the generated H2 to power a small fuel-cell car. The entire experiment was completed within approximately 4 h. Through this experiment, students may develop essential experimental skills and gain a systematic understanding of H2 generation from AB hydrolysis and its ","au":["Xiaochen Qi","Yi Xiong","Jinzhi Li","Jun Zhang","Huanyu Yu","Pengfei Li"],"o":"日常","zt":"氨硼烷催化水解：氢气生产与利用的集成本科实验","zb":"利用 Pd/C 纳米复合材料作为催化剂，设计了一个集成动力学分析与实际应用的本科实验。学生在约 4 小时内记录了产氢曲线并测定了关键参数，随后利用生成的氢气驱动小型燃料电池车。","ob":"氨硼烷水解；涉及碳材料"},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.71803","t":"Engineering Energy‐Storage Interfaces With Atomic and Molecular Layer Deposition: From Surface Chemistry to Process Design","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71803","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"ABSTRACT The performance and lifetime of energy‐storage devices are determined at the interfaces between electrodes, electrolytes, and separators, where ion and charge transfer, parasitic reactions, and mechanical degradation originate within nanometers of the surface. Atomic layer deposition (ALD) and molecular layer deposition (MLD) enable precise engineering of these interfaces through self‐limiting surface reactions that produce conformal coatings with controlled thickness and composition, even on porous electrodes. Although ALD surface chemistry is well established on ideal oxide surfaces, energy‐storage materials present chemically and structurally complex surfaces, on which reaction mechanisms, growth per cycle, and coating function can differ. This Review develops a chemistry–process–structure–function framework that connects surface chemistry, precursor reaction pathways, and nu","au":["Kyobin Park","Jeffrey W. Elam"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"利用原子层沉积与分子层沉积工程化储能界面：从表面化学到工艺设计","zb":"综述利用原子层沉积（ALD）和分子层沉积（MLD）通过自限制表面反应精确工程化电极、电解质和隔膜界面，构建化学-工艺-结构-功能框架，分析在氧化物、硫化物、金属、聚合物和碳基底上的生长机理及在锂基及非锂电池中的应用。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.71764","t":"Ionomer-free Iridium Anodes with Low Loading for Zero-gap Electrolyzers via Direct Atomic Layer Deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71764","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:00:02Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"Proton exchange membrane water electrolysis (PEMWE) is among the most promising techniques to provide hydrogen as both energy carrier and feedstock for the chemical industry, due to its compatibility with intermittent renewable electricity sources. However, a major bottleneck in scaling up PEMWE is the limited supply of the anode catalyst Ir. This work shows a novel approach to tailoring ionomer-free catalyst layers based on custom-made microporous substrates and two different atomic layer deposition (ALD) processes, both using Ir(EtCp)(CHD) precursor. Thermal ALD using O3 as counter-reactant yields mostly metallic Ir/IrOx and an electrode Ir loading of 0.21 mg/cm2. The PEMWE cell-level performance is comparable to a commercial catalyst-coated membrane anode despite 7x lower loading, and is maintained over an accelerated durability test equivalent to 600 h of intermittent operation. More","au":["Peter M. Piechulla","Iris Blommestein","Anne van Gerven","Henri Pelzer","Ezgi Demiröz","Jonas Englhard"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"基于直接原子层沉积的无离子膜铱阳极","zb":"针对质子交换膜水电解槽中铱催化剂供应受限的问题，利用定制微孔基底和两种原子层沉积（ALD）工艺制备了无离子膜铱阳极。热ALD工艺制备的电极铱负载量为0.21 mg/cm2，其性能与商业催化剂涂层膜相当，且在等效600小时间歇运行测试中保持稳定。此外，利用等离子增强ALD将铱负载进一步降低至0.04 mg/cm2，并验证了该阳极与多种膜材料的兼容性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","pp":"arXiv","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6cc05336j","t":"Photothermal Cu Island-Decorated NiFe Nanocone Arrays for Exceptional Tandem Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electroreduction and Zn-Nitrate Batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6cc05336j","s":"Chemical Communications","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"In this paper, we construct Cu islands on NiFe nanocone arrays for the electroreduction of nitrate to ammonia. The integration of tandem catalysis heterointerfaces, geometric architecture, and photothermal effects synergistically...","au":["Xienan Mi","Yanqing Wang","Zijian Gao","Zitong Yan","Liping Ding","Qi Li"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"用于卓越串联硝酸盐-氨电还原及锌-硝酸盐电池的光热Cu岛装饰NiFe纳米锥阵列","zb":"在NiFe纳米锥阵列上构建Cu岛，集成串联催化异质界面、几何架构和光热效应协同促进硝酸盐还原。该体系在光热辅助下实现了高效的硝酸盐到氨的电还原及锌-硝酸盐电池性能。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.64509/jdi.14.173","t":"Dual-Metal Electron Pump Engineered Platinum-based HOR Catalysts for Ammonia-tolerant Hydrogen Sensing","u":"https://doi.org/10.64509/jdi.14.173","s":"Journal of Design Intelligence","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-11-08T17:04:56Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Electrochemical hydrogen sensors are attractive for hydrogen detection owing to their high sensitivity, rapid response, and low energy consumption, offering great potential for safety monitoring in complex environments. However, the anodic HOR catalysts are highly susceptible to poisoning by interfering species such as ammonia, posing a critical challenge to the development of robust hydrogen sensors for ammonia-containing environments. Since binary transition metal elements are promising for further optimizing the HOR performance of platinum compared to single transition metals, metal salts with different combinations were dispersed on XC-72 by rotary evaporation here. After wet impregnation, FeCo-Pt, FeMn-Pt, CoMn-Pt, and Fe-Pt, were obtained by heat treatment under H2/Ar mixed gas. In this strategy, Fe and Co form an FeCo alloy during heat treatment. Compared to single-element doping,","au":["Changqing Jin","Rui Wang","Aojie Zhang","Yanshen Zhao","Zemin Huang","Haolin Tang"],"o":"日常","zt":"为氨耐受氢传感工程化双金属电子泵铂基析氢反应催化剂","zb":"研究通过旋转蒸发将不同组合的金属盐分散在 XC-72 上，经 H2/Ar 混合气体热处理制备了 FeCo-Pt、FeMn-Pt、CoMn-Pt 和 Fe-Pt 催化剂。该策略利用 Fe 和 Co 形成的 FeCo 合金作为“双金属电子泵”优化 Pt 电子结构，显著增强了电子转移能力，实现了 HOR 活性和抗氨干扰能力的同步提升。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15011724/v1","t":"Techno-Economic and Geospatial Assessment of Distributed Fertilizer Production via Wastewater Ammonia Solar Electrochemical Stripping","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15011724/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Decentralized alternatives to centralized fertilizer production are needed to reduce supply chain risks, minimize transportation costs, and lower environmental impacts. Solar-powered Electrochemical Stripping (ECS) is an emerging technology that can produce ammonium fertilizer in a distributed manner through wastewater nitrogen recovery. We quantify the fraction of fertilizer demand in the United States that can be met by a wastewater feedstock while minimizing transportation distances, finding that 55% (5.54 Mt N per year) of demand is co-located with sufficient supply from domestic, agricultural, or industrial wastewater. A techno-economic assessment of ECS at scales sufficient to meet localized fertilizer demand estimated breakeven prices of US$8.70/kg N for ammonium sulfate, US$9.69/kg N for ammonium nitrate, and US$31.18/kg N for monoammonium phosphate, and US$12.15/kg N for diammon","au":["Orisa Z. Coombs","Lorenzo Rosa","William A. Tarpeh"],"o":"日常","zt":"通过废水氨太阳能电化学剥离生产分布式肥料的技经与地空评估","zb":"评估了利用太阳能电化学剥离（ECS）技术从废水中回收氮生产分布式肥料的经济性和地空分布。研究量化了美国55%的肥料需求可由废水原料满足，并估算出硫酸铵、硝酸铵等肥料的盈亏平衡价格。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1103/3s5d-ys4b","t":"Cubic BN formation from ammonia borane (BH 3 NH 3 ) at extreme conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1103/3s5d-ys4b","s":"Physical Review B","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Ammonia borane (BH3NH3) is widely used as a hydrogen-storage material, predominantly in static compression experiments. In this work, we reveal that heteronuclear aggregation between boron and nitrogen atoms, driven by polarized atomic charges, occurs after the molecular dissociation of BH3NH3 under high temperatures and pressures. With increasing pressure, the BN structures evolve from low-dimensional configurations into interconnected three-dimensional networks characterized by increasing populations of threefold- and fourfold-coordinated boron and nitrogen atoms. These structural transformations suggest a pathway toward phase separation into cubic boron nitride (c-BN) and liquid hydrogen. By evaluating the free-energy differences using thermodynamic integration, we demonstrate that the phase separation becomes thermodynamically favorable above approximately 185 GPa along the 4000 K is","au":["D. Murayama","S. Ohmura","A. Amouretti","D. Singappuli","K. Taketoshi","N. Ozaki"],"o":"日常","zt":"极端条件下从氨硼烷 (BH 3 NH 3 ) 形成立方 BN","zb":"研究在高温高压下氨硼烷分子解离后硼氮原子异核聚合形成立方氮化硼 (c-BN) 的机理。通过热力学积分计算，发现沿 4000 K 等温线压力超过约 185 GPa 时，相分离为 c-BN 和液态氢的吉布斯自由能差变为负值，表明该条件下生成 c-BN 和富氢化合物的可能性。","ob":"氨硼烷水解"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.76525","t":"In Situ Reconstructed Core–Shell Fe‐MOF@Cu as a Tandem Electrocatalyst toward Nitrate Electroreduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.76525","s":"Small","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction enables sustainable ammonia production and simultaneous nitrate pollutant abatement. Yet its multi‐step proton‐coupled electron transfer mechanism is hindered by slow reaction kinetics. Herein, we report a reconstructed tandem catalyst, Fe‐MOFs@Cu, generated through the in situ electrochemical transformation of a designed MIL‐101(Fe)@HKUST‐1 core–shell precursor. Under nitrate reduction conditions, the HKUST‐1 shell is selectively converted into Cu species, whereas the MIL‐101(Fe) core remains largely preserved, resulting in a reconstructed Cu/Fe heterointerface with spatially integrated active domains. Electrochemical and kinetic analyses reveal a clear functional differentiation between the two catalytic components. Cu‐rich domains preferentially promote nitrate activation to nitrite, while Fe‐based sites facilitate water activation and the s","au":["Qianqian Wang","Jiahao Ma","Yuting Zhang","Yunpei Zhu","Sifei Zhuo","Qiuyu Zhang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"原位重构核壳 Fe-MOF@Cu 作为串联电催化剂将硝酸电还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为硝酸电还原制备氨的串联电催化剂，通过原位电化学转化设计的 MIL-101(Fe)@HKUST-1 核壳前驱体制备 Fe-MOF@Cu 催化剂，HKUST-1 壳层选择性转化为 Cu 物种，MIL-101(Fe) 核层基本保持，形成 Cu/Fe 异质界面，具有空间集成活性区域。Cu 丰富的区域优先促进硝酸活化为亚硝酸，Fe 基位点促进水活化及亚硝酸的后续氢化为氨，界面耦合抑制亚硝酸积累和竞争性析氢。在 -0.5 V vs. RHE 下，R-MIL-101(Fe)@Cu 实现 0.61 mmol h −1 cm −2 的 NH 3 产率率和 94.9% 的法拉第效率，并具有优异的操作稳定性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.79457","t":"Precursor Size Governs Thermally Activated Solid State Conversion Into the Redox Active Framework Formation in Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.79457","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-05","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Precursor-domain size is identified as a decisive kinetic parameter in the solid-state synthesis of Na 4 Fe 3 (PO 4 ) 2 P 2 O 7 . Oversized Fe 3 (PO 4 ) 2 domains restrict Na/P penetration and retain unreacted cores, whereas intermediate domains undergo heterogeneous conversion with residual phases. Submicrometre domains shorten the required transport distance, enabling near-complete conversion and formation of a uniform redox-active NFPP framework. ABSTRACT Na 4 Fe 3 (PO 4 ) 2 P 2 O 7 is an attractive Fe-based polyanionic cathode for low-cost sodium-ion batteries, but scalable synthesis remains constrained by the trade-off between precursor homogeneity and process compatibility. Soluble Fe salts enable intimate mixing, whereas Fe (II)-phosphate precursors avoid nitrate/oxalate burdens but react as insoluble domains. Here we identify precursor defined solid state reaction length as the k","au":["Yuanhang Wang","Hangxin Niu","Dongdong Li","Wei Han"],"o":"日常","zt":"前驱体尺寸调控热活化固态转化成氧化还原活性框架形成在 Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7 中","zb":"研究对象为 Na 4 Fe 3 (PO 4 ) 2 P 2 O 7 的固态合成，通过控制前驱体尺寸影响反应动力学， oversized Fe 3 (PO 4 ) 2 域限制 Na/P 渗透并保留未反应核心，亚微米域缩短传输距离实现近完全转化，形成均匀的氧化还原活性 NFPP 框架。实验证实前驱体尺寸调控 NFPP 合成，CV 前驱体在 0.1 C 下容量为 104.1 mAh g −1，20 C 下为 61.8 mAh g −1，并具有稳定的长期和全电池操作。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.4875918","t":"Magnetically Induced Reactive Carbon Capture With Ferromagnetic Multi‐Function Materials","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.4875918","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":19,"ab":"Magnetically induced reactive carbon capture (RCC) was demonstrated for the first time with ferromagnetic multifunction materials (MFMs) capable of adsorbing CO 2 and converting it to methane via rapid temperature swing powered by magnetic induction heating. These MFMs exhibited no activity under conventional heating, establishing magnetic reduction as a key enabling step. Application of induction heating to RCC can dramatically improve productivity by shortening cycle time and establishing a new power-to-X paradigm. ABSTRACT Thermochemical reactive carbon capture (tRCC) offers a direct pathway to convert dilute CO 2 into valuable fuels and chemicals. However, the scalability of tRCC is hindered by the thermal inertia of conventional reactors, which limits reactor throughput. Here, we report the first demonstration of magnetically induced reactive carbon capture (mRCC), utilizing high-fr","au":["Hyewon Lee","Cody J. Wrasman","Steven C. Hayden","Madeline Van Winkle","Klaertje K. Hesselink","Chae Jeong‐Potter"],"o":"日常","why":["rapid heating"],"zt":"利用铁磁多功能材料进行磁诱导反应性碳捕获","zb":"首次利用铁磁多功能材料通过磁感应加热驱动的快速温度循环，实现CO2的吸附与转化为甲烷。研究发现磁感应加热能显著缩短反应时间，而常规加热会导致材料失活，磁诱导反应性碳捕获（mRCC）建立了新的电转X范式。","ob":"通用催化方法","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/cssc.71193","t":"Atomic Layer‐Deposited LSO Coating Stabilizes the Interface and Enhances the Electrochemical Performance of High‐Nickel NCM811 Cathode Material","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cssc.71193","s":"ChemSusChem","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"LiNi 0.8 Co 0.1 Mn 0.1 O 2 (NCM811) cathode material has attracted considerable attention because of its potential to achieve substantially higher energy densities, but the practical deployment of NCM811 remains hindered by severe interfacial and structural degradation during repeated cycling. Atomic layer deposition (ALD) was employed in this study to construct an amorphous Li─Si─O (LSO) coating layer with different thicknesses on the surface of NCM811 cathode materials, and their effects on the structural characteristics, interfacial properties, and electrochemical performance were systematically investigated. Among all the samples, 50 LSO@NCM811 exhibits the best electrochemical performance, retaining a discharge capacity of 115.96 mAh g −1 after 500 cycles at 1 C under a cutoff voltage of 4.3 V. By constructing a stable and ionically conductive interfacial protective layer, the LSO c","au":["Yao Yao","Zhongyuan Luo","Jianguo Duan","Jiyue Hou","Yongshun Liang","Chunman Yang"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic Layer-Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积的LSO涂层稳定界面并提高高镍NCM811正极材料的电化学性能","zb":"研究对象为NCM811正极材料，关键方法为原子层沉积（ALD）构建不同厚度的LSO涂层，主要结果为50 LSO@NCM811在1 C和4.3 V截止电压下循环500次后容量为115.96 mAh g −1，LSO涂层通过构建稳定的离子导电界面层，协同优化界面稳定性、结构稳定性和电化学动力学，显著提高NCM811电化学性能。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-026-78934-7","t":"Highly efficient and durable Ga-doped Ni/Al2O3 catalyst enhanced by interfacial Ga3+ for low-temperature ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-78934-7","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Ammonia could enable carbon-free hydrogen production, but efficient decomposition at low temperatures remains difficult. Trace gallium helps nickel catalysts remove surface hydrogen, markedly boosting low temperature activity.","au":["Xinru Zhao","Youning Zhang","Yafei Liu","Ouyang Liu","Shuzhuang Sun","Dandan Han"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"高效率和高耐久性的Ga掺杂Ni/Al2O3催化剂通过界面Ga3+增强低温氨分解","zb":"研究对象为Ni/Al2O3催化剂，关键方法为Ga掺杂，主要结果为微量Ga帮助Ni催化剂去除表面氢，显著提高低温活性。","ob":"氨分解制氢","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.71797","t":"Relay Catalysis on Phase‐Separated Janus–CuCo Alloys for Efficient Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction at Industrial Low Concentration","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71797","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Phase-separated Janus CuCo alloys enable relay catalysis for electrochemical nitrate reduction at industrially low concentrations. Cu-rich and Co-rich domains play complementary roles, promoting nitrate activation, intermediate transfer, and hydrogenation at the Cu–Co interface. This interfacial synergy delivers enhanced activity, selectivity, and mechanistic insight for efficient nitrate-to-ammonia conversion. ABSTRACT Earth-abundant Cu and Co are attractive electrocatalysts for nitrate reduction to ammonia (NO 3 − RR); however, conventional solid-solution alloys with single-phase active sites lack effective intermediate spillover, impeding the hydrogenation of multiple reaction intermediates and limiting NH 3 selectivity under dilute nitrate conditions. Here we report phase-separated yet electronically coupled Janus–CuCo alloys synthesized via a time–charge regulated electrochemical re","au":["Mazhar Hayat","Enyang Sun","Min Wang","Qamir Iqbal","Wenwen Zhou","Yan Yan"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"用于工业低浓度下高效电化学硝酸盐还原的相分离Janus–CuCo合金上的接力催化","zb":"报道了相分离且电子耦合的Janus–CuCo合金，通过时间-电荷调控电化学还原策略合成。Cu富集和Co富集域协同促进硝酸盐活化、中间体转移和氢化，在MEA流动池中实现了95.5%的氨法拉第效率（FE NH3）和4.2 mg h−1 mg cat−1的产氨率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ccr.2026.218725","t":"MXenes and their heterostructures for electrochemical nitrogen reduction: a pathway to green ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ccr.2026.218725","s":"Coordination Chemistry Reviews","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-05T03:28:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Parnapalle Ravi","Vempuluru Navakoteswara Rao","Mashallah Rezakazemi","Jin-Seo Nho"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"MXenes 和它们的异质结构用于电化学氮还原：通往绿色氨合成的一条途径","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.3390/systems14111407","t":"A Data-Driven Predictive Optimization Framework for the Dynamic Operation of Green Ammonia Energy Systems Under Uncertainty","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/systems14111407","s":"Systems","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Renewable power fluctuations and uncertain ammonia synthesis performance complicate operational coordination in green hydrogen–ammonia systems. This study develops a closed-loop prediction–scheduling framework using dual Gaussian processes to characterize renewable power and process performance. Calibrated lower and upper bounds enter material and energy constraints, while multi-objective particle swarm optimization balances operating cost and schedule variation. A joint-risk index selects plan retention, local repair, or global re-optimization, combined with plan refresh and conditional Pareto reuse in rolling horizon scheduling. The framework is evaluated with 24 h aggregated simulations using public meteorological data and published experimental data. Paired comparisons across seven fixed scenarios show that event-triggered and periodic scheduling both completed all 20 runs per scenar","au":["Han Xiao","Qi Tang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于绿色氨能源系统动态运行的基于数据的预测优化框架在不确定性下的绿色氨能源系统动态运行","zb":"研究对象为绿色氢-氨系统，关键方法为使用双高斯过程建模可再生能源功率和工艺性能，采用闭环预测-调度框架，多目标粒子群优化平衡运行成本和调度变化，联合风险指数选择计划保留、局部修复或全局重新优化，结合滚动时间窗调度中的计划刷新和条件帕累托重用。使用公开气象数据和已发表的实验数据进行24小时聚合模拟评估，事件触发和周期调度在七种固定场景中均完成所有运行并满足所有硬约束，事件触发在串行时间协议下减少控制器运行时间15.30–34.73%。234次补充压力测试请求中，177次完成当天，176次满足所有硬约束，1次终端审计失败，57次在搜索中停止。结果表明框架在模拟条件下协调概率预测、物理约束和调度响应，为绿色氢-氨系统运行优化提供可重复方法。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.proci.2026.106741","t":"Modelling emissions from ammonia combustors with the Incompletely Stirred Reactor Network method","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.proci.2026.106741","s":"Proceedings of the Combustion Institute","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-06T03:24:56Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This study assesses the Incompletely Stirred Reactor Network (ISRN) approach in terms of accuracy in capturing the scalar distributions in an ammonia-fuelled staged combustor employing various degrees of NH 3 partial cracking, characterised by the molar ammonia decomposition ratio (DR). Underlying solutions from Large Eddy Simulation with Conditional Moment Closure (LES-CMC) with D R = 0.25 for 10 bar and D R = 0.50 for 5 bar are used to explore the behaviour of the combustor at varying D R at the range 0.1 < DR < 0.9 at constant pressure without repeating the CFD simulation. The basic hypothesis is that the mixing field does not change significantly as the fuel changes, which enables the exploration of parameter spaces with a single reference LES-CMC simulation. The ISRN model accurately predicts temperature and NOx distributions across the full range of D R tested, showing good agreeme","au":["B. Harikrishnan","Epaminondas Mastorakos"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"使用不完全搅拌反应器网络方法模拟氨燃烧器排放","zb":"本研究评估了不完全搅拌反应器网络（ISRN）方法在捕获氨燃料分级燃烧器中不同 NH₃ 部分裂解程度（由摩尔氨分解比 DR 表征）的标量分布方面的准确性。使用大涡模拟与条件矩闭合（LES-CMC）的底层解，其中 DR = 0.25 对于 10 bar 和 DR = 0.50 对于 5 bar，在恒定压力下探索燃烧器在 0.1 < DR < 0.9 范围内不同 DR 的行为，而无需重复 CFD 模拟。基本假设是混合场在燃料变化时不会发生显著变化，这使人们能够使用单个参考 LES-CMC 模拟探索参数空间。ISRN 模型准确地预测了在整个 DR 测试范围内温度和 NOx 分布，与 LES-CMC 和实验结果均具有良好的吻合度。还探索了对化学机制的敏感性，发现所有测试方案都预测了相似的 NOx。结果表明，ISRN 可用作氨燃烧器排放的低阶模型，这有助于设计过程，并提供关于火焰结构随操作参数变化的见","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.79405","t":"Dual‐Alloy Exsolution in Fe‐Based Perovskite Anodes for High‐Performance Direct Ammonia Solid Oxide Fuel Cells","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.79405","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-04","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Dual FeCo and FeNi alloy nanoparticles are exsolved from a multi-doped Fe-based perovskite anode for high-performance direct ammonia solid oxide fuel cells. The dual-alloy surface coordinates electronic structure modulation and nanoparticle morphology control, providing abundant reaction sites and complementary catalytic functions for NH 3 decomposition, NH x dehydrogenation, and N 2 removal. Consequently, the R-LSBMFCN anode delivers efficient NH 3 utilization, suppressed anode polarization, and stable direct ammonia solid oxide fuel cell operation. ABSTRACT Direct ammonia solid oxide fuel cells (DA-SOFCs) offer an integrated route for carbon-free power generation by coupling in situ ammonia decomposition with electrochemical hydrogen oxidation. However, anode catalysts must simultaneously achieve rapid NH 3 decomposition, efficient electrochemical charge transfer, and long-term resista","au":["Jungseub Ha","Sehun Choi","Sanghwa Jeong","Minguk Kwak","Daehwan Kim","Jongcheol Gang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"双合金析出在 Fe 基钙钛矿阳极中用于高性能直接氨固体氧化物燃料电池","zb":"研究对象为直接氨固体氧化物燃料电池 (DA-SOFCs) 的 Fe 基钙钛矿多掺杂 Co 和 Ni 阳极 La 0.6 Sr 0.2 Ba 0.2 Mn 0.2 Fe 0.6 Co 0.1 Ni 0.1 O 3 (P-LSBMFCN)，经 H 2 还原形成 Ruddlesden-Popper (RP) 层状氧化物装饰有高度分散的 FeCo 和 FeNi 合金纳米颗粒 (R-LSBMFCN)。Co 和 Ni 多掺杂调控合金化路径，减小纳米颗粒尺寸并增加密度。双合金架构提供丰富的活性位点，加速 NH 3 活化、NH x 中间转化和 N 重组/脱附，R-LSBMFCN 表现出最低的表观活化电阻。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/pr14213539","t":"Surrogate-Based Constrained Single-Objective Bayesian Optimization for Joule-Heated Methane Dry Reforming Reactors","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/pr14213539","s":"Processes","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Joule heating coupled with porous media offers rapid in situ heat generation and a more uniform temperature distribution for DRM reactions, whereas the strong coupling of structural and operating parameters renders conventional trial-and-error optimization inefficient and costly. To tackle this challenge, a multi-physics numerical model for a centrally resistively heated DRM reactor is constructed by coupling Joule heating, flow and heat transfer, multicomponent species transport, and apparent reaction kinetics. A fully connected feedforward neural network (FC-FNN) surrogate model is further established to enable rapid prediction of reactor performance. Seven critical input variables are selected, including reaction temperature, gas hourly space velocity (GHSV), etc., and 9216 simulation samples are generated via numerical simulations for surrogate model training and parametric analysis.","au":["Yanlun Ren","Daqing Tang","Li Zhang","Houfang Miao","Meiying Cui","Zhiwei Li"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule-Heat"],"zt":"用于焦耳加热甲烷干重整反应器的基于代理的约束单目标贝叶斯优化","zb":"研究构建了多物理场数值模型和全连接前馈神经网络代理模型，利用贝叶斯优化算法在 H2/CO 比例和床层温度均匀性约束下优化反应器性能，优化后平均反应物转化率达 94.12%。","ob":"甲烷干重整｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1039/d6nr04094b","t":"MOF-Structured Metal@Carbon Core-Shell Hybrids for Efficient Joule Heating Catalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6nr04094b","s":"Nanoscale","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Active sites on which chemical reaction occurs are crucial in catalysis, energy storage, and environmental remediation. To achieve abundant active sites, materials with exceptional surface area have been pursued. Among...","au":["Manish Neupane","Jiayue Hu","Jiachun Wu","Wenhu Wang","Yaqing Guo","Chris Nelson"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"用于高效焦耳加热催化的 MOF 结构金属@碳核壳杂化物","zb":"为获得丰富的活性位点，研究利用 MOF 结构制备了金属@碳核壳杂化物，用于焦耳加热催化反应。","ob":"通用催化方法｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jenvman.2026.131297","t":"Joule heating for direct regeneration of spent lithium-ion batteries: Advances, advantages, and future perspectives","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jenvman.2026.131297","s":"Journal of Environmental Management","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"With cumulative spent lithium-ion battery (LIB) waste projected to exceed 11 million tonnes by 2030, rapid and low-carbon regeneration technologies are increasingly important for securing secondary resources. Joule heating provides heating and cooling rates of 103-105 K s-1 and millisecond-to-second thermal exposure, enabling impurity removal, lattice reconstruction and non-equilibrium defect regulation while limiting prolonged diffusion and side reactions. This review critically synthesizes Joule heating-enabled recycling, regeneration and upcycling of spent LIB anodes and cathodes, together with the underlying mechanisms, industrial barriers and environmental implications. Representative graphite-regeneration studies report >99% removal of Li and transition metal contaminants using only 0.1 M HCl, with regenerated or upcycled graphite delivering approximately 351-459 mAh·g-1. For catho","au":["Zhengyi Ouyang","Xuetian Li","Yong Cui","He Liu","Jia Li","Zhongcai Shao"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"用于废旧锂离子电池的直接再生：进展、优势与未来展望","zb":"研究对象为废旧锂离子电池，关键方法为闪蒸焦耳热，主要结果为使用0.1 M HCl去除Li和过渡金属污染物，再生石墨容量为351-459 mAh·g-1，LiCoO2直接再生后容量从103.9恢复到133 mAh·g-1，温室气体减排高达98%。","ob":"涉及碳材料｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c15718","t":"Electrolyte and Catalyst Cooperatively Control Proton Supply in Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electroreduction on CuRu at Positive Potentials","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c15718","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-03T03:55:12Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Above 0 V versus the reversible hydrogen electrode, the hydrogen evolution reaction is thermodynamically suppressed, making this potential region attractive for nitrate-to-ammonia conversion. However, in neutral and alkaline media typically used for the nitrate reduction reaction, protons for successive hydrogenation steps derive mainly from water dissociation, which becomes increasingly sluggish at more positive potentials. Proton availability thus governs the hydrogenation kinetics of nitrate and its intermediates. Using CuRu nanorods as a model catalyst, we resolve how the electrolyte and the catalyst jointly control the proton supply during NO3RR at positive potentials. Macroelectrode measurements reveal that the NO3– reduction kinetics depend on OH– concentration, and single-particle electrochemistry on a single CuRu nanorod, where ultrafast mass transport avoids local OH– ","au":["Jian Zhang","Thomas Quast","Esma Khatun","Yen-Ting Chen","Ridha Zerdoumi","Ann Cathrin Brix"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"电解质和催化剂在 CuRu 正电位硝酸盐到氨电还原中协同控制质子供应","zb":"利用 CuRu 纳米棒模型催化剂，研究电解质和催化剂如何协同控制正电位下的质子供应。宏观电极测量显示 NO3– 还原动力学依赖于 OH– 浓度，单颗粒电化学证实了这一点。原位扫描电化学显微镜表明 OH– 浓度通过增强的阳离子富集界面电场加速水分解，从而维持质子供应。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c14152","t":"Deciphering Hot-Carrier Effects on Multiple Elementary Steps in Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c14152","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-04T02:59:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Plasmonic photocatalysis can enhance conventional chemical transformations, but macroscale kinetic metrics, such as overall reaction rates and apparent activation barriers, are insufficient to identify the specific elementary steps modulated by hot carriers, limiting precise control over catalytic reactivity and selectivity. Here, we apply a spectrokinetic strategy based on in situ diffuse reflectance infrared Fourier transform spectroscopy (DRIFTS) to resolve elementary-step energetics in NH3 decomposition over CuRu alloy antenna–reactor catalysts. CuRu and Na-modified CuRu show different relative sensitivities to heating and illumination, providing a paired system for tracking how kinetic control is redistributed under thermal and plasmonic conditions. Temporal in situ DRIFTS and Arrhenius analysis identify site-dependent adsorbed N2 (*N2) intermediates and reveal a sequential","au":["Yaxi Gan","Huayue Yang","Dan Zeng","Bofang Wang","Shengqiang Nie","Lin Yuan"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"揭示氨分解中多基元步骤的热载流子效应","zb":"利用原位 DRIFTS 和 DFT 计算研究 CuRu 合金催化剂上氨分解的基元步骤。发现光照下 CuRu 的光特异性反应速率提升近三个数量级，界面 N2 迁移和台阶位点 N2 脱附的活化能分别降低 0.28 eV 和 0.75 eV，表明界面 N2 去除是光促进活性位点再生的关键步骤。","ob":"氨分解制氢｜光驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.79467","t":"Ultrasonically Engineered Low‐Coordination Mn Sites in Fe‐MOF Promote Charge Separation for Sacrificial‐Agent‐Free Photocatalytic N2 Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.79467","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The following paper sets out the design, synthesis, and schematic illustration of the photocatalytic nitrogen fixation mechanism of FeMnMOF photocatalysts with single-atom Mn─N sites. Among the prepared catalysts, U-FeMnMOF demonstrated the most effective photocatalytic nitrogen fixation capacity, with an ammonia yield of 1823.1 µmol·g −1 ·h −1 . ABSTRACT Photocatalytic nitrogen reduction involves complex proton-coupled multi-electron transfer processes, which bring about abundant reaction pathways and thus result in poorly controllable product selectivity. Benefiting from their unique electronic configuration and unsaturated coordination environment, single-atom photocatalysts can effectively regulate the reaction pathways of photoreductive N 2 activation and reduction, thereby improving the selectivity and NH 3 productivity of target ammonia products. Herein, an acetate-modified ultras","au":["Jingjing Wang","Xuejun Yang","Xue Zhao","Yafu Wang","Rui Ren","Yulan Gu"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"超声工程化低配位Mn位点在Fe-MOF中促进电荷分离用于无牺牲剂的光催化N2还原","zb":"研究对象为FeMnMOF光催化剂，关键方法为超声工程化构建低配位Mn-N位点，主要结果为U-FeMnMOF氨产率为1823.1 µmol·g −1 ·h −1，Mn-N位点通过调节光还原N2活化和还原的反应路径，提高目标氨产物的选择性和NH3生产力。","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Fe/铁体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.26599/nr.2026.94909308","t":"Dual-function hollow CoP/Ni 2 P polyhedra for electrocatalytic NO-to-ammonia conversion and rechargeable Zn-NO batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.26599/nr.2026.94909308","s":"Nano Research","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-12T03:47:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract The electrocatalytic reduction of nitric oxide (NO) to ammonia (NH3) offers a sustainable, low-temperature alternative to the energy and carbon-intensive Haber-Bosch process, simultaneously facilitating green NH3 synthesis and environmental remediation under ambient conditions. This study reports the development of a metal-organic framework (MOF)-derived, hierarchically engineered hollow polyhedral CoP/Ni2P bimetallic phosphide catalyst with high activity toward the nitric oxide reduction reaction (NORR) in both neutral and acidic media. Importantly, the catalytic activity is significantly improved in acidic conditions with an NH3 yield of 68.28 μmol∙cm-2∙h-1 and Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 65.4% at −1.05 V vs reversible hydrogen electrode (vs. RHE). The acid-enhanced performance highlights the important role of proton concentration in the NO hydrogenation steps. In addition, th","au":["Tao Niu","Wenju Gu","Kiran Kumar Kondamareddy","Boyu Zhang","Youwen Wang","Bin Gao"],"o":"日常","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"zt":"双功能空心CoP/Ni2P多面体用于电催化NO到氨的转化和可充电Zn-NO电池","zb":"本研究报道了一种金属有机框架（MOF）衍生、分级工程化的空心多面体CoP/Ni2P双金属磷化物催化剂，该催化剂对中性和酸性介质中的硝酸氧化物还原反应（NORR）具有高活性。在酸性条件下，氨的产率为68.28 μmol∙cm-2∙h-1，法拉第效率（FE）为65.4%，这归因于质子浓度在NO加氢步骤中的重要作用。此外，CoP/Ni2P基气体扩散阴极在Zn-NO电池系统中作为通用能量转换平台，在中性条件下开路电势为1.56 V，在酸性条件下为2.00 V，峰值功率密度分别为2.39 mW∙cm-2和3.34 mW∙cm-2。密度泛函理论计算表明，CoP/Ni2P异质界面处的d带中心优化是由电荷重排向费米能级对齐决定的，d带的宽度和形状与其中心的位相关联，进而调节了关键反应中间体的吸附自由能。这项研究展示了在统一电化学电池中将环境污染物治理与可持续氨生产和并发发电相结合的可行性。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1080/29984475.2026.2748636","t":"Embedding Academic Literacies in Higher Education: A Qualitative Research Synthesis into Processes and Roles Within Embedding Initiatives","u":"https://doi.org/10.1080/29984475.2026.2748636","s":"Research Synthesis in Applied Linguistics","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The increasing need for academic literacy provision in higher education has led to discussion around how discipline-specific language can be embedded into curricula. While the Academic Literacies approach is commonly referenced in these discussions, few frameworks have been proposed regarding processes and roles involved in embedding initiatives. This qualitative research synthesis unveils the processes and roles reported in recent embedding initiatives, revealing a trend of EAP staff’s starting in the middle of the teaching cycle and the common practice of academic literacy provision being based around assessments. This leads to issues within the embedding process, especially surrounding the identification of discipline-specific literacies, their embedding into curricula and their teaching alongside content. The impact of the failure to consider academic literacies at curriculum design ","au":["Eddy Lawson"],"o":"日常","zt":"嵌入学术素养于高等教育：嵌入计划中过程与角色的定性研究综合","zb":"该定性研究综述揭示了学术英语教学（EAP）人员通常在教学周期中间开始工作，且学术素养提供常围绕评估展开。研究提出了Identify, Design, Teach (IDT)模型，促进EAP人员嵌入院系并参与课程与评估设计，从而成功识别学科特定素养并嵌入课程。IDT模型的优势在于学习目标、教学材料和评估之间的建设性对齐，以及有助于学生参与学科内容的学术素养提供。","ob":"通用催化方法"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta07160k","t":"Hollow High-Entropy Oxide Spheres for Enhanced Electrocatalytic Nitrite-to-Ammonia Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta07160k","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-04T02:59:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The electrochemical reduction of nitrite (NO 2 − ) to ammonia offers a compelling route to synergistically remediate nitrite-polluted wastewater and produce value-added NH 3 . However, its practical viability is constrained by the scarcity...","au":["Haifen Ding","Limin Song","Rong Hua","Yuxing Ma","Xuezhen Si","Youfeng Pan"],"o":"日常","zt":"用于增强电催化亚硝酸盐制氨的高熵空心氧化物球","zb":"针对亚硝酸盐还原制氨的实用性问题，制备了高熵空心氧化物球。该材料通过高熵效应和空心结构协同提升了电催化性能，为处理含氮废水及生产高附加值氨提供了有效途径。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsanm.6c05096","t":"Rapid Synthesis of Fibrous Phosphorus for Ammonia Sensing at Room Temperature","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsanm.6c05096","s":"ACS Applied Nano Materials","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia (NH3) is a representative reducing toxic gas whose rapid, low-concentration detection is important in constant-temperature, constant-humidity environments such as semiconductor cleanrooms, yet existing NH3 sensors often suffer from high operating temperatures or slow response/recovery kinetics. Fibrous phosphorus (FP), a layered allotrope of elemental phosphorus with a parallel tubular structure, is an appealing sensing candidate, but its efficient preparation and gas-sensing potential remain underexplored. Here, we report an iodine-assisted chemical vapor transport method that enables gram-scale synthesis of FP within 5 h with a yield exceeding 99%, without the need for precise temperature-gradient control. The key is the iodine-mediated cleavage of P4 cages and the directed assembly of active phosphorus fragments into tubular FP. Taking advantage of the weak interlayer","au":["Guangfu Luo","Junpeng Chen","Cong Ye","Pengtao Wang","Xishuo Zhang","Shuai Zhang"],"o":"日常","zt":"快速合成纤维状磷用于室温氨传感","zb":"氨（NH3）是一种典型的还原性有毒气体，其快速、低浓度检测在恒温恒湿环境（如半导体洁净室）中很重要，但现有的NH3传感器通常存在工作温度高或响应/恢复动力学慢的问题。纤维状磷（FP），磷元素的一种层状同素异形体，具有平行管状结构，是一种有吸引力的传感候选材料，但其高效制备和气敏潜力仍待探索。本研究报道了一种碘辅助化学气相传输方法，可在5小时内以超过99%的产率实现克级FP合成，无需精确的温度梯度控制。关键在于碘介导的P4笼的断裂和活性磷片段的定向组装成管状FP。利用弱的层间范德华相互作用，通过60分钟的冰浴剥离获得了高质量FP纳米带（FP-NRs），其平均宽度约为50 nm，平均长度约为6 μm，超过60%的带长宽比超过150。FP-NRs传感器在室温下对100 ppm NH3表现出826%的高响应，在90%标准下响应/恢复时间为31/7 s，在2 ppm NH3（响应69.8%）时仍保持","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.mser.2026.101327","t":"Diatomic catalysts for nitrate electroreduction to ammonia: From reaction mechanism to scaled-up production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mser.2026.101327","s":"Materials Science and Engineering R Reports","d":"2026-11-03","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Shuo Zhang","Wenxin Wang","Hanqi Yu","Jiakun Zhang","Yan Li","Jing Wang"],"o":"日常","zt":"用于硝酸根电还原制氨的双原子催化剂：从反应机理到规模化生产","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c07178","t":"Synergistic Catalysis of Single-Site Rhenium and Ruthenium Nanoclusters for Ammonia Synthesis under Mild Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c07178","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T03:55:12Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":40,"ab":"Abstract The development of high-efficiency NH3 synthesis catalysts under mild conditions is urgently required to alleviate the excessive energy consumption and carbon emissions in traditional Haber–Bosch processes. Although Ru-based catalysts show considerable potential, their catalytic activity is often severely constrained by hydrogen poisoning caused by strong H2 adsorption. Herein, we report the fabrication of a Ba/0.1Re–Ru/AC catalyst through the strategic integration of single-atom Re species into a conventional Ba/Ru/AC framework. Notably, the Ba/0.1Re–Ru/AC catalyst exhibits a high NH3 synthesis rate of 65.1 mmol g–1 h–1 at 400 °C and 1 MPa. Mechanistic investigations reveal that single-atom Re species function as a supplementary active site for H2 adsorption and activation. The incorporation of Re also facilitates H-spillover over the catalyst surface, which effectively allevia","au":["Mingyuan Zhang","Depeng Zhang","Lei Zhang","Tianhua Zhang","Ming Chen","Xuanbei Peng"],"o":"日常","w":["Junling Lu","Lilong Jiang"],"why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"温和条件下单原子铼和钌纳米团簇协同催化合成氨","zb":"通过将单原子铼物种整合到 Ba/Ru/AC 框架中制备了 Ba/0.1Re–Ru/AC 催化剂。该催化剂在 400 °C 和 1 MPa 下表现出 65.1 mmol g–1 h–1 的高氨合成速率。机制研究表明单原子铼作为 H2 吸附和活化的补充活性位点，促进 H 溢流并缓解氢中毒，同时调节载体缺陷密度和强金属-载体相互作用。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","top":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15011542/v1","t":"Comparative Magnetic Heating of Surface-Modified Ferrite Nanoparticles in Water and Agar Phantoms","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15011542/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"This study compares the alternating-magnetic-field (AMF) heating of Fe3O4-, MnFe2O4-, MgFe2O4-, and SrFe12O19-targeted nanoparticle preparations and of their sequentially silica-modified, aminated, Aufunctionalized, and PEG-treated forms. The compositions are identified by their nominal synthesis precursors. Temperature–time curves and the times required to reach 42 °C were measured in water and in nominally 1% agar phantoms under identical induction-generator settings (132 kHz; 5 kW rated output). Among the untreated preparations, the Mg-labeled series reached 42 °C fastest (145 s in water and 187 s in agar), whereas the Srlabeled series was the slowest (222 and 293 s, respectively). For the Mg-labeled particles, increasing the concentration from 2.5 to 10 mg mL 1 shortened the time to 42 °C from 394 to 77 s in water and from 381 to 112 - s in agar. In water, the aminated Mn-, Mg-, and ","au":["Aydın Evrim","Ayşesimay Çetin","Celaletdin Ergun","Ali Kılıç"],"o":"日常","why":["Magnetic Heat"],"zt":"水与琼脂模体中表面修饰铁氧体纳米粒子的比较磁加热","zb":"研究对比了 Fe3O4、MnFe2O4、MgFe2O4 和 SrFe12O19 纳米粒子及其表面修饰形式在 132 kHz 下的磁加热性能，发现 MgFe2O4 系列升温最快，表面氨基修饰可显著提升加热速率。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控","pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/photonsci.6c00065","t":"Development of a Custom-Built Atomic Layer Deposition Reactor for In Situ Synchrotron GISAXS and XAS Characterization","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/photonsci.6c00065","s":"Photon Science","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract This work presents the design, implementation, and validation of a custom-built in situ atomic layer deposition (ALD) reactor developed at the ALBA Synchrotron Light Source (Cerdanyola del Vallès, Spain), enabling direct integration with synchrotron X-ray beamlines. A modular configuration allows the ALD reactor to be deployed at two ALBA Synchrotron beamlines: NCD-SWEET beamline (BL11) for Grazing Incidence Small Angle X-ray Scattering (GISAXS) and NOTOS beamline (BL16) for X-ray Absorption Spectroscopy (XAS), requiring only minimal reconfiguration. The reactor performance was validated by in situ deposition of TiO2 thin films using titanium tetraisopropoxide (TTIP) and H2O as the precursor and co-reactant, respectively, with a growth per cycle (GPC) of 0.17 Å·cycle–1 at 150 °C. This system was chosen for its low growth rate, as a demanding test of detection sensitivity. In si","au":["Marina Armengol-Profitós","Jordi Prat Albert","Montserrat Prieto","Zbigniew Reszela","Cristián Huck-Iriart","Santiago Álvarez"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zb":"开发了一种可集成同步辐射光束线的模块化原位原子层沉积反应器，用于GISAXS和XAS表征。该系统在150 °C下沉积TiO2薄膜，生长速率为0.17 Å·cycle–1，并揭示了三种动力学生长阶段。原位GISAXS和XANES结合提供了薄膜形貌和生长动力学的综合图像。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.7471326","t":"Ammonia‐Gated Guanyl Hydrazone Photoisomerization Enables Sequential Solid‐State Optical Response in Hydrogen‐Bonded Organic Frameworks","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.7471326","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":13,"ab":"Embedding hydrazone photoswitches into hydrogen-bonded organic frameworks enables sequential, programmable macroscopic optical outputs. Ammonia exposure unlocks solid-state E / Z photoisomerization, which triggers a cascade reorganization of TPE packing to modulate coloration and luminescence, providing a design paradigm for high-security, information-dense smart photofunctional materials. ABSTRACT Light-driven molecular switches enable precise and noninvasive regulation of molecular structure and function, and thus represent fundamental building blocks for stimuli-responsive photofunctional materials. However, translating molecular-level photoswitching into sequence-dependent macroscopic outputs in the solid state remains a formidable challenge. In this study, we report a supramolecular strategy that integrates guanyl hydrazone switches into hydrogen-bonded organic frameworks (HOFs) to ","au":["Weixu Feng","Dong Han","Jiamiao Yu","Zihang Tang","Yan Zhao","Wei Tian"],"o":"日常","zt":"氨气门控脲基腙光异构化实现氢键有机框架中的顺序固态光学响应","zb":"研究将脲基腙光开关引入氢键有机框架，利用酸碱刺激触发固态光异构化，诱导 TPE4- 堆积重排，从而实现对荧光和宏观显色的顺序可编程调控。","ob":"光驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.3389/fceng.2026.1966277","t":"Multiscale modeling and industrial validation of the water-gas shift reactor in an ammonia unit using COMSOL multiphysics","u":"https://doi.org/10.3389/fceng.2026.1966277","s":"Frontiers in Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"The high temperature water-gas shift (HT-WGS) reaction is a central conversion step in ammonia production since it boosts the hydrogen yield and reduces the carbon monoxide content in the synthesis gas mixture before subsequent purification and ammonia synthesis. The industrial reactor was analyzed numerically with COMSOL Multiphysics 6.2. A three-dimensional model was created by combining momentum transport, heat transfer, multicomponent species transport, heterogeneous reaction kinetics, and intraparticle diffusion in porous Fe-Cr catalyst pellets under realistic adiabatic plant operating conditions. The novelty of the approach lies in combining industrial plant validation with simultaneous representation of reactor scale transport and pellet -scale diffusion-reaction processes. The model predictions were compared with the measured axial temperature profile and outlet gas composition o","au":["Suha Mahdi Salih","Dalia. S. Makki","Ali A. Abdulabbas","Hala Naseer Abdelkareem","Mahmod Abdulkarem Abdulqader"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"多尺度建模与工业验证：用于氨厂水煤气变换反应器的 COMSOL Multiphysics","zb":"研究对象为氨厂中的高温水煤气变换 (HT-WGS) 反应器，关键方法是使用 COMSOL Multiphysics 6.2 建立三维模型，结合动量传递、热传递、多组分物种传递、非均相反应动力学和多孔 Fe-Cr 催化剂颗粒内的扩散，在现实绝热工厂操作条件下进行数值分析。模型将工业装置验证与反应器尺度传递和颗粒尺度扩散-反应过程的同步表示相结合。模型预测与工业装置测量的轴向温度分布和出口气体组成进行了比较，温度的 MAE 为 3.50 K，R² 为 0.950，出口含量的 MAPE 为 5.30%。验证后的模型用于检查速度、温度、压力、气体组成、气-颗粒浓度和颗粒内浓度分布。参数分析评估了入口温度和蒸汽对 CO 比率对 CO 转化的影响。催化剂床的压力分布呈现近似线性下降，从 30 降至 28.35 bar。CO 和 H₂O 的摩尔分数沿反应床下降，而 CO₂ 和 H₂ 上升。提高入口温度将","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.71791","t":"Light‐Induced Ce–Ov–Ni Motifs Enable Hydrogen‐Poisoning‐Resistant Photothermal NH3 Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71791","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Light irradiation dynamically generates oxygen vacancies at Ni/CeO 2 interfaces, forming Ce–Ov–Ni motifs that promote NH 3 adsorption and N–H activation while directing hydrogen intermediates to Ni sites. Vacancy-induced electronic modulation weakens H 2 adsorption, accelerates hydrogen release, mitigates hydrogen poisoning, and enables efficient low-temperature photothermal NH 3 -to-H 2 conversion. ABSTRACT NH 3 is an attractive hydrogen carrier, but efficient H 2 release is hindered by N–H bond cleavage and hydrogen poisoning. Herein, we develop Ni nanoparticle-supported CeO 2 (Ni/CeO 2 ) for low-temperature photothermal NH 3 decomposition. Light irradiation is accompanied by the dynamic generation of oxygen vacancies on CeO 2 , which couple with adjacent Ni sites to form Ce–Ov–Ni motifs, indicating that illumination can regulate the catalyst surface state beyond its thermal contributi","au":["Yue Zhu","Jianping Sheng","Chenyu Du","Ye He","Chaowei Yuan","Yanjuan Sun"],"o":"日常","why":["NH3 Decomposition"],"zt":"光诱导 Ce–Ov–Ni 模式实现抗氢中毒光热 NH3 分解","zb":"研究开发了负载 Ni 纳米粒子的 CeO2 催化剂用于低温光热 NH3 分解。光照在 CeO2 表面动态生成氧空位，与相邻 Ni 位点形成 Ce–Ov–Ni 模式。实验和 DFT 计算表明，该界面促进了 NH3 吸附和 N–H 激活，同时通过电子调制减弱 H2 吸附。在 450°C 下，10 wt.% Ni/CeO2 的 NH3 转化率达 96.3%，且在 50 小时内保持 >95% 的转化率。","ob":"通用催化方法","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.3751410","t":"Ligand‐Directed Nitrate Incorporation Into Reconstructed Oxyhydroxides for Durable Seawater Electrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.3751410","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Nitro functional group was incorporated into NiFe-MOF ligands near metal sites, which undergo a simple and direct oxidation to NO 3 − and subsequently anchored on the reconstructed γ-NiFeOOH phase. The anchored NO 3 − not only forms a robust Cl − -repelling interface but also activates lattice oxygen to drive the efficient lattice-oxygen-mediated pathway for active and durable seawater electrolysis. ABSTRACT Chloride ions (Cl − )-induced corrosion severely limits the practical implementation of direct seawater electrolysis. Although oxyanion incorporation can mitigate Cl − poisoning, existing approaches offer limited control over oxyanion generation and retention during catalyst reconstruction. Herein, we report a MOF-based ligand-engineering strategy that enables defined oxyanion incorporation into reconstructed metal oxyhydroxides for active and durable seawater electrolysis. Nitro- (N","au":["Huangcong Tang","Jieting Ding","Zemin Feng","Jiarui Ding","Shunchun Yao","Hao‐Fan Wang"],"o":"日常","zt":"配体定向硝酸盐掺入重建羟基氧化物用于耐海水电解","zb":"研究对象为 NiFe-MOF 配体工程策略，关键方法是引入硝基官能团到靠近金属位点的配体中，在电化学重建过程中直接氧化为 NO₃⁻ 并锚定在重建的 γ-NiFeOOH 相上。锚定的 NO₃⁻ 不仅形成坚固的 Cl⁻ 防护界面，还激活晶格氧，驱动高效的晶格氧介导的海水电解路径。设计的催化剂在碱性海水中实现了优异的析氧反应性能，在 500 mA cm −2 的电流密度下过电位仅为 230 mV，优于无 NO₃⁻ 对应物。它还表现出高耐久性，在 1.5 A cm −2 下运行超过 4000 小时，降解速率为 1.8 µV h −1。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.2196422","t":"Electron Bridge Enhanced Charge Polarization Enables Efficient and Ultra‐Long Stable Urea Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.2196422","s":"Angewandte Chemie","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"An electron bridge strategy is developed to regulate charge polarization in Pd 1 and Ni 1 dual single-atom sites, promoting CO 2 reduction, nitrate reduction, and C–N coupling simultaneously. The resulting catalyst achieves efficient urea electrosynthesis with high activity and record durability over 1700 h. ABSTRACT Urea electrosynthesis from carbon dioxide and nitrates powered by green electricity is a zero-carbon route for urea production. Simultaneously achieving high activity and long-term stability is a prerequisite for the industrialization of urea electrosynthesis. In this study, we propose an electron bridge strategy based on a Pd 1 and Ni 1 dual single-atom alloy to boost the electrocatalytic activity and durability for urea electrosynthesis. The single-atom Ni 1 sites act as electron bridges to promote charge transfer from Cu to Pd 1 sites, leading to charge-polarized Pd–Cu si","au":["Fan Wu","Haixia Wang","Wei Wang","Junrong Zou","Ruijie Zhou","Fenglin Xie"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"电子桥增强电荷极化实现高效和超长稳定尿素电合成","zb":"研究对象为 Pd₁ 和 Ni₁ 双单原子合金催化剂，关键方法是提出基于电子桥策略的电荷极化调节，促进 CO₂ 还原、硝酸盐还原和 C-N 耦合。该催化剂在 1700 小时内实现了高效的尿素电合成，具有高活性和记录耐久性，尿素产率速率为 541.6 mmol g cat −1 h −1，尿素法拉第效率为 57.3%。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.46427/gold2026.35918","t":"Legacy herbicides modulate nitrite partitioning and nitrogen retention during nitrate reduction in anoxic subsurface systems","u":"https://doi.org/10.46427/gold2026.35918","s":"Goldschmidt 2026 abstracts","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Bastien Redon","Mark Altabet","Mathilde Monperrus","Melanie Longchamp","Marie Morere","Mathieu Sebilo"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"遗留除草剂调节厌氧地下系统中硝酸盐还原期间亚硝酸盐分配和氮保留","bt":1},{"id":"10.46427/gold2026.35845","t":"Iron-mediated nitrite reduction as a major sink of reactive nitrogen across contrasting lakes","u":"https://doi.org/10.46427/gold2026.35845","s":"Goldschmidt 2026 abstracts","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Rosanna Margalef Marti","Mathieu Sebilo","Aubin Thibault de Chanvalon","Pierre Anschutz","David Amouroux"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrite reduction"],"zt":"铁介导的亚硝酸盐还原作为不同湖泊中活性氮的主要汇","bt":1},{"id":"10.2118/235870-ms","t":"Treatment of Petrochemical VOCs by In-Site Non-Catalytic Reduction of Nitrogen Oxides in Incineration Process","u":"https://doi.org/10.2118/235870-ms","s":"ADIPEC","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T02:28:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Volatile organic compounds (VOCs) are flammable and some of them are hazardous to human health. Apart from its toxic nature, VOCs can also take part into photochemical reactions and contribute to formation of ozone and fine particles, causing detrimental influences on atmospheric quality. Increase in VOCs emission from human activity has been recognized as primary causes of urban air pollution in China, and targeted control and constant removal of VOCs was proposed as key measures to mitigate atmosphere problems. Petrochemical facility was significant emission sources for VOCs and NOx and represents an possibility of co-treatment of these two pollutants. In this work, treatment of petrochemical VOCs by directing VOCs stream into facility heater or process furnace was proposed and confirmed. The oxidation of VOCs and its influence on NOx conversion was probed within an experiment","au":["D. D. Cao","M. Xue","X. C. Li","X. Y. Cui"],"o":"日常","why":["Reduction of Nitrogen"],"zt":"利用焚烧过程中原位非催化还原氮氧化物处理石化 VOCs","zb":"针对石化行业 VOCs 和 NOx 共同排放问题，提出将 VOCs 流股引入加热炉或工艺炉进行协同处理。实验模拟了丙烷和丙烯在 200–800 mg/m3 NO 浓度下的共转化过程，结果表明在 300°C 以上温度下 VOCs 可选择性还原 NO，且在 500°C 以下有利于 NO 还原，在 700°C 以上 VOCs 被完全消耗。"},{"id":"10.1149/1945-7111/aebcb9","t":"pH-Universal Electrocatalytic Nitrate-to-Ammonia Reduction on Ruthenium-Decorated Copper Foam","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/1945-7111/aebcb9","s":"Journal of The Electrochemical Society","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T03:55:12Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic reduction reaction of nitrate to ammonia (NO3RR) has emerged as a promising strategy that couples nitrate pollutant remediation with sustainable NH3 production. Practical nitrate-containing industrial wastewater usually presents a wide pH distribution range, which puts forward an urgent requirement for pH-adaptive NO₃RR catalysts with high ammonia selectivity. Conventional NO3RR catalysts fail to deliver high NH3 Faradaic efficiency under extreme acidic or alkaline conditions, mainly due to uncontrollable competitive adsorption of hydrogen intermediates on active sites. Herein, we report a ruthenium-decorated copper foam catalyst (RuCuF@PUS) fabricated via a facile two-step electrodeposition method, which achieves exceptional NO3RR performance across a wide pH window of 1-12. The interconnected porous framework enables efficient mass transfer, while the precisel","au":["Siqi Xing","Xu Wu"],"o":"日常","why":["NH3 production"],"zt":"铀修饰铜泡沫上 pH 通用电催化硝酸盐到氨还原","zb":"报道了一种通过两步电极沉积法制备的铀修饰铜泡沫催化剂 RuCuF@PUS，实现了 1-12 宽 pH 范围内的卓越 NO3RR 性能。该催化剂在酸性条件下于 −0.4 V vs RHE 下实现了 457.56 µmol/h·cm2 的氨产率率和 90.96% 的峰值法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta06451e","t":"Beyond the Haber-Bosch Process: Design of Efficient Electrocatalysts for Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta06451e","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T03:55:12Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"In spite of considerable work to produce ammonia using technologies beyond the energyintensive and costly Haber-Bosch process, finding efficient and earth-abundant catalysts for electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) remains a...","au":["Erakulan E. Siddharthan","Mehmet Emin Kilic","Puru Jena"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"超越哈伯-博施过程：高效电催化合成氨电催化剂的设计","zb":"尽管在利用超越哈伯-博施过程生产氨方面进行了大量工作，但寻找高效且地球丰富的电催化氮还原反应电催化剂仍然是一个挑战。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.6c16760","t":"Structural Reconstruction of Ternary CuCo2S4 for Boosting Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c16760","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (NO3RR) represents a promising strategy for sustainable ammonia synthesis while simultaneously addressing nitrate pollution in wastewater. However, the irreversible structural reconstruction commonly observed in catalysts during NO3RR obscures the true active sites and complicates mechanistic understanding. In this study, flower-like CuCo2S4 nanocrystals synthesized via a hot-injection method serve as a model ternary sulfide system to systematically probe reconstruction dynamics and identify active phases under operating conditions. Experimental characterizations reveal that CuCo2S4 gradually evolves into Cu-Co(OH)2/Co9S8 through electrochemical reconstruction. This reconstructed catalyst exhibits excellent NO3RR performance, achieving an average Faradaic efficiency of 97.3%, an ammonia production rate of 363.1 μmol h–1 mg–1, and rem","au":["Haixia Liu","Xing Chen","Yan Wang","Youzhi Yang","Lijun Hu","Yue Chen"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于促进电催化硝酸盐还原制氨的三元 CuCo2S4 结构重构","zb":"利用热注射法合成的花状 CuCo2S4 纳米晶作为模型三元硫化物体系，系统研究了电催化过程中的重构动力学。实验表征显示 CuCo2S4 逐渐重构为 Cu-Co(OH)2/Co9S8，该重构催化剂在 NO3RR 中表现出优异性能，平均法拉第效率达 97.3%，氨产率为 363.1 μmol h–1 mg–1。原位 FTIR 和 DFT 计算表明 Cu 掺杂促进了 *NO2 转化并加速后续氢化步骤，同时优化了 NO3– 吸附与 *NH3 解吸的平衡。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127729","t":"In-to-out compressive strain in 2D-on-3D NiOOH/NiCu optimizes H supply for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction and high-performance Zn-Nitrate batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127729","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environmental","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yushan Chen","Zhiwen Cheng","Zhujun Liu","Chenyu Bao","Shuxun Chen","Feihuang Zheng"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"2D-on-3D NiOOH/NiCu中的内向压缩应变优化电催化硝酸盐还原和高性能Zn-硝酸盐电池的H供应","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/elt2.70075","t":"Synergistic CNT‐Integrated Ni‐Phthalocyanine/g‐C 3 N 4 Heterojunctional Photocatalysts With Single Ni–N 4 (II) Sites for Efficient Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/elt2.70075","s":"Electron","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT The photochemical reduction of nitrogen offers an environmentally friendly approach for ammonia synthesis, providing an alternative to the energy‐intensive and emission‐heavy Haber–Bosch process. Despite its promise, the process is impeded by slow nitrogen activation and excessive hydrogen evolution. To overcome these limitations, we present a tandem nickel phthalocyanine (NiPc)/CNT‐P&Cu‐BCN photocatalyst, engineered with an organic–organic heterojunction for enhanced nitrogen conversion. This system integrates boron‐doped (B), nitrogen‐deficient (N) carbon nitride (CN), modified via Cu–Cu coordination and phosphorus doping through sodium borohydride‐assisted thermal treatment, with hydrogen‐bonded, ultrathin NiPc nanosheets. This novel design yields a record ammonia production rate of 915.4 μmol g −1 h −1 under visible light, a remarkable 16‐fold increase compared to traditiona","au":["Imran Khan","Khaled Alsaikhan","Habib Khemira","Atef El Jery","Anam Iqbal","Kanwal Iqbal"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"协同 CNT 集成的 Ni-酞菁/g-C₃N₄ 异质结光催化剂与单 Ni-N₄(II) 位点用于高效氨合成","zb":"研究对象为串联镍酞菁 (NiPc)/CNT-P&Cu-BCN 光催化剂，关键方法是设计有机-有机异质结以增强氮转化。该系统集成了硼掺杂 (B)、氮缺位 (N) 的碳氮 (CN)，通过 Cu-Cu 配位和磷掺杂（通过硼氢化钠辅助热处理）改性，与氢键结合的、超薄的 NiPc 纳米片。该新型设计在可见光下实现了 915.4 μmol g −1 h −1 的记录氨产率，比传统 BCN 材料提高了 16 倍。改进归因于精确的带隙工程；硼掺杂和氮空位调整电子结构，而 Cu、P 和 CNT 的协同效应增强电荷转移动力学。超薄 NiPc 框架引入了原子分散的活性位点，而 Z 方案驱动的电荷分离机制促进了高效的电子移动。这项工作通过集成缺陷工程、异质结设计和单原子催化，为光催化氮固定的发展提供了新见解，为可持续氨生产提供了一种可扩展的途径。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/adsc.70858","t":"CoTCPP‐Modified Bi 19 S 27 Br 3 for Efficient Photocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adsc.70858","s":"Advanced Synthesis & Catalysis","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Photocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia holds dual significance for nitrogen‐containing wastewater remediation and green ammonia synthesis. However, single‐component semiconductor photocatalysts are generally hampered by severe photogenerated charge recombination, insufficient spectral response, and poor substrate activation. Herein, cobalt porphyrin (CoTCPP) was in situ anchored onto the surface of Bi 19 S 27 Br 3 nanorods via a solvothermal method to construct CoTCPP/Bi 19 S 27 Br 3 photocatalysts featuring strong interfacial coupling. X‐ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS) analysis reveals a distinct interfacial electronic coupling between CoTCPP and Bi 19 S 27 Br 3 . This strong interfacial coupling synergistically enhances photocatalytic performance by facilitating rapid capture and efficient interfacial transfer of photogenerated electrons to effectively suppress charge carrier","au":["Yanting Liu","Zhiwei Shao","Shaofa Ma","Jun Xiong","Wei Jiang","Jun Di"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"CoTCPP 修饰的 Bi₁₉S₂₇Br₃ 用于高效光催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为 CoTCPP/Bi₁₉S₂₇Br₃ 光催化剂，关键方法是使用溶剂热法将钴卟啉 (CoTCPP) 原位锚定在 Bi₁₉S₂₇Br₃ 纳米棒表面，构建具有强界面耦合的光催化剂。XPS 分析揭示了 CoTCPP 和 Bi₁₉S₂₇Br₃ 之间的独特界面电子耦合。这种强界面耦合通过促进光生电子的快速捕获和高效界面转移协同增强光催化性能，有效抑制电荷载体复合，显著拓宽近红外 (NIR) 光响应范围，并增强催化剂表面的 NO₃⁻ 静电吸附，加速 NH₃ 的选择性生成。优化的 1.5CoTCPP/Bi₁₉S₂₇Br₃ 实现了 1230.81 μmol·g −1 ·h −1 的 NH₃ 产率，约为原始 Bi₁₉S₂₇Br₃ 的 5 倍。原位傅里叶变换红外光谱证实了 NO₃⁻ → *NO₃ → *NO₂ → *NO → *NHOH → *NH₂OH → NH₃ 的逐步去氧-加氢还原路径。","ob":"光催化硝酸盐转化｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.46427/gold2026.36360","t":"Hydrogen Looping During Electrolysis of Wastewater Filtrate for Ammonia Recovery","u":"https://doi.org/10.46427/gold2026.36360","s":"Goldschmidt 2026 abstracts","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Victoria Mills","Nora Conzemius"],"o":"日常","zt":"废水滤液电解制氨过程中的氢循环","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.2118/235635-ms","t":"From Concept to Bankability: Scalable Floating Green Ammonia FPSO Development with Integrated Safety Design","u":"https://doi.org/10.2118/235635-ms","s":"ADIPEC","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T02:28:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Green ammonia projects face increasing challenges in progressing from conceptual development toward bankable execution, requiring coordinated development across technology, infrastructure, safety assurance, and commercial pathways. This paper presents the outcome of an ongoing front-end development program for a compact floating green ammonia FPSO-type facility. It discusses how mature technologies can be selected for floating applications, modularized, marinized, and integrated with safety-led design to support a scalable and bankable infrastructure model. The development incorporates contributions from the project developer, the design and fabrication contractor, and an independent classification and technical assurance partner. Market-driven design considerations include renewable power availability, geographical location, export route, and potential offtake markets. The tech","au":["Sookkwan Tang","Iain Macleod","Li Ma","Conn Fagan","Sebastien Cochet"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"从概念到可执行性：集成安全设计的可扩展浮动绿氨 FPSO 开发","zb":"针对绿氨项目从概念开发走向可执行面临的挑战，本文介绍了紧凑型浮动绿氨 FPSO 型设施的端前开发成果。该设施集成了约 500 MW 可再生电力、高压配电、制氢、制氮、氨合成、制冷储存及海上卸载接口，并通过 HAZID、定量风险评估等安全研究，展示了如何将技术就绪度、商业就绪度和安全监管就绪度同步成熟化。"},{"id":"10.1080/00963402.2026.2745433","t":"Opinion: Why the annual Ig Nobel Prize ceremony is now in Europe","u":"https://doi.org/10.1080/00963402.2026.2745433","s":"Bulletin of the Atomic Scientists","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-10T18:41:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Science and scientists in the United States are under massive, sustained attack by a small number of high‑ranking government officials. To keep from being severely or even fatally damaged, some people and some entities have moved to other countries. One of the tiniest examples is the Ig Nobel Prize ceremony, which brings attention to research so surprising that it makes people laugh, then think. After 35 years in the United States, the organizers moved the 36th First Annual Ig Nobel Prize to Zurich, Switzerland. Ig Nobel founder Marc Abrahams explains the reasoning behind the move.","au":["Marc Abrahams"],"o":"日常","zt":"观点：为什么年度诺贝尔奖荒诞奖颁奖典礼现在在欧洲","zb":"鉴于美国科学界正面临来自政府高官的持续攻击，为了规避严重损害，Ig诺贝尔奖组织者将第36届颁奖典礼从美国迁至瑞士苏黎世，以继续关注那些既令人发笑又引人深思的研究。","ob":"通用催化方法"},{"id":"10.1021/acsestwater.6c01131","t":"Interpretable Machine Learning for Biochar Ammonium Nitrogen Adsorption: Decoupling Synthesis and Operational Drivers and Quantifying Optimal Design Rules","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsestwater.6c01131","s":"ACS ES&T Water","d":"2026-11-02","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Predicting the ammonium nitrogen (NH4+-N) adsorption capacity of biochar is challenged by coupled, nonlinear interactions among operational variables, pyrolysis synthesis parameters, and intrinsic material properties. A unified data set comprising 425 literature-reported adsorption records from 18 studies was compiled, and preprocessing (KNN imputation and Z-score standardization) was fitted exclusively on the training subset to prevent data leakage. Among seven machine learning algorithms benchmarked with Bayesian optimization and 5-fold cross-validation, XGBoost achieved the highest test-set coefficient of determination (R2) of 0.901 and root-mean-square error of 0.555 mg g–1. TreeSHAP analysis quantitatively decoupled three driver groups, adsorption operational parameters (53.3%), biochar physicochemical properties (38.2%), and pyrolysis synthesis parameters (8.5%), and ident","au":["Chunxian Huang","Meiwen Zhu","Ling Wu","Binghua Zhou","Zhipeng Wang","Zheng-Hong Huang"],"o":"日常","zt":"生物炭铵氮吸附的可解释机器学习：解耦合成与操作驱动因素及量化最优设计规则","zb":"针对生物炭铵氮吸附容量预测中变量间复杂的非线性耦合问题，构建了包含 425 条文献记录的统一数据集。通过贝叶斯优化和 5 折交叉验证，XGBoost 算法在测试集上取得了 R2 为 0.901 的最佳性能。TreeSHAP 分析定量解耦了吸附操作参数（53.3%）、生物炭理化性质（38.2%）和热解合成参数（8.5%）三个驱动组，确定了初始浓度、生物炭氧含量和吸附剂用量为主导变量。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.183893","t":"FJH-assisted construction of 3D graphene conductive networks for synergistically enhancing cycling stability and high-rate performance of lithium iron phosphate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.183893","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-11-01","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Xiaoyuan Sang","Shikai Liu","Eswaramoorthi Thirugnanasambandam","Huimin Jiang","Liyan Zhou","Ziping Jin"],"o":"日常","why":["FJH"],"zt":"闪蒸焦耳热辅助构建三维石墨烯导电网络以协同增强磷酸铁锂的循环稳定性和高倍率性能","bt":1},{"id":"10.3390/molecules31213938","t":"Turning NOx Pollutants into Green Ammonia Fuel via COF Cavity Confinement","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/molecules31213938","s":"Molecules","d":"2026-11-01","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"The development of sustainable fuels and hydrogen carriers is essential for a carbon-neutral energy future. Ammonia (NH3) is a promising energy vector, yet its synthesis remains dependent on the energy-intensive Haber–Bosch process, while nitrogen oxides (NOx) persist as major atmospheric pollutants. In this work, spin-polarized density functional theory (DFT) calculations at the MPWB1K/def2SVP level are used to investigate the capture and reduction of NO and NO2 within a rigid covalent organic framework (M1). Nucleus-Independent Chemical Shift (NICS) analysis reveals a strongly aromatic shielding character (NICS = −10.8) that provides a unique electronic environment, while electrostatic potential (ESP) mapping illustrates local electron density. Confinement within the framework suppresses competing pathways that preferentially favor the pathway toward NH3 and H2O. Activation barriers ar","au":["Marlene Bosquez","Roberto Salcedo"],"o":"日常","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"通过 COF 空腔限制将 NOx 污染物转化为绿色氨燃料","zb":"研究利用自旋极化密度泛函理论计算，探究了刚性共价有机框架 M1 对 NO 和 NO2 的捕获与还原，发现空腔限制显著降低了活化能，促进了 N-O 键断裂生成 NH3。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.mcat.2026.116400","t":"DFT screening of MN4-doped C54 fullerenes as single-atom catalysts for electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mcat.2026.116400","s":"Molecular Catalysis","d":"2026-11-01","f":"2026-11-01T02:11:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Chenkun Li","Tongmeng Xing","Qiuyan Xiang","Junkai Xu","A.J.C. Varandas","Jing Li"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"MN4 掺杂 C54 富勒烯作为电催化氮还原反应单原子催化剂的 DFT 筛选","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/chem.71875","t":"Synergistic Effect of RuNi Bimetallic Nanoparticles Immobilized on Ceria as Catalysts for Ammonia Borane Hydrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/chem.71875","s":"Chemistry – A European Journal","d":"2026-11-01","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT The production of hydrogen from chemical hydrides has garnered significant interest as a sustainable method for producing clean energy. The hydrolysis of ammonia borane (NH 3 BH 3 , AB) under mild reaction conditions was assessed in this work using a highly active Ru–Ni alloy catalyst supported on CeO 2 . As‐synthesized Ru–Ni/CeO 2 with different metal contents was used as a heterogeneous catalyst for the mild hydrolytic dehydrogenation of AB. At 298 K, the optimal catalyst is Ru 0.5 Ni 1.25 /CeO 2 , which demonstrated exceptional catalytic activity with a TOF value of 1226.0 mol H2 min − 1 . The calculated apparent activation energy was 37.5 kJ mol −1 , which is even lower than that of the majority of noble‐metal‐based catalysts for AB dehydrogenation. Strong electronic interactions and synergistic effects between Ru and Ni led to the formation of a bimetallic alloy structure w","au":["Abbas Al‐nayili","Ahmed Nasser Taaima"],"o":"日常","zt":"负载于氧化铈上用于氨硼烷水解协同效应的 RuNi 双金属纳米颗粒催化剂","zb":"利用负载于 CeO2 上的 Ru–Ni 合金催化剂评估了氨硼烷在温和条件下的水解产氢性能。最优催化剂 Ru0.5Ni1.25/CeO2 在 298 K 下表现出卓越活性，TOF 值为 1226.0 mol H2 min–1，表观活化能为 37.5 kJ mol–1。Ru 与 Ni 之间的强电子相互作用和协同效应增强了催化活性，CeO2 的强金属-载体相互作用和高氧存储容量提高了纳米颗粒的分散性和稳定性。","ob":"氨硼烷水解；涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ces.2026.125572","t":"Hybrid ammonia synthesis mechanism on CeRuSi intermetallic originating from Ce-Ru-Si electronic synergy","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ces.2026.125572","s":"Chemical Engineering Science","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-07T16:50:48Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":36,"ab":"","au":["Hongping Yan","Yuying Cheng","Yaoqi Xie","Yifei Nie","Yuanjin Li","Shijing Liang"],"o":"日常","w":["Lilong Jiang"],"why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于 Ce-Ru-Si 电子协同作用的 CeRuSi 金属间化合物上氨合成的混合机理","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2026.141004","t":"Surrogate-assisted optimization of gasifier syngas purification and ammonia production from co-gasified waste","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2026.141004","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-24T06:57:23Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Efficient purification of gasifier-derived syngas is essential for converting it into synthesis products such as ammonia. This study develops an integrated simulation–surrogate optimization framework for ammonia production from co-gasified paper mill sludge (PMS) and municipal solid waste (MSW), emphasizing acid-gas removal, hydrogen recovery, and final ammonia purification. We simulated three PMS blends (20/80, 40/60, and 60/40; 100,000 kg/h total feed) in Aspen Plus using steam gasification, two-stage acid-gas separation, pressure-swing adsorption for H₂ recovery, a three-stage adiabatic ammonia synthesis loop, and flash/distillation purification. We screened gasifier temperature (600–900 °C) and steam flow rate (1000–90,000 kg/h) then trained Random Forest, XGBoost, and Gaussian Process Regression surrogates for NH₃ recovery and net energy demand the optimal region identified (611.4–6","au":["Areebah Siddiqui","Bilal Kazmi","Muhammad Shahid","Syed Ali Ammar Taqvi","Salman Raza Naqvi"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"共气化废料制合成气净化与氨生产的代理辅助优化","zb":"本研究利用 Aspen Plus 模拟纸厂污泥与城市固体废物共气化过程，结合随机森林、XGBoost 和高斯过程回归代理模型，优化了酸气去除、氢气回收及氨合成循环。结果表明，在 60/40 混合比例下，氨回收率达到 80.75–80.92%，净能耗为 14.89–15.68 MW，显著优于 20/80 混合比例。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jes.2026.105893","t":"Role of single-atom catalysts and tailored defects in relation to novel approaches to ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jes.2026.105893","s":"Journal of Environmental Sciences","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-13T18:31:35Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"An essential industrial feedstock and possible source of carbon-free energy is ammonia (NH 3 ). The electro catalytic reduction of nitrate (eNO 3 RR) has garnered consequential attention as a green imperishable method for concurrent wastewater treatment and NH 3 generation due to the growing issue of pollution by nitrate and the problems of environment related to the Haber-Bosch process. Improving thermoelectric materials’ performance is still essential for real-world uses. Single-atom catalysts (SACs) have shown remarkable catalytic efficacy and selectivity in eNO 3 RR due to their highly flexible electronic structural design, distinct active regions, and maximum atom utilization efficiency. With a focus on reaction processes, the behavior of catalyst, and the relationship between structure and activity of various non-noble metal centers (such as Cu, Co, and Fe), this paper systematical","au":["Meznah M. Alanazi","Rabia Nawaz","Ali Bahadur","Adeeb Shehzad","Shahid Iqbal","Sajid Mahmood"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"单原子催化剂和定制缺陷在新型氨合成方法中的关系","zb":"氨（NH3）是一种重要的工业原料和可能的碳自由能源来源。电催化硝酸盐（eNO3RR）作为一种绿色持久的方法，因其能同时处理废水并生成NH3而受到关注。单原子催化剂（SACs）因其高度灵活的电子结构设计、独特的活性区域和最大原子利用效率，在eNO3RR中表现出显著的催化活性和选择性。本文系统地涵盖了SACs在eNO3RR中的最新进展，并全面概述了缺陷工程在e-NO3RR电催化剂中的当前进展，强调了不同缺陷类如何改变表面化学、重组电子结构并引导反应路径以实现更高的活性和选择性。最后，本文概述了材料设计、形态改变校正、动态活性位点识别、SACs的工业应用和工作条件下的稳定性等当前挑战，并提出了未来研究途径以建立可持续的NH3经济并实现eNO3RR技术的实际应用。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.184096","t":"Promoting metallic Ru active site over carbon-doped MgO for efficient ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.184096","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-12T03:47:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Gyeongmin Ko","Junemin Bae","Kyungho Lee","Jae Hyung Kim","Sun Hyung Kim","Rayoon Woo"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"在碳掺杂的 MgO 上促进金属 Ru 活性位点用于高效的氨合成","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.surfcoat.2026.134133","t":"Baffle-induced deagglomeration enables uniform nanoparticle coating in rotary atomic layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.surfcoat.2026.134133","s":"Surface and Coatings Technology","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Junren Xiang","Mingxuan Wang","Xiao Liu","Wenqing Wang","Jiahao Chen","Bin Shan"],"o":"日常","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"挡板诱导的解团聚实现旋转原子层沉积中的均匀纳米颗粒涂层","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.matre.2026.100477","t":"Rapid Joule heating enables fluorine-doped Cu electrocatalysts with enhanced C–C coupling for CO2 electroreduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matre.2026.100477","s":"Materials Reports: Energy","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-20T19:07:01Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Electrochemical CO 2 reduction (ECO 2 R) holds immense potential for sustainable carbon conversion, yet the expedient synthesis of high-performance electrocatalysts remains a formidable challenge. Here, we report a rapid Joule-heating approach to convert Cu(OH) 2 precursors into highly efficient Cu-based electrocatalysts for ECO 2 R, achieving superior catalyst preparation efficiency and catalytic performance compared with conventional tube-furnace annealing. Optimization of the F/Cu molar ratio (10:1) affords a Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 61.7% toward C 2 products. In-situ spectroscopic and mechanistic analyses reveal that F incorporation increases surface *OH coverage and stabilizes *CHO/*CO intermediates, promoting efficient C–C coupling. This work utilizes Joule heating as a potentially scalable platform for designing Cu-based electrocatalysts with enhanced activity and stability tow","au":["Qiankang Zhang","Ying Zhang","Siyu Yi","Rongyuan Wang","Yuan Zhang","Zhao Mo"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"快速焦耳加热实现氟掺杂铜电催化剂用于CO2电还原增强C–C偶联","zb":"本研究利用快速焦耳加热将 Cu(OH)2 前驱体转化为高效铜基电催化剂，相比传统管式炉退火具有更高的制备效率。优化氟铜摩尔比（10:1）后，C2 产物的法拉第效率达到 61.7%。原位光谱和机理分析表明，氟掺杂增加了表面 *OH 覆盖率并稳定了 *CHO/*CO 中间体，促进了高效的 C-C 偶联。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.matlet.2026.142023","t":"Flash Joule heating-induced oxygen-deficient TiO2 for high-rate lithium storage","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matlet.2026.142023","s":"Materials Letters","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:00:02Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The low electronic conductivity of TiO2 limits its rate capability as a lithium-ion battery anode. Conductive TiO2 was prepared from commercial anatase powder by carbon-cloth-assisted flash Joule heating (FJH). Conductivity increased with treatment temperature and pulse number, reaching 24.32 S cm−1 after 100 pulses at 1500 °C. The resulting material was predominantly rutile. X-ray photoelectron and electron paramagnetic resonance spectra supported oxygen vacancy formation and partial Ti reduction, which may contribute to the increased conductivity. The apparent optical bandgap decreased from 3.30 to 2.02 eV. In lithium half-cells, the treated material delivered approximately 62 mAh g−1 at 20 C and maintained approximately 80 mAh g−1 after 400 cycles at 10 C.","au":["Chaoyun Zhu"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"闪焦加热诱导制备氧空位 TiO2 用于高倍率锂存储","zb":"利用碳布辅助闪焦加热处理商用金红石粉制备导电 TiO2，经 1500 °C、100 脉冲处理后电导率达 24.32 S cm−1，带隙降至 2.02 eV。该材料在 20 C 下提供约 62 mAh g−1 容量，400 次循环后仍保持约 80 mAh g−1。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.matlet.2026.142005","t":"Strong, conductive graphene/polyurethane films with Fe3O4-decorated nanotubes for Joule heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matlet.2026.142005","s":"Materials Letters","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-17T05:03:41Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Huiming Ning","Zhiwei Tan","Rui Zou","Feng Liu","Ning Hu"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"具有用于焦耳加热的 Fe3O4 装饰纳米管的强导电石墨烯/聚氨酯薄膜","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.matlet.2026.141936","t":"Rapid synthesis of B/N co-doped porous carbon from corn stover via flash joule heating for zinc ion hybrid capacitors","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matlet.2026.141936","s":"Materials Letters","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Zichun Wang","Baojun Tong","Lijie Wang","Zixuan Li","Xiaopeng Liu","Feng Wei"],"o":"日常","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"利用闪蒸焦耳热从玉米秸秆快速合成 B/N 共掺杂多孔碳用于锌离子混合电容器","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.matdes.2026.117561","t":"Polymer-fueled flash annealing of ceramic powders and green bodies","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matdes.2026.117561","s":"Materials & Design","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-24T21:13:24Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"An important aspect of advanced sintering processes is to enable the creation of complex, hierarchically structured solids. Polymer-fueled Flash Annealing (PFA) exploits the heat of locally confined explosion reactions at the interface between polymers and metal oxide (nano)particles or particle-based green bodies. For the explosive combustion of polyvinyl alcohol (PVA)-based formulations the ignition temperatures depend on the nature of the metal oxide and range between T = 230 °C (MgO) to T = 410 °C (ZnO). The instantaneous heat release at the interface of the polymer coated green bodies leads to estimated local temperatures in the range of the metal oxides’ melting points (e.g. MgO, T m = 2800 °C). In addition to efficient debinding, PFA enables the spatially organized fusion and sintering of the grains in the green bodies’ surface region that previously has been in contact with the p","au":["Hasan Razouq","Kerstin Neuhauser","Thomas Berger","Oliver Diwald"],"o":"日常","why":["flash annealing"],"zb":"利用聚合物燃料闪蒸退火（PFA）技术，通过聚合物与金属氧化物纳米颗粒界面处的局部受限爆炸反应释放热量，实现了陶瓷粉末和生坯的烧结。该过程在聚合物涂层生坯界面产生瞬时热释放，局部温度可达金属氧化物熔点（如 MgO 为 2800 °C），并实现了颗粒的融合与烧结。通过选择聚合物（如 PVA、PVP）和浓度，可控制界面处的温度突跃和梯度，从而制备出具有颗粒和孔隙尺寸分布梯度的多孔陶瓷结构。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jiec.2026.11.006","t":"Pulsed magnetic induction heating for catalyst regeneration in continuous Fixed-Bed Reactors: Extending operational stability in antibiotic removal","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jiec.2026.11.006","s":"Journal of Industrial and Engineering Chemistry","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Enhancing catalyst durability under continuous-flow operation remains a major limitation for the practical implementation of advanced oxidation processes (AOPs) in water treatment. In this work, pulsed magnetic induction heating (MIH) is proposed as a low-energy regeneration strategy for magnetically responsive fixed-bed reactors, enabling recovery of catalytic activity under continuous operation. A Fe 3 O 4 @PLA composite was employed as catalytic bed for persulfate activation and ofloxacin (OFX) degradation, showing high initial activity (up to 98 % removal at 40 °C) but undergoing progressive deactivation. A short MIH pulse enabled reactor regeneration, restoring degradation efficiencies up to 94 % and allowing sustained operation for up to 16 days, with stable OFX removal around 79 %. Post-use characterization revealed structural and compositional changes, including migration of Fe 3","au":["Sergio Fernández-Velayos","Alberto París-Rodrigo","Jorge Sánchez-Marcos","Eva Mazarío"],"o":"日常","why":["induction heating"],"zt":"脉冲磁感应加热用于连续固定床反应器中的催化剂再生：延长抗生素去除的操作稳定性","zb":"研究对象为用于过硫酸盐活化与氧氟沙星降解的 Fe3O4@PLA 复合材料催化剂床层，该催化剂初始活性高（40°C 下去除率高达 98%），但会逐渐失活。采用短脉冲磁感应加热（MIH）实现反应器再生，可恢复至 94% 的降解效率，并使连续运行时间延长至 16 天，稳定去除率维持在 79%。表征显示 Fe3O4 向表面迁移、PLA 结晶度增加及部分 Fe3O4 氧化等结构组成变化。结果表明热效应和传质现象有助于催化剂再活，但氧化过程限制了活性完全恢复。该系统在真实废水基质中也能部分再生，但基质效应显著。研究证明了脉冲 MIH 作为一种实用且节能的再生策略的可行性，可延长固定床催化系统在水处理中的使用寿命和稳定性。","ob":"其他催化反应"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2026.11.001","t":"Flash Joule heating-driven fabrication of NiCoFe medium-entropy alloys with Mn-tailored local coordination for efficient hydrogen production and biofuel upgrading","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2026.11.001","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-12T03:47:41Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Xin Lin","Shirui Wang","Zhukun Zhang","Dechao Wang","Xin Xiao","Tong Xiao"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"闪蒸焦耳热驱动的 NiCoFe 中熵合金的制备具有 Mn 尾部定制的局部配位用于高效的氢生产和生物燃料升级","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jaap.2026.108257","t":"Flash joule heating-assisted co-pyrolysis of biomass and plastic for graphitic carbon production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jaap.2026.108257","s":"Journal of Analytical and Applied Pyrolysis","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-13T18:31:35Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Kangyao Sun","Ziling Wang","Hao Wang","Xin Niu","Shuping Zhang"],"o":"日常","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"闪蒸焦耳热辅助的生物质和塑料共热解制备石墨碳","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jaap.2026.108241","t":"Carbon Evolution during Flash Joule Heating of Waste Tire Rubber: Methane Preservation versus Graphene Reconstruction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jaap.2026.108241","s":"Journal of Analytical and Applied Pyrolysis","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Mingfan Zhang","Tong Xu","Dikun Hong","Yao Zhang","Shuai Ning","Chunbo Wang"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"废轮胎橡胶闪蒸焦耳加热过程中的碳演化：甲烷保存与石墨烯重构","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ces.2026.125694","t":"Highly active and stable Ptδ+ sites on Pt/TiO2 catalysts for efficient methylcyclohexane dehydrogenation by in-situ Joule heating catalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ces.2026.125694","s":"Chemical Engineering Science","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-24T06:57:23Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Guoqing Cui","Wenhan Wang","Wenxiang Zhang","Yingjie Lou","Qian Song","Xuejie Wang"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"原位焦耳热催化高效甲基环己烷脱氢用Pt/TiO2催化剂上高活性且稳定的Ptδ+位点","ob":"其他催化反应","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.184212","t":"Atomic layer deposited SnxFe2-xO3 photoelectrodes: Box-Behnken design guided optimization for enhanced photoelectrocatalytic removal of sulfamethoxazole","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.184212","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-13T03:24:10Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Earth-abundant materials combined with scalable fabrication methods are essential for advancing photoelectrocatalytic (PEC) technologies for sustainable fuel production and water purification. In this study, we report a novel process for fabricating Sn x Fe 2-x O 3 photoelectrodes using atomic layer deposition (ALD), which enables angstrom-level thickness control and conformal coating of complex 3D substrates, making it a promising approach for advanced thin-film photoelectrode fabrication. Tin doping was achieved through a supercycle ALD approach. A Box-Behnken Design (BBD) based response surface methodology was employed to systematically optimize the synthesis parameters. The total number of ALD cycles (180–1260), fraction of SnO 2 cycles (1.1–10.0), and post-deposition annealing temperature (350–550 °C) were selected as independent variables, while photocurrent density (PCD) at 1.6 V ","au":["Anjan Deb","Miika Mattinen","Mykhailo Chundak","Paavo Porri","Kenichiro Mizohata","Mikko Ritala"],"o":"日常","why":["Atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积 SnxFe2-xO3 光电极：基于 Box-Behnken 设计优化的用于增强光电催化去除磺胺甲恶唑","zb":"地球丰产材料结合可扩展的制造方法对于推进可持续燃料生产和水净化所需的光电催化（PEC）技术至关重要。本研究报道了一种使用原子层沉积（ALD）制造Sn x Fe 2-x O 3 光电极的新工艺，该工艺可实现埃级厚度控制和复杂3D基底的 conformal 涂层，使其成为先进薄膜光电极制造的有前景的方法。通过超级循环ALD方法实现了锡掺杂。采用基于Box-Behnken设计（BBD）的响应面法系统地优化了合成参数。选定的独立变量为ALD循环总数（180–1260）、SnO 2 循环分数（1.1–10.0）和退火温度（350–550 °C），响应参数为1.6 V vs RHE时的光电流密度（PCD）和中性磷酸盐缓冲电解质中的光电流起始电位（PCOP）。结构、组成和形貌特性使用多种技术进行了表征。BBD指导的优化确定了910 ALD循环、1.43循环-%的SnO 2 和550 °C退火温度为所研究","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Fe/铁体系、原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.184066","t":"Flash joule heating for solid waste valorization and environmental remediation: From reactor design to sustainability","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.184066","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Zixuan Li","Chengze Yu","Mingxiao Li","Bing Deng","Beidou Xi","Jiaqi Hou"],"o":"日常","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"闪蒸焦耳热用于固体废物增值与环境修复：从反应器设计到可持续性","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.168968","t":"Investigating the function of S-vacancies in atomic layer deposited ZnS on TiO2 for water splitting via First Principle Methods","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.168968","s":"Applied Surface Science","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-16T02:42:55Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Syed Jazib Abbas Zaidi","Muhammad Abdul Basit","Mohsin Ali","Ijaz Ali","Jin Ho Bang","Tae Joo Park"],"o":"日常","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过第一原理方法研究原子层沉积的 ZnS 在 TiO2 上的 S-空位对水分解的功能","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.168949","t":"Low-temperature ethylamine-catalyzed atomic layer deposition of SiO2 films via periodic in-situ O3 treatment","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.168949","s":"Applied Surface Science","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-14T03:10:41Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Hyekyung Kim","Seo-Hyun Lee","Hweayoon Kim","Kijung Jung","Young Jae Park","Chul-Joon Heo"],"o":"日常","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"低温乙胺催化通过周期性原位 O3 处理的 SiO2 薄膜原子层沉积","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2026.10.085","t":"Towards high-energy-efficiency metal-mediated nitrogen reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2026.10.085","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xinqi Wang","Anxin Lin","Tingting Lian","Liang-Xin Ding","Gao-Feng Chen"],"o":"日常","zt":"迈向高能量效率的金属介导的氮还原","bt":1},{"id":"10.1177/09603271261512903","t":"Association between initial plasma ammonia concentration and endotracheal intubation in acute glufosinate poisoning","u":"https://doi.org/10.1177/09603271261512903","s":"Human & Experimental Toxicology","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-25T05:25:39Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Background Acute glufosinate poisoning can cause delayed neurologic deterioration and respiratory failure. We evaluated the associations of initial and peak plasma ammonia concentrations with endotracheal intubation and other clinical outcomes. Methods This single-center retrospective study included adults with acute oral glufosinate-containing herbicide poisoning treated between January 2015 and December 2025. Initial ammonia was measured at emergency department presentation, and peak ammonia was defined as the highest concentration observed within 48 h. Logistic regression, receiver operating characteristic analysis, and Spearman correlation were performed. Secondary seizure and mortality analyses were exploratory. Results Among 144 poisoning episodes, 64 (44.4%) involved endotracheal intubation. Initial ammonia was higher in episodes involving intubation than in episodes without intub","au":["Jin Hee Jeong","Ae Jin Sung"],"o":"日常","why":["plasma ammonia"],"zt":"急性草甘膦中毒患者初始血浆氨浓度与气管插管的关联","zb":"本研究回顾性分析了2015年至2025年间144例急性口服草甘膦中毒成人病例，评估初始及峰值血浆氨浓度与气管插管及其他临床结局的关联。结果显示，插管患者的初始氨浓度较高，但调整混杂因素后关联性减弱（调整后OR为1.06），且作为独立预测指标的增量判别价值有限。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.surfin.2026.111298","t":"Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia: An In-depth Investigation from Copper-based Material Modification to Mechanism Study","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.surfin.2026.111298","s":"Surfaces and Interfaces","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-13T18:31:35Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yaoqi Zhang","Bohan Kong","Rufeng Zhang","Huijun Lin","Jiayi Wang","Ming Xu"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"电催化硝酸盐还原为氨：从铜基材料改性到机理研究的深入探究","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.surfin.2026.111204","t":"First-Principles Mechanistic Insights into Dual-Metal Synergy for Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction on Graphene with Paired Monovacancies","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.surfin.2026.111204","s":"Surfaces and Interfaces","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Anand Mohan Verma","Nanda Kishore"],"o":"日常","why":["Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction"],"zt":"基于石墨烯的配对单空位双金属协同电化学氮还原的第一性原理机制洞察","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2026.141054","t":"In-situ reconstruction Cu2O/Cu active interface from CuO nanosheets for efficient electro-reduction of nitrate to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2026.141054","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-24T21:13:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Rui Wang","Zehua Wang","Weijia Li","Jiangtao Feng","Wei Yan"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"原位重构 Cu2O/Cu 活性界面用于高效电还原硝酸盐制氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jmst.2026.10.083","t":"Optimizing nitrogen-intermediate affinity and hydrogenation processes via a cobalt single-atom-enhanced Cu-Cu2O rectifying heterointerface for ammonia electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmst.2026.10.083","s":"Journal of Materials Science & Technology","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-13T18:31:35Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Laiji Xu","Zhenlin Mo","Wei Guo","Jiangzhou Qin","Baojun Liu"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia electrosynthesis"],"zt":"通过钴单原子增强的 Cu-Cu2O 矩阵异质界面优化氮中间体亲和力和加氢过程用于氨电合成","ob":"其他催化反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jhazmat.2026.144152","t":"Interlayer Single-Metal-Atom Coordinated Porous Boron Nitride: Triggering p-d-p Orbital Hybridization for Efficient Electrocatalytic Nitrate to Ammonia Reduction.","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jhazmat.2026.144152","s":"Journal of Hazardous Materials","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) represents a sustainable paradigm for simultaneous environmental remediation and green NH 3 production. While single-atom catalysts (SACs) exhibit immense promise for NO 3 RR, precisely manipulating their localized orbital interactions to decode the underlying structure-activity relationships remains a critical challenge. Herein, using density functional theory (DFT) calculations, we designed a series of interlayer single-metal-atom coordinated porous boron nitride (IC-M/p-BN) acting as efficient electrocatalysts for NO 3 RR. Interlayer metal confinement triggers robust interfacial p-d-p orbital hybridization, establishing an efficient electron relay that empowers surface-exposed non-metallic B sites to act as direct catalytic centers while effectively suppressing the competing HER, NRR and toxic NO/NO 2 byproducts. Crucially, this in","au":["Yaqi Yang","Shiyu Chen","Jiameng Gong","Lanlan Li","Chengfeng Li","Qiaoling Li"],"o":"日常","why":["NRR"],"zt":"层间单金属原子配位多孔氮化硼：触发 p-d-p 轨道杂化以实现高效的电催化硝酸盐到氨还原","zb":"研究对象为电催化硝酸还原反应 (NO3 RR)，关键方法为使用密度泛函理论 (DFT) 计算，设计了层间单金属原子配位多孔氮化硼 (IC-M/p-BN) 作为高效的 NO3 RR 电催化剂，主要结果为 IC-Co/p-BN 和 IC-Ni/p-BN 实现 -0.51 和 -0.50 V vs. RHE 的 NO3 RR 活性，显著优于传统的 h-BN 对应物。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jhazmat.2026.144099","t":"Engineering the electronic structure of LaCoO3 nanofibers via Cu doping for efficient electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jhazmat.2026.144099","s":"Journal of Hazardous Materials","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-03T03:55:12Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) to ammonia is a promising alternative to the Haber-Bosch process, but suffers from slow kinetics, complex mechanism, and competing reactions. In this work, B-site Cu-doped LaCoO 3 (ABO 3 -type) perovskite nanofibers (NFs) are successfully fabricated through a high-voltage electrospinning-calcination technique for NO 3 RR. The optimized 5% Cu-LaCoO 3 NFs catalyst exhibits an outstanding Faradaic efficiency (FE) amounting to 98.7 ± 0.5% under -0.483 V vs. RHE. An NH 3 generation rate of 27.6 ± 0.6 mg cm⁻ 2 h⁻ 1 is recorded at -0.683 V vs. RHE, significantly exceeding that of pristine LaCoO 3 NFs. Moreover, when employed as the cathode in an assembled aqueous cell, the catalyst delivers a peak power density of 5.58 mW cm⁻ 2 and shows reasonable long-term charge-discharge stability. Through physicochemical analyses and density functional ","au":["Bingyan Shi","Mingze Xia","Siqi Zhang","Cheng Fan","Shengji Tian","Chade Lv"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过 Cu 掺杂工程化 LaCoO3 纳米纤维的电子结构以实现高效电催化合成氨","zb":"研究利用高压静电纺丝-煅烧技术制备了B位Cu掺杂的LaCoO3钙钛矿纳米纤维用于硝酸盐还原。优化后的5% Cu-LaCoO3催化剂在-0.483 V下表现出98.7%的法拉第效率，在-0.683 V下氨生成速率达27.6 mg cm⁻² h⁻¹。DFT计算表明Cu掺杂增强了Cu 3d与O 2p轨道混合，降低了NO3 RR的活化能垒。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jes.2026.105892","t":"The selectivity trap in electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia: Why high NH3 selectivity comes at the cost of low current density and strategies to escape","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jes.2026.105892","s":"Journal of Environmental Sciences","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-15T02:37:18Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical reduction of nitrate to ammonia (eNITRR) presents a potential solution to two of the most persistent environmental and chemical engineering problems of recent age: the remediation of nitrate-rich water and the generation of ammonia in a sustainable and eco-friendly manner. Despite the seeming potential of this technology to provide a dual solution to these problems, the selectivity of the process has been largely ignored in the scientific literature. Through a review of the scientific literature on the topic of eNITRR, we present the first analysis of this “selectivity trap” phenomenon. Across all known catalyst systems, no system has yet been able to achieve both higher ammonia selectivities (±90 %) and current densities (±2 × 10 2 mA/cm). The six mechanistic origins of the trap are identified as being HER acceleration, mass transport limitations, finite active site ","au":["Anum Bilal","Ali Bahadur","Sajid Mahmood","Adeeb Shehzad","A. Althbiti","Norah Alsairy"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"电化学硝酸盐还原制氨的选择性陷阱：高 NH3 选择性为何伴随低电流密度以及逃离策略","zb":"该研究分析了电化学硝酸盐还原制氨过程中的“选择性陷阱”现象，指出目前尚无系统能同时实现高氨选择性（±90%）和高电流密度（±2 × 10^2 mA/cm²）。文章提出了六种陷阱机理及四种逃逸策略，并建立了基准框架。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2026.10.062","t":"Proton Management for Lithium-Mediated Nitrogen Reduction Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2026.10.062","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-14T03:10:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Bin Yang","Junjie Zhu","Lei Shi","Zhenyou Li","Jiawei Zhu"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrogen Reduction Reaction"],"zt":"锂介导的氮还原反应中的质子管理","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2026.10.046","t":"Modulating d-d orbital hybridization in Fe-Co dual-atom catalysts reconfigures nitrogen reduction pathways for efficient ammonia electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2026.10.046","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Qirui Li","Yongfang Zhang","Cong Han","Pan Chen","Xiaokun Yang","Ying Wang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia electrosynthesis"],"zt":"调节Fe-Co双原子催化剂的d-d轨道杂化重新配置氮还原路径以实现高效的氨电合成","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.142059","t":"Cobalt-doped nickel hydroxides enabling energy-efficient ammonia electrosynthesis via sulfion oxidation reaction coupling and zinc-nitrite battery","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.142059","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-24T21:13:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Donglin Zhao","Yuan Zhang","Xue Bai","Song Wu","Yun Zhang","Guangyin Fan"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia electrosynthesis"],"zt":"钴掺杂氢氧化镍通过硫化物氧化反应耦合锌-亚硝酸盐电池实现节能氨电合成","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.142051","t":"Ru-accelerated kinetics of heterogeneous catalyst for energy-efficient ammonia electrosynthesis coupled with ethanol oxidation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.142051","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-21T17:58:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Gaoming Jin","Xu Peng","Yun Tong"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia electrosynthesis"],"zt":"Ru加速耦合乙醇氧化制氨的异相催化剂的动力学","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141936","t":"Synergy-driven electronic modulation in copper-nickel-cobalt-zinc quaternary alloy for enhanced electrocatalytic nitrate-to-ammonia production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141936","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-16T02:42:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 - RR) offers a promising route to sustainable ammonia synthesis, but is limited by sluggish reaction kinetics and competing side reactions. Here, a Copper-Nickel-Cobalt-Zinc (CuNiCoZn) quaternary alloy catalyst was fabricated by electrodeposition from a deep eutectic solvent, and the synergistic catalytic mechanism of the multicomponent alloy was systematically investigated in NO 3 - RR. Starting from the CuNi alloy, Co and Zn were introduced to modulate the electronic structure, thereby enabling CuNiCoZn to exhibit high NO 3 - RR performance: at a potential of -0.18 V (vs. RHE), the NH 3 yield rate reached 1.38 mmol h -1 cm -2 with a Faradaic efficiency of 93.12%. Experimental results and theoretical calculations jointly reveal that Co incorporation modulates H* adsorption, facilitating selective hydrogen transfer while suppressing exces","au":["Zihan Meng","Liping Sun","Yingnan Dou","Tianxi Qiu","Lihua Huo","Hui Zhao"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"四元合金铜-镍-钴-锌中的协同驱动电子调制用于增强电催化硝酸盐至氨的生产","zb":"电催化硝酸盐还原反应（NO3- RR）为可持续氨合成提供了一条有前景的路线，但受限于缓慢的反应动力学和竞争的副反应。本文通过从深度共熔溶剂电沉积制备了铜-镍-钴-锌（CuNiCoZn）四元合金催化剂，并系统地研究了多组分合金在NO3- RR中的协同催化机制。从CuNi合金开始，引入Co和Zn来调节电子结构，从而使CuNiCoZn表现出高NO3- RR性能：在-0.18 V（vs. RHE）的电位下，NH3产率达到了1.38 mmol h -1 cm -2，法拉第效率为93.12%。实验结果和理论计算共同揭示，Co的引入调节了H*吸附，促进了选择性氢转移，同时抑制了过度的H 2 evolution，从而提高了NH3的法拉第效率，而Zn的引入降低了决定步骤的势能上升自由能变化，并促进了NO 2 -相关中间体的氢化向NH3，这两种元素协同优化了NO3- RR路径。此外，稳定性测试表明具有良好的结","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141916","t":"Morphology and Electronic Structure Modulation of Cu-Doped Co₃O₄/rGO Nanosheets for Efficient Electrocatalytic Nitrate-to-Ammonia Upcycling and Onsite Chalcone Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141916","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (NO₃RR) offers a promising route for ammonia synthesis, but is hindered by slow kinetics and competitive hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Herein, ultrathin Cu‐doped Co₃O₄/reduced graphene oxide (Cu‐Co₃O₄/rGO) nanosheets are prepared through the morphology and electronic structure modulation for efficient NO₃RR performance. Combined experiments and DFT computations disclose that Cu doping induces 2D nanosheet morphology, up-modulates the d‐band center to optimize the adsorption strengthen of reactants and key intermediates, and constructs Cu‐Co tandem sites for cascade catalysis, while rGO improves the composite conductivity. The optimized catalyst exhibits a Faradaic efficiency of 98.5% at -0.7 V vs. RHE and an ammonia yield of 25.2 mg h-¹ mgcat-¹ at -1.0 V vs. RHE with high stability. The in‐situ electro‐generated ammonia acts directly as a base cata","au":["Ling-Ling Shan","Jing-Jing Liang","Shao-Wei Bian"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Cu掺杂Co₃O₄/rGO纳米片的形貌与电子结构调控用于高效电催化硝酸盐-氨升级与原位查尔酮合成","zb":"通过Cu掺杂调控形貌和电子结构构建Cu-Co串联位点，优化了反应物和中间体的吸附强度，所得催化剂在-1.0 V vs. RHE下氨产率为25.2 mg h-¹ mgcat-¹，原位生成的氨直接作为查尔酮合成的催化剂。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141853","t":"Dynamic hydrogen-storage reservoir in ruthenium–hydrogen tungsten bronze for highly efficient photocatalytic ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141853","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Photocatalytic N 2 fixation is a promising route for sustainable ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis. Its efficiency depends on light absorption, charge separation, and active sites. Hydrogen tungsten bronze (H x WO 3 ; HWO) exhibits distinct advantages for nitrogen (N 2 ) fixation owing to its broad ultraviolet-visible-near-infrared light absorption and abundant oxygen vacancies. Nevertheless, the structural instability originating from the extraction of lattice hydrogen during catalysis severely restricts its practical applicability. Herein, we report the design of a hydrogen extraction and insertion dynamic ruthenium (Ru)-supported HWO (Ru/HWO) system for stable and efficient photocatalytic N 2 fixation. During the reaction, the release of lattice hydrogen from HWO accelerates the N 2 reduction reaction. Active hydrogen species are generated at the water-dissociation sites on Ru spillover to HW","au":["Jie Yuan","Jianyu Xiao","Qian Xia","Guihua Luo","Xinwei Cui","Xu Sun"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"动态氢存储库在钌-氢钨青铜中用于高效光催化氨合成","zb":"研究对象为钌-氢钨青铜（Ru/HWO）体系，关键方法为设计动态氢提取和插入系统，通过闪蒸焦耳热加速N2还原反应，在Ru溢流到HWO的水解位点生成活性氢物种，实现228.5 μmol g-1 h-1的氨产率，光利用范围从紫外到红外。","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Ru/钌体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcat.2026.117323","t":"Steering active hydrogen for efficient electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis from nitrate reduction: a multidimensional strategic review","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2026.117323","s":"Journal of Catalysis","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-23T22:40:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Huan Wang","Jianqiang Zhu","Sen Chen","Lishi Jiao","Ming Zhang","Guannan Gong"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"引导活性氢用于硝酸盐还原制氨的多维战略综述","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcat.2026.117293","t":"Stabilizing step-edge-rich ruthenium nanoparticles via SiO2 encapsulation for hydrogen generation from ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2026.117293","s":"Journal of Catalysis","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ruthenium nanoparticles between 2–3 nm exhibit the highest activity for ammonia decomposition due to a maximum concentration of B 5 step-edge ensembles. Nanoparticles within this size are thermodynamically unstable and undergo sintering at elevated temperatures. Prior SiO 2 encapsulation strategies to improve stability have been limited to Ru particles > 20 nm, where step-edge density is low. We report SiO 2 -encapsulated Ru nanoparticles (Ru@SiO 2 ) with precise size control from 1.8 to 3.2 nm in ∼0.3 nm increments, enabling investigation within the step-edge-rich regime. Encapsulated 2.8 nm Ru particles remain stable under inert at 500 °C for 1000 h without measurable change in particle size or activity, while supported Ru particles lost up to 50% in conversion. Precise size control reveals a strong dependence of activity on particle size, peaking at 2.2 nm, consistent with predicted B","au":["Rami Jubeili","Sawyer d’Entremont","Wyatt Schnare","Natascha Miederhoff","M. Andrea Ortiz Medrano","D. Chester Upham"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"通过SiO2包封稳定富含阶梯边缘的钌纳米颗粒用于氨分解制氢","zb":"报道了尺寸精确控制在1.8至3.2 nm的SiO2包覆钌纳米颗粒（Ru@SiO2），研究了富含台阶边缘的尺寸范围。2.8 nm的Ru@SiO2在500 °C惰性气氛下1000小时保持稳定，而负载型钌颗粒活性损失高达50%。2.2 nm的Ru@SiO2/Al2O3在400 °C下氢产率为90.4 mmol H2 g Ru-1 min-1，比之前报道的Ru@SiO2系统高4倍以上。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.192596","t":"Facile Fabrication of 0D/1D CPB/ZnO Type‑II Heterojunction toward Efficient Photocatalytic N2 Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.192596","s":"Journal of Alloys and Compounds","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-19T19:29:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xinchun Gao","Maoyu Sun","Lijing Wang","Hongju Zhai","Mingyue Wang"],"o":"日常","why":["N2 Reduction"],"zt":"0D/1D CPB/ZnO II型异质结的简便制备及其在高效光催化N2还原合成氨中的应用","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.isci.2026.118154","t":"Highly twinned cobalt selenide with abundant selenium vacancies for efficient nitrogen reduction reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.isci.2026.118154","s":"iScience","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-06T03:24:56Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) offers a promising approach to produce ammonia (NH3) under ambient conditions. However, the ammonia yield rate and Faradaic efficiency were still limited by the chemical inertness of nitrogen. Here, we report the introduction of Se vacancies in CoSe nanorods via an ions-exchange method. Se vacancies can improve the NRR activities by the lending of N2 activation. As a result, the ammonia yield rate reached as high as 106.7 μg h–1 mg–1 with a Faradaic efficiency of 21.2% at -0.3 V (vs. RHE). More importantly, the ammonia is directly derived from nitrogen, which was demonstrated by the isotopic experiments using 15N2 as a nitrogen source. This work not only provides a strategy for creating Se vacancies, but also offers an important pathway for the development of efficient catalysts for NRR. Ammonia (NH3) golds significant importance as carb","au":["Li Shang","Can Li","Sui Zhang","Kangwen Qiu"],"o":"日常","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"具有丰富硒空位的孪晶钴硒化物用于高效的氮还原反应","zb":"通过离子交换法在CoSe纳米棒中引入硒空位，利用硒空位促进N2活化，在-0.3 V下实现了106.7 μg h–1 mg–1的氨产率和21.2%的法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.inoche.2026.117958","t":"BP-MoS₂ heterojunction for efficient ambient ammonia electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.inoche.2026.117958","s":"Inorganic Chemistry Communications","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-20T19:07:01Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Shaona Chen","Tianwei Liang","Demiao Fang","Jinjin Shi","Rengui Weng"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia electrosynthesis"],"zt":"用于高效环境氨电合成的BP-MoS₂异质结","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158418","t":"Continuous ammonia production via solar-biomass integration: Annual 4E performance and economic viability","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158418","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Mohammad Hossein Jahangir","Ali MohammadAlizadeh","Abtin Tabrizi"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"通过太阳能生物质一体化实现连续氨生产：年度4E性能和经济可行性","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158417","t":"Flexible ammonia synthesis: A techno-economic analysis of operational limits in the Haber-Bosch loop","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.158417","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Cecilia Pistolesi","Claudia Bassano","Alberto Giaconia","Marcello De Falco"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"柔性氨合成：哈伯-博施循环中操作极限的技术经济分析","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.enchem.2026.100214","t":"Fluorine-mediated dual coordination regulation of Cu nanoclusters for nitrate-to-ammonia electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.enchem.2026.100214","s":"EnergyChem","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-13T18:31:35Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Dan-Dan Wang","Xiao-Li Wang","Yu-Fei Long","Xiong He","Bingnan Wang","Xiao-Min Li"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"氟介导的 Cu 纳米簇双重配位调控用于硝酸盐到氨的电合成","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.comptc.2026.116150","t":"First-principles screening of single-atom catalysts anchored on monolayer NbSe2 for electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.comptc.2026.116150","s":"Computational and Theoretical Chemistry","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-19T19:29:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Linzi Liu","Xinkai Zhou","Dan Li","Wenfeng Shen","Ran Liu"],"o":"日常","why":["electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"基于单层 NbSe2 锚定单原子催化剂的电催化氮还原的第一性原理筛选","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.comptc.2026.116140","t":"Ammonia production through N2 reduction via transition metals decorated boron phosphide nanocage based single atom catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.comptc.2026.116140","s":"Computational and Theoretical Chemistry","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-11T18:43:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Naveen Kosar","Tariq Mahmood","Abdulaziz A. Al-Saadi"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia production"],"zt":"通过过渡金属修饰的磷化硼纳米笼单原子催化剂进行N2还原生产氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cherd.2026.11.052","t":"Pore-to-reactor assessment of exhaust-assisted ammonia cracking using boundary-compatible transport closures","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cherd.2026.11.052","s":"Chemical Engineering Research and Design","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-23T22:40:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Mengxia Ji","Yong Shu","Jian Zhang","Shaopeng Gong","Hua Zhang"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia cracking"],"zt":"利用边界兼容输运闭合的排气辅助氨裂解孔到反应器评估","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.checat.2026.101927","t":"Innovative active sites based on frustrated Lewis pairs for photocatalytic ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.checat.2026.101927","s":"Chem Catalysis","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-19T19:29:32Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jennifer Strunk"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于 frustrated Lewis pairs 的创新活性位点用于光催化合成氨","ob":"光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.checat.2026.101910","t":"Non-aqueous hydrogen oxidation enables sustainable lithium-mediated ammonia electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.checat.2026.101910","s":"Chem Catalysis","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-18T19:24:37Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Zhenhao Wang","Liqi Shi","Huang Zhou","Jieshan Qiu","Shaofeng Li"],"o":"日常","why":["lithium-mediated ammonia"],"zt":"非水相氢氧化促进可持续锂介导的氨电合成","ob":"其他催化反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ces.2026.125678","t":"Metal-dependent ligand effects in 2,2′-bipyridine-coordinated single-atom catalysts on g-C3N4 for electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ces.2026.125678","s":"Chemical Engineering Science","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-21T17:58:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Luxuan Huang","Jingyao Liu","Zhong-min Su"],"o":"日常","why":["electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"g-C3N4上2,2'-联吡啶配位单原子催化剂中金属依赖的配体效应","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.184314","t":"Unveiling the Kinetic Matching Relation in CuxMoy Bimetallic Catalysts for Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.184314","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia proceeds through sequential NO3-→NO2- and NO2-→NH3 transformations, which consume two and six electrons, respectively. Under galvanostatic operation, the fixed total electron flux constrains these coupled steps; however, how their relative kinetics regulate intermediate accumulation and ammonia production remains insufficiently understood. Here, a series of CuxMoy bimetallic electrodes was prepared by electrochemical co-deposition to investigate this relationship. Time-dependent concentration profiles of NO3-, NO2-, and NH3 were fitted using a sequential two-step kinetic model to quantify the apparent kinetics of nitrite formation and consumption. The analysis shows that k1 governs the supply of nitrite, whereas k2 determines its consumption and thereby regulates product distribution. Efficient ammonia production requires matching these two p","au":["Weijia Li","Chijian Lin","Jiancheng He","Changzheng Lin","Hao Xu","Jiangtao Feng"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"揭示用于硝酸盐还原制氨的Cu_xMo_y双金属催化剂的动力学匹配关系","zb":"通过电化学共沉积制备了一系列Cu_xMo_y双金属电极，利用顺序双步动力学模型拟合NO3-、NO2-和NH3的时间依赖性浓度分布，量化了亚硝酸盐生成与消耗的动力学。优化后的Cu0.05Mo0.10电极在80 mA·cm-2下实现了96.9%的法拉第效率和0.33 mmol cm-2 h-1的产氨率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.184294","t":"Unraveling the role of ceria in ammonia decomposition over carbon nanofibers-supported Ru catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.184294","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-15T17:44:04Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia decomposition is a promising route for CO x -free hydrogen production, but its practical implementation is limited by the energy demand of the process and by the cost of the most active catalysts. In this work, ruthenium catalysts supported on carbon nanofibers (CNF) and promoted with ceria were systematically investigated for ammonia decomposition. Catalysts with different Ru loadings were prepared with and without CeO 2 to assess whether ceria promotion can compensate for a reduced noble-metal content. Ceria incorporation markedly enhanced catalyst basicity, and at low loading Ru was preferentially located on the ceria nanodomains. At 450 °C, the H 2 production rate per gram of Ru of the 1 wt% Ru catalyst increased upon ceria promotion. The ceria-promoted catalyst reached about 80% of the activity of the 4 wt% Ru catalyst with about one quarter of the Ru. External mass-transfer","au":["Christian Di Stasi","Esther Frecha","Jaime López-de los Ríos","Pilar Ferrer","Matthijs A. van Spronsen","Isabel Suelves"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"揭示碳纳米纤维负载Ru催化剂氨分解中氧化铈的作用","zb":"研究碳纳米纤维负载 Ru 催化剂中氧化铈助剂的作用。通过对比不同 Ru 负载量及有无 CeO2 的催化剂，发现 CeO2 显著增强了催化剂碱性，使 Ru 优先富集于 CeO2 纳米域。在 450 °C 下，1 wt% Ru 催化剂的产氢率显著提升，达到 4 wt% Ru 催化剂活性的约 80%，且活化能保持在 101–113 kJ/mol。原位 AP-XPS 和 NEXAFS 表征证实了 Ce3+/Ce4+ 可逆变化及氢溢流过程。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系、碳材料"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.184270","t":"Synergistic V4+/V5+–Fe2+/Fe3+ dual redox sites and oxygen vacancies in FeVO4 decouple N2 activation from H2O dissociation for efficient photocatalytic ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.184270","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-14T17:09:43Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yani Dong","Jiaxin Liu","Li Chen","Tuo Guo","Guangmin Ren","Qingjie Guo"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"FeVO4 中协同的 V4+/V5+–Fe2+/Fe3+ 双氧化还原位点与氧空位解耦 N2 活化与 H2O 解离以实现高效光催化氨合成","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.183777","t":"Fe-induced local coordination reconstruction of MoB2 for selective nitrate-to-ammonia electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.183777","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-02T20:48:05Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jingya Ding","Feng Cheng","Wenlin Zeng","Qi Xu","Sheng Han","Yiwei Zhang"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"Fe诱导的MoB2局部配位重构用于选择性硝酸盐-氨电合成","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.183530","t":"A sustainable path towards nitrogen purification for ammonia production: Experimental demonstration of thermochemical air separation in a packed-bed reactor","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.183530","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Conventional ammonia synthesis relies on steam methane reforming (SMR) to produce hydrogen while concurrently supplying high-purity nitrogen as a by-product for the Haber-Bosch process. However, the shift to green ammonia, where hydrogen is produced via electrolysis, eliminates this nitrogen source, necessitating an energy-efficient air separation unit (ASU) to prevent catalyst poisoning from O 2 impurities below 10 ppm. Pressure swing adsorption units face prohibitive energy penalties when targeting such ultra-low impurities, as energy demand escalates exponentially below 1 vol% O 2 . To overcome this scalability barrier, we demonstrate a thermochemical redox cycle using SrFeO 3 (SFO) integrated with ASU pre-purification for the first time. Our 6.5 kg packed-bed reactor achieves 450 °C restricts purity to ≥ 2 ppm due to thermodynamic limitations. A purified nitrogen flow of up to 0.35 k","au":["Nicole Carina Neumann","Lena Klaas","Dorottya Kriechbaumer","Bruno Lachmann","Fabio Pierno","Dorothea Kaunzner"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"一条可持续的氮纯化途径用于氨生产：填充床反应器中热化学空气分离的实验验证","zb":"针对绿色氨生产中缺乏氮气来源的问题，提出了一种集成ASU预纯化的SrFeO3热化学氧化还原循环。在6.5 kg填充床反应器中实现了450 °C的运行，获得高达0.35 kg/s的纯氮流量，解决了催化剂中毒问题。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cattod.2026.116060","t":"Strategies for controlling nitrogen accumulation in direct reduced iron catalyst during ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cattod.2026.116060","s":"Catalysis Today","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-04T18:39:17Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jae Min Park","Seungbeom Yoon","Sangwook Joo","Gihun Kwon","Hojin Lee","Hai Woong Park"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"控制直接还原铁催化剂在氨分解过程中氮积累的策略","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Fe/铁体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.biortech.2026.136332","t":"Mechanisms of iron-mediated nitrogen removal under contrasting carbon-to-nitrogen ratios: Enhanced nitrate reduction and potential coupling with ammonium oxidation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biortech.2026.136332","s":"Bioresource Technology","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-24T06:57:23Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The roles of iron in nitrogen removal through iron-mediated denitrification and anaerobic ammonium oxidation coupled to Fe(III) reduction (Feammox) under contrasting carbon-to-nitrogen (C/N) ratios remain unclear. Under carbon-sufficient conditions (chemical oxygen demand (COD)/NO 3 - -N = 16.9-18.7), NO 3 - -N removal increased with iron concentration. At 12 h, removal efficiencies were 71%, 83% and 92.3% in the low-, intermediate- and high-Fe(II) groups, respectively (initial Fe(II): 198.6, 305.5 and 393.6 mg/L). Under carbon-limited conditions (COD/NO 3 - -N = 0.85-1.07), intermittent NO 3 - -N addition promoted Fe(II)/Fe(III) cycling and accelerated NO 3 - -N and NH 4 + -N removal at higher iron concentrations (initial Fe(II): 47.6, 103.2 and 157.4 mg/L). On day 30, relative to the low- and intermediate-Fe(II) groups, the high-Fe(II) group showed respective reductions of 25% and 18% ","au":["Dandan Yan","Xinyi Wu","Xiangshan Zeng","Changhui Hu","Jinlai Yuan","Yafei Yang"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"不同碳氮比下铁介导的脱氮机理：增强硝酸盐还原与与铵氧化耦合的潜力","zb":"研究对比了富碳和缺碳条件下铁介导的脱氮机理。在富碳条件下，Fe(II)浓度增加显著提高了硝酸盐去除效率；在缺碳条件下，间歇添加硝酸盐促进了Fe(II)/Fe(III)循环。检测显示铁氧化/还原微生物的存在，表明铵主要通过Feammox去除。高Fe(II)浓度下，富集了硝酸盐依赖性亚铁氧化相关基因，证实了NDFO介导的硝酸盐还原机制。","ob":"其他催化反应"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127841","t":"Atomically Coupled Co–MnO Interfaces Accelerate Tandem Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127841","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-24T21:13:24Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Wensheng Gao","Kefeng Xie","Yongchao Liu","Hong Zhang","Jing Du","Zelong Li"],"o":"日常","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"原子耦合 Co–MnO 界面加速串联硝酸盐还原制氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127827","t":"Hydrogen Spillover Mediated Active Hydrogen Accessibility on Model Cobalt Phosphide Catalysts for Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127827","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-22T18:31:46Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Wei Zhang","Ning Han","Jianxiang Wu","Longlong Xu","Xiaoying Lu","Cancan Chang"],"o":"日常","why":["Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction"],"zt":"在模型钴磷化物催化剂上，氢溢流介导的活性氢可及性用于电化学氮还原","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127780","t":"APTES-mediated Fe-N coordination modulates electronic structure of Fe single-atom for selective photocatalytic nitrate reduction to N2","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127780","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-11T02:45:15Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xia Zhang","Jiaxin Han","Tiemei Li","Guifen Zhu","Jing Fan"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"APTES介导的Fe-N配位调控Fe单原子选择性光催化还原硝酸盐至N2的电子结构","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127755","t":"Tailoring Zeolite Acidity to Regulate Dynamic NH3 Adsorption-Desorption for Enhanced Plasma-Catalytic Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127755","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia adsorption-desorption plays a pivotal role in plasma-catalytic ammonia synthesis, yet the influence of catalyst acidity on regulating this dynamic process remains poorly understood. Here, we investigate the effect of zeolite acidity on plasma-catalytic NH 3 synthesis by systematically tuning the acid-site distribution of zeolite 4 A through cation exchange. Among the catalysts examined, Ni/Ca-4A achieved an NH 3 synthesis rate of 8858.2 μmol g -1 h -1 at a specific energy input (SEI) of 12 kJ L -1 and an N 2 /H 2 ratio of 2:1, more than ten times higher than that of unmodified zeolite 4 A. Comprehensive catalyst characterization, plasma diagnostics and in situ NH 3 monitoring reveal that catalyst performance is governed by the dynamic adsorption-desorption behavior of NH 3 under plasma conditions. Ca-exchanged 4 A possesses a high concentration of plasma-accessible acid sites, de","au":["Weitao Wang","Chunqiang Lu","Jens-Peter B. Haraldsted","Josephine Digné","Erik Wisaeus","Bianca Rolim"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"调控沸石酸度以调节动态NH3吸附-解吸以增强等离子体催化氨合成","zb":"研究对象为等离子体催化氨合成，关键方法为通过阳离子交换系统调整沸石 4 A 的酸位点分布，主要结果为 Ni/Ca-4A 在 SEI 为 12 kJ L-1 和 N2/H2 比为 2:1 时实现 8858.2 μmol g-1 h-1 的 NH3 合成速率，比未改性的沸石 4 A 高十倍以上。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/cctc.71167","t":"Structure–Property Relationship of Cobalt‐Based Catalysts for Ammonia Decomposition: Operando X‐Ray Studies","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cctc.71167","s":"ChemCatChem","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-16T21:03:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT MgO‐supported Co catalysts with Co/Co+Mg ratios of 5–20 at.% were investigated for ammonia decomposition, combining catalytic testing with quasi‐in situ and operando characterization, including x‐ray powder diffraction, total scattering/PDF analysis, x‐ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS), and x‐ray absorption spectroscopy (XAS). The initial phase composition strongly determines the activation pathway and, subsequently, the catalytic performance. The calcined pre‐catalysts consist of Mg 1−x Co x O solid solution and, at higher Co loadings, an additional spinel‐type oxide phase assigned to MgCo 2 O 4 and/or Co 3 O 4 . In situ diffraction, operando PDF, and XAFS reveal that the spinel‐type species are readily reduced to metallic Co during activation at 800°C, whereas Co 2+ species stabilized in the solid solution require higher temperatures for complete reduction. Quasi‐in situ XP","au":["Christos Sidiropoulos","Jan Ternieden","Sebastian Leiting","Claudia Weidenthaler"],"o":"日常","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"氨分解钴基催化剂的结构-性能关系：原位X射线研究","zb":"研究了负载在MgO上的Co催化剂（Co/Co+Mg比例为5-20 at.%），结合催化测试与原位表征。研究发现初始相组成决定了活化路径，在800°C活化时，尖晶石物种易还原为金属Co，而固溶体中的Co2+需要更高温度。20% Co/MgO催化剂在550°C下实现了88%的NH3转化率和60小时稳定性。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1016/j.watres.2026.127329","t":"Root Mucilage-Inspired Hydrogel Composite Membranes Enable High-Efficacy Ammonia Recovery","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.watres.2026.127329","s":"Water Research","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-12T18:57:08Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Ammonia recovery from wastewater via membrane stripping is a compelling route for pollution control and nutrient recycling, yet its deployment is hindered by a trade-off between permeation flux and fouling resistance. Inspired by plant root mucilage, which enriches and transports nutrients from soil to roots, we present a polyvinylidene fluoride (PVDF) membrane coated with a mucilage-like hydrogel layer for ammonia (NH 3 ) recovery. This biomimetic coating, fabricated from chitosan (CS) and sodium alginate (SA), mimics functional traits of root mucilage. Abundant polar groups in the hydrogel layer promote NH 3 partitioning and localized NH 3 enrichment, thereby improving interfacial NH 3 supply, while the highly hydrated network facilitates NH 3 diffusion at a rate comparable to that in bulk solution. Together, these features offset the transport penalty imposed by the dense hydrogel lay","au":["Cong Chen","Yuyang Li","Zhongbo Zhou","Siyu Li","Lulu Chou","Le Han"],"o":"日常","zt":"受根粘液启发的水凝胶复合膜实现高效率氨回收","zb":"受植物根粘液启发，研究制备了聚偏氟乙烯膜表面的仿生粘液状水凝胶涂层用于氨回收。该涂层由壳聚糖和海藻酸钠制成，通过极性基团促进氨富集和扩散，并利用光滑表面、亚纳米级筛分和Donnan排斥增强抗污染性能。在180小时真实消化液测试中，该膜保持了与原始PVDF膜相当的氨通量，但污染导致的通量下降仅为7% vs 56%。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.seta.2026.105594","t":"Hourly carbon intensity of sold hydrogen, ammonia, and methanol under emission-aware scheduling","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seta.2026.105594","s":"Sustainable Energy Technologies and Assessments","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-20T19:07:01Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Dynamic electricity emission signals can guide flexible Power-to-X (PtX) operation, but electricity-side emission reductions do not directly determine the carbon intensity (CI) of products sold after storage and conversion. This study assesses that relationship in a grid-connected hydrogen, ammonia, and methanol plant modeled for Spain in 2024. Three forecast-based day-ahead signals (an average emission factor and two marginal emission factor proxies) are applied separately in rolling-horizon mixed-integer quadratically constrained scheduling. An ex-post carbon balance propagates CO 2 burdens from electricity and direct process emissions through production, storage, downstream synthesis, ammonia cracking, and final withdrawal. Relative to cost-minimizing operation, the central emission-capped schedules reduce signal-matched annual grid emissions by 5.4–23.8%, with operating cost increase","au":["Ali Norouzi","Erdal Aydin"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia cracking"],"zt":"销售氢、氨和甲醇的每小时碳强度在排放感知调度下","zb":"动态电力排放信号可以指导灵活的 Power-to-X (PtX) 运行，但电力侧的减排并不直接决定储存和转换后销售的产品的碳强度（CI）。这项研究评估了西班牙 2024 年建模的电网连接的氢、氨和甲醇工厂中这种关系。应用了三个基于预测的日前信号（平均排放因子和两个边际排放因子代理），分别在不同的滚动视野混合整数二次约束调度中。事后碳平衡将来自电力和直接工艺排放的 CO2 负担从生产、储存、下游合成、氨裂解和最终提取中传播。相对于成本最小化运行，中心排放限制调度将信号匹配的年度电网排放减少 5.4–23.8%，运营成本增加 0.8–2.2%。年度销售产品 CI 减少 5.6–24.1% 对于氢，5.4–17.9% 对于氨，和 3.0–24.3% 对于甲醇。尽管年度 CI 较低，但排放限制调度在九种产品-信号比较中，在 22.1–45.7% 的提取小时中产生了高于匹配成本最小化基线的更高小时 ","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jhazmat.2026.144333","t":"Bypassing Pre-Calcination: Ultra-Fast Co-Vitrification of Spent LiFePO4 and Fly Ash under Flash Joule Heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jhazmat.2026.144333","s":"Journal of Hazardous Materials","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-24T21:13:24Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Siqi Jiang","Bonan Liu","Tanzila Anjum","Yue Lu","Aimin Li"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"绕过预煅烧：闪蒸焦耳热下废 LiFePO4 和飞灰的超快速钴玻璃化","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jeurceramsoc.2026.119063","t":"Beyond synchronous promotion: deciphering the asynchronous ORR evolution on decorated SOFC cathodes via flash Joule heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jeurceramsoc.2026.119063","s":"Journal of the European Ceramic Society","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-18T19:24:37Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Chen Yang","Zhiyuan Li","Yanan Li","Hongli He","Xue Guo","Haibin Sun"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"超越同步促进：通过闪蒸焦耳热解析装饰固体氧化物燃料电池阴极上的异步氧还原反应演变","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2026.125979","t":"UV-Curable Fluorescein-Modified Polymer Coating for Smartphone-Based Dual-Mode Optical Ammonia Sensing","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2026.125979","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-18T04:15:36Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Mohamed Attia","Mahmoud Basseem I. Mohamed","Mohamed A. Hegazy","Mohamed M. Ghobashy","Farag Abdelha"],"o":"日常","zt":"用于智能手机双模光学氨气传感的UV固化荧光素改性聚合物涂层","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2026.125928","t":"Interfacial Electronic Reconstruction of Trimetallic Co-Cu-Fe Sites Enables Selective Nitrate Electroreduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2026.125928","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-12T03:47:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Jing Zhang","Zhi Song","Boxia Liu","Dongxu Han","Yeqiong Huang","Chuhan Xing"],"o":"日常","zt":"三金属 Co-Cu-Fe 位点的界面电子重构使硝酸电还原选择性地生成氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.142024","t":"Engineering surface-exposed iron single-atom sites in porous carbon via molten salt templating for nitrate electroreduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.142024","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Single-atom catalysts (SACs) hold great promise for electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia (NRA), but their performance is often limited by the poor utilization of metal sites buried within the carbon matrix. Here, we introduce a molten salt templating strategy to engineer highly accessible FeN 4 sites on the surface of porous carbon (FeNC-NaCl), effectively transforming inactive interior Fe atoms into catalytically available active centers. The resulting catalyst achieves a near-unity Faradaic efficiency of 98.7% at -1.0 V vs. RHE and an outstanding NH 3 yield of 36.95 mg h -1 mg cat -1 at -1.1 V vs. RHE. More importantly, by decoupling the contributions of Fe loading and site accessibility, we demonstrate that the apparent turnover frequency (TOF) is directly correlated with the surface exposure of FeN 4 sites, with FeNC-NaCl exhibiting a seven-fold higher TOF than conventional N","au":["Axin Lu","Xiaobo Ma","Rui Su","Xuezhi Li","Ying Han","Chao Hu"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"通过熔盐模板工程化多孔碳中表面暴露的铁单原子位点用于硝酸盐电还原制氨","zb":"单原子催化剂（SACs）在电化学硝酸盐还原为氨（NRA）方面具有巨大潜力，但其性能通常受限于碳基质中埋藏的金属位点的利用率。本文介绍了一种熔盐模板策略，在多孔碳（FeNC-NaCl）的表面工程化高度可访问的FeN 4 位点，有效地将非活性的内部Fe原子转化为催化活性的活性中心。所得催化剂在-1.0 V vs. RHE时实现了近100%的法拉第效率（98.7%），并在-1.1 V vs. RHE时实现了杰出的NH 3 产率（36.95 mg h -1 mg cat -1）。更重要的是，通过解耦Fe负载和位点可访问性的贡献，我们证明了表观转换频率（TOF）直接与FeN 4 位点的表面暴露相关，FeNC-NaCl比传统的N掺杂碳表现出七倍的TOF。密度泛函理论计算确定了HNO* → HNOH*质子化为决定步骤，并将FeN 4 位点的优越活性归因于它们对关键中间体的最佳结合亲和力。这项工作建立了位","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.192210","t":"Constructing CoNi alloy/high-entropy oxide heterojunctions via selective surface reduction for rapid visible-light-driven ammonia borane methanolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.192210","s":"Journal of Alloys and Compounds","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-03T18:28:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Yufeng Jiang","Jingjing Deng","Xiaodong Chen","Zemin Huang","Yi Lin","Yanrui He"],"o":"日常","zt":"通过选择性表面还原构建CoNi合金/高熵氧化物异质结用于快速可见光驱动氨硼烷甲醇解","ob":"氨硼烷水解｜光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jacomc.2026.100312","t":"Magnetically Recoverable Rhodium Nanoparticles on NiFe2O4: Efficient Catalytic System for Hydrogen Evolution from Ammonia Borane Hydrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jacomc.2026.100312","s":"Journal of Alloys and Compounds Communications","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-05T18:46:52Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Serdar Akbayrak","Saim Özkar"],"o":"日常","zt":"磁性可回收的铑纳米颗粒负载在 NiFe2O4 上：高效的氨硼烷水解制氢催化体系","ob":"氨硼烷水解","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.fub.2026.100225","t":"Ammonia-Mediated Energy Storage: Electrochemical Pathways","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fub.2026.100225","s":"Future Batteries","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-07T16:50:48Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Ammonia-mediated energy storage system offers a promising approach to bridging intermittent renewable electricity generation and dispatchable power supply through an integrated electricity–ammonia–electricity cycle. In this system, renewable electricity is first converted into ammonia via power-to-ammonia (P2A) conversion, stored and transported as a chemical energy carrier, and then reconverted into electricity via ammonia-to-power (A2P) technologies. This review discusses the ammonia-mediated energy storage system from an electrochemical perspective, covering both P2A and A2P conversions. For P2A, renewable hydrogen-assisted Haber–Bosch synthesis is considered the most technologically mature route for practical deployment, while emerging electrochemical nitrogen and nitrate reduction pathways are examined in terms of their potential and limitations. For A2P, indirect configurations cou","au":["Wenzhi Li","Lizhen Wu","Qing Wang","Guangrong Deng","Zhihao Zhao","Shu Yuan"],"o":"日常","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"氨介导储能：电化学途径","zb":"该综述探讨了利用氨介导储能系统连接间歇性可再生能源发电与可调度电力供应的电化学途径。文章分析了电化学氮和硝酸盐还原路径在电转氨（P2A）中的潜力与局限，并对比了氨裂解耦合氢燃料电池与氨 fed 固体氧化物燃料电池（NH₃-SOFCs）及阴离子交换膜直接氨燃料电池（AEM-DAFCs）在电转电（A2P）中的进展。","ob":"氨分解制氢｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.foodchem.2026.151910","t":"A multi-functional antibacterial film based on lignocellulose nanofibril and sodium alginate: ammonia sensing and fresh shrimp preservation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.foodchem.2026.151910","s":"Food Chemistry","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-09T21:27:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"To improve the environmental burden and functional limitations of petroleum-based plastics in fresh meat distribution, an intelligent active packaging material comprising lignocellulose nanofibril/ sodium alginate/ curcumin-zein nanoparticles (LCNF/SA/Z@CUR) was developed. Through the cooperative interaction between CUR and lignin-derived phenolic hydroxyl groups, ultraviolet shielding exceeding 90% and broad-spectrum antibacterial activity near 99.5% were achieved. The dual-network structure formed by LCNF and SA, coupled with the uniform distribution of Z@CUR NPs, increased the structural density of the film, resulting in reductions in water vapor and oxygen permeabilities by 70.6% and 90.2%. The film exhibited reversible yellow-to-brown color changes upon ammonia exposure, enabling visual freshness indication. Freshness-preservation tests showed a 55.2% reduction in the total volatile","au":["Jiyuan Shi","Dan Huo","Xin Tian","Qingqing Jian","Fengshan Zhang","Guigan Fang"],"o":"日常","zt":"基于木质纤维素纳米纤维和海藻酸钠的多功能抗菌膜：氨传感和新鲜虾保鲜","zb":"开发了一种由木质纤维素纳米纤维/海藻酸钠/姜黄-玉米蛋白纳米颗粒（LCNF/SA/Z@CUR）组成的智能活性包装材料，以改善传统塑料的环境负担和功能限制。姜黄与木质素衍生的酚羟基的协同作用实现了超过 90% 的紫外线屏蔽和 99.5% 的广谱抗菌活性。LCNF 和 SA 形成的双网络结构，结合 Z@CUR 纳米颗粒的均匀分布，增加了薄膜的结构密度，导致水蒸气和氧气透过率分别降低 70.6% 和 90.2%。薄膜在氨暴露下表现出可逆的黄褐色到棕色变色，实现视觉新鲜度指示。新鲜度保鲜试验显示，在 4 °C 下，总挥发性氨氮积累速率降低了 55.2%，与商业聚乙烯包装相比，货架期延长了两天。该研究为鲜虾保鲜提供了一种可生物降解、视觉新鲜度指示的包装策略，具有更广泛的新鲜食品应用潜力。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.foodchem.2026.151726","t":"Co-MOF@CNF composite films for dual-functional intelligent packaging with ammonia-responsive colorimetric sensing and active shrimp freshness preservation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.foodchem.2026.151726","s":"Food Chemistry","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-12T03:47:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Intelligent packaging materials are essential for ensuring food safety and quality. To overcome the limitations of traditional indicators, we developed a novel layered cobalt-based metal-organic framework (Co-MOF) that exhibits both ammonia-responsive color change and antibacterial properties. We prepared an intelligent responsive Co-MOF@CNF composite film by uniformly growing layered Co-MOF nanocrystals onto TEMPO-oxidized cellulose nanofibers (TOCNF) using an in/ex-situ synthesis strategy. Structural analysis confirmed a strong interaction via Co-O coordination bonds between the Co-MOF and TOCNF. The film's color-change mechanism, from pinkish-purple to black in the presence of ammonia, is primarily attributed to the interaction between ammonia molecules and the unsaturated cobalt atoms within the Co-MOF, significantly altering the coordination environment. The incorporation of Co-MOF ","au":["Mengmeng Guo","Jing Yu","Jing Li","Jing Ren","Zimeng Mu","Chunzu Cheng"],"o":"日常","zt":"Co-MOF@CNF复合薄膜用于双功能智能包装，具有氨响应比色传感和活性虾保鲜活性","zb":"开发了一种新型层状钴基金属有机框架（Co-MOF）智能响应复合薄膜，具有氨响应变色和抗菌性能。通过将层状 Co-MOF 纳米晶体均匀生长到 TEMPO-氧化纤维素纳米纤维（TOCNF）上制备薄膜，结构分析证实 Co-MOF 与 TOCNF 之间存在强相互作用。薄膜在氨存在下从粉红紫色变为黑色，主要归因于氨分子与 Co-MOF 中不饱和钴原子的相互作用。Co-MOF 的加入显著提高了薄膜性能，拉伸强度和断裂伸长率分别提高 77.6% 和 89.25%。薄膜具有优异的阻隔性能，水蒸气透过率（WVP）和水蒸气透过率（WVTR）分别降低 15.16% 和 19.98%，并表现出优异的紫外线屏蔽性能和长效抗菌效果。在虾保鲜试验中，Co-MOF@CNF 薄膜在腐败发生时从粉红紫色变为黑色（ΔE = 64.66），高 Co-MOF 负载率显著降低了总挥发性碱性氮（TVB-N）形成速率，表现出强活性保鲜能","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ecmx.2026.102431","t":"Screening of recyclable metal candidates as solid carriers for production and storage of hydrogen and ammonia in solar chemical-looping processes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ecmx.2026.102431","s":"Energy Conversion and Management: X","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-02T02:28:20Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The potential of various metal oxides as redox carrier materials was investigated for on-demand hydrogen/ammonia production and solid-state storage through solar chemical-looping processes. Metal production involves solar-driven reduction assisted by various bio-sourced reductants, while nitride synthesis requires a similar reduction process supplemented by nitrogen incorporation. The reduced metals act as long-term solid storage media. Steam oxidation of metals (or nitrides) produces pure H 2 (or NH 3 ). A selection of oxide/metal and oxide/nitride pairs was carried out to identify the most promising systems. Suitable metals were screened according to multi-criteria: thermodynamic feasibility/conversion extents at equilibrium, cycle/process efficiencies, energy/exergy demands, specific storage density, and material availability/cost. Mo, W, and V offer high volumetric H 2 storage densit","au":["Stéphane Abanades","Srirat Chuayboon"],"o":"日常","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"太阳能化学链过程中用于生产与存储氢气和氨气的可回收金属载体候选物的筛选","zb":"本研究调查了各种金属氧化物作为太阳能化学链过程红载体的潜力，筛选了氧化物/金属和氧化物/氮化物对。根据热力学可行性、循环效率、能量/㶲需求和材料可获得性等标准，筛选出Mo、W、V具有高体积氢存储密度，而Al、Si、Mg、Fe、Mn、Cr、Ti平衡了存储性能与可获得性。对于氨气合成，AlN、TaN、ZrN、W₂N、TiN和Ge₃N₄的形成在热力学上是可行的。能量和㶲分析显示，Fe(s)、Mo(s)、Sn(s)、W(s)系统具有最高的太阳能-燃料效率（40–50%）。","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.checir.2026.100204","t":"When catalytic partners fail to cooperate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.checir.2026.100204","s":"Chem Circularity","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-06T03:24:56Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Combining catalytic sites with complementary functions has emerged as an appealing strategy for electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia. In Cell Reports Physical Science , Noor et al. demonstrate that complementary catalytic functions alone are insufficient to achieve synergistic nitrate reduction, highlighting the critical roles of active-site stability and spatial organization.","au":["Yang Liu"],"o":"日常","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"当催化伙伴无法合作时","zb":"将具有互补功能的催化位点结合起来的策略已成为电化学硝酸盐还原为氨的一种吸引人的策略。在 Cell Reports Physical Science 中，Noor 等人证明，仅具有互补催化功能不足以实现协同硝酸盐还原，突出了活性位点稳定性和空间组织的关键作用。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ceramint.2026.11.084","t":"Low-MXene-loading ZnO/Ti3C2Tx nanocomposites for highly selective room-temperature ammonia sensing","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ceramint.2026.11.084","s":"Ceramics International","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-10T04:37:10Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Jian-Fu Tang","Yu-Shrng Hsiao","Yen-Han Lai","Chung-Yuan Yang","Cheng-Liang Hsu"],"o":"日常","zt":"低 MXene 负载 ZnO/Ti3C2Tx 纳米复合材料用于高选择性室温氨气传感","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ceramint.2026.11.043","t":"Effect of Rapid Joule-Heating Sintering on Densification and Grain Growth of SiC Ceramics","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ceramint.2026.11.043","s":"Ceramics International","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-08T02:26:12Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Chaofan He","Yuhong Chen","Jiwei Ma","Wanxiu Hai","Meiling Liu"],"o":"日常","why":["Joule-Heat"],"zt":"快速焦耳热烧结对 SiC 陶瓷致密化和晶粒生长的影响","ob":"焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.184510","t":"Self-catalytic upcycling of waste PET into functional MOFs for efficient nitrate electroreduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.184510","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-20T03:57:35Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Wen-Wei Zhang","Yu-Zhen Chen","Zhibo Li"],"o":"日常","zt":"废弃PET的自催化升级转化为功能MOFs用于高效的硝酸盐电还原制氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.184388","t":"Molecular spacer-enabled interlayer adsorption in MXene for ultrasensitive room-temperature trace ammonia sensing","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.184388","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-17T19:51:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Jianping Xue","Bolang Cheng","Danyao Qu","Bohao Liu","Jinyong Hu","Han Jin"],"o":"日常","zt":"MXene中分子间隔层介导的层间吸附用于超灵敏室温痕量氨传感","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cclet.2026.113691","t":"Lattice strain engineering for durable and efficient acidic nitrate electroreduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cclet.2026.113691","s":"Chinese Chemical Letters","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-21T03:57:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Ying Yuan","Juan Zhang","Feng Wu","Jianfang Gao","Jiawei Wang","Shuai Niu"],"o":"日常","zt":"晶格应变工程用于耐用的酸性硝酸盐电还原合成氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127779","t":"Alloy Engineering and Hydrogen Spillover Regulation Enable Exceptional Non-Noble-Metal Catalysis for Ammonia Borane Hydrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127779","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-12T03:47:41Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Shiqi Wang","Shuo Wang","Yicheng Yu","Ziqiang Qu","Ning Wang","Qiming Sun"],"o":"日常","zt":"合金工程和氢溢流调控实现非贵金属催化剂在氨硼烷水解中的优异性能","ob":"氨硼烷水解","bt":1},{"id":"10.1007/s10854-026-18858-6","t":"Ammonia gas sensing and electromagnetic shielding characteristics of Ni-doped ZnO and Zn-doped NiO thin films deposited on PES fabrics via sol–gel method","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10854-026-18858-6","s":"Journal of Materials Science: Materials in Electronics","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-11T02:45:15Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Enes Nayman"],"o":"日常","zt":"PES织物上通过溶胶-凝胶法制备的Ni掺杂ZnO和Zn掺杂NiO薄膜的氨气传感与电磁屏蔽特性","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/cctc.71144","t":"Electrocatalytic Dilute Nitric Oxide Reduction to Ammonia: From Interfacial Regulation to Reactor Engineering","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cctc.71144","s":"ChemCatChem","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-06T17:58:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Nitric oxide (NO), a major atmospheric pollutant emitted from fossil‐fuel combustion and industrial processes, poses serious risks to both ecosystems and human health. At the same time, ammonia (NH 3 ) is an essential chemical feedstock and energy carrier, although its conventional production relies on energy‐intensive Haber–Bosch synthesis. Compared with nitrogen reduction, nitric oxide reduction reaction (NORR) benefits from the intrinsic reactivity and higher solubility of NO molecules. However, achieving efficient and selective NO‐to‐NH 3 conversion remains challenging due to complex reaction pathways, competitive hydrogen evolution, and limited NO availability under ppm‐scale dilute feeds relevant to practical environments. In this review, we provide an overview of recent progress in NORR, covering mechanistic understanding, catalyst design, electrolyte engineering, and rea","au":["Zi‐Han Zhang","Bei Wu","Wan‐Ying Luo","Yao‐Yin Lou"],"o":"日常","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"电催化稀硝酸氧化物还原到氨：从界面调控到反应器工程","zb":"一氧化氮（NO）是化石燃料燃烧和工业过程中排放的主要大气污染物，对生态系统和人类健康构成严重风险。同时，氨（NH3）是一种重要的化学原料和能源载体，尽管其传统生产依赖于能耗高的哈伯-博施合成。与氮还原相比，一氧化氮还原反应（NORR）受益于 NO 分子的固有反应性和更高的溶解度。然而，由于复杂的反应路径、竞争性的析氢反应以及在实际环境中与 ppm 尺度稀释原料相关的有限 NO 可用性，实现高效和选择性的 NO 到 NH3 转化仍然具有挑战性。在本综述中，我们概述了 NORR 的最新进展，涵盖了机理理解、催化剂设计、电解质工程和反应器优化。特别关注调节界面微环境和在环境相关的 ppm 尺度 NO 条件下提高性能的策略。最后，我们讨论了仍然阻碍实际应用的主要障碍，并概述了开发高效和可扩展的 NORR 系统以实现实际 NO 治理和可持续 NH3 电合成的未来方向。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/asia.71047","t":"Electronic Effect and Key Intermediates in Electrochemical Ammonia Oxidation With Mn–Salen Complexes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/asia.71047","s":"Chemistry – An Asian Journal","d":"2026-11","f":"2026-11-08T17:04:56Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Ammonia (NH 3 ) has emerged as a promising carbon‐free fuel and hydrogen carrier, offering a potential solution to meet growing global energy demands. In this study, we investigate the role of ligand electronic effects in a series of Mn–salen electrocatalysts for the ammonia oxidation reaction (AOR) in nonaqueous media. Our results reveal that electron‐withdrawing substituents promote an earlier onset potential and enhanced catalytic activity. A high‐valent nitrido‐manganese (V) salen species is identified as a key reaction intermediate through mass spectrometry during electrolysis, which undergoes nucleophilic attack by NH 3 under oxidative conditions to produce nitrogen (N 2 ). We also examined how solvent and electron‐transfer redox mediators affect the reaction. While the solvent shows no significant impact on catalytic performance, the use of a mediator markedly enhances re","au":["Akanksha Negi","Anindita Bhar","Shiwangi Singh","Biswajit Mondal"],"o":"日常","zt":"配体电子效应对 Mn–Salen 配合物电化学氨氧化反应中的电子效应和关键中间体的研究","zb":"研究对象为非水介质中 Mn–Salen 电催化剂对氨氧化反应 (AOR) 的催化性能。通过质谱分析电解过程中的高价氮-锰 (V) salen 物种作为关键反应中间体，发现吸电子取代基促进起始电位降低和催化活性增强。溶剂和电子转移氧化还原介质对反应有影响，其中介质显著提高反应动力学。在水中 AOR 表现出 1.65 V 的起始电位，以及 93.6% ± 4.5% 的 N2 选择性和 98.9% ± 1.7% 的 H2 选择性。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"}]);
